s=\"true\">I reoli\'ch defaid defnyddiwch ein <a href=\"/app/sheep\">gwasanaeth Defaid</a> presennol, neu i reoli\'ch gwartheg defnyddiwch ein <a href=\"/app/cattle\">gwasanaeth Gwartheg</a> newydd.</span></p>\n<p><span data-teams=\"true\"><br />Os ydych chi\'n filfeddyg neu\'n dechnegydd labordy, yna gallwch gael mynediad at <a href=\"/app/bvd\">BVDCymru</a></span></p>\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<div id=\"services-container\" class=\"services-container\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Gwasanaethau','','publish','closed','closed','','gwasanaethau','','','2026-07-31 13:30:09','2026-07-31 13:30:09','',20,'http://localhost:8081/?page_id=66',0,'page','',0),(67,3,'2026-02-27 15:58:02','2026-02-27 15:58:02','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Welsh placeholder</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Gwasanaethau','','inherit','closed','closed','','66-revision-v1','','','2026-02-27 15:58:02','2026-02-27 15:58:02','',66,'http://localhost:8081/?p=67',0,'revision','',0),(69,3,'2026-02-27 16:45:51','2026-02-27 16:45:51','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Placeholder</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:eidcymru/services-block /-->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Services','','inherit','closed','closed','','64-revision-v1','','','2026-02-27 16:45:51','2026-02-27 16:45:51','',64,'http://localhost:8081/?p=69',0,'revision','',0),(71,3,'2026-02-27 16:52:42','2026-02-27 16:52:42','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Placeholder</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:eidcymru/services-block /-->\n\n<!-- wp:eidcymru/services-block {\"cards\":[{\"title\":\"jlkj\",\"subtitle\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"\",\"subtitle\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"\",\"subtitle\":\"\"}]} /-->','Services','','inherit','closed','closed','','64-revision-v1','','','2026-02-27 16:52:42','2026-02-27 16:52:42','',64,'http://localhost:8081/?p=71',0,'revision','',0),(72,3,'2026-03-02 11:15:03','2026-03-02 11:15:03','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Placeholder</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Servi