tails class=\"eidcymru-video-block__transcript-wrapper\"><summary class=\"eidcymru-video-block__transcript-summary\">Read video transcript</summary><div class=\"eidcymru-video-block__transcript-content\">A dummy video for youtube</div></details></div>\n<!-- /wp:eidcymru/eidcymru-video -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<div id=\"eidcymru-msw-servicebanner-container\" class=\"eidcymru-msw-servicebanner-container\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->','Farming post 2','My excerpt here...','inherit','closed','closed','','108-revision-v1','','','2026-03-09 14:20:55','2026-03-09 14:20:55','',108,'http://localhost:8081/?p=142',0,'revision','',0),(143,3,'2026-03-10 08:32:46','2026-03-10 08:32:46','<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"66.66%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\"><!-- wp:freeform -->\n<h1>Downloads</h1>\n<p>Report animal movements online using our services. If you chose to report your animal movements by paper you can download and print blank forms below.</p>\n<div id=\"document-download-container\"> </div>\n<h2>Details</h2>\n<p>If you would like a paper copies of the AML1 forms, please contact EIDCymru with your name, address and how many you require:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>e-mail - contact@eidcymru.org</li>\n<li>phone - 01970 636959</li>\n<li>EIDCymru – contact form</li>\n</ul>\n<p>and they will post them out to you.</p>\n<p>Alternatively, if you have bought sheep or goats from a market, you can confirm the movement on EIDCymru online. The market will have created the movement for you – all you need to do is log onto EIDCymru and accept it.</p>\n<p>If you are unable to use EIDCymru online and need to send a copy of the licence to EIDCymru please make sure you:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>sign and date the licence</li>\n<li>ensure the tag list is attached</li>\n<li>be content the tag numbers correspond to the animals you have.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>All sheep and goat movement records can be checked for accuracy on your Movement Records on EIDCymru online.</p>\n<!-- /wp:freeform --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"33.33%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:33.33%\"><!-- wp:html -->\n<div id=\"related-content-container\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:html --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Downloads','','publish','closed','closed','','downloads','','','2026-04-10 08:15:47','2026-04-10 08:15:47','',93,'http://localhost:8081/?page_id=143',0,'page','',0),(144,3,'2026-03-10 08:30:58','2026-03-10 08:30:58','<h1>Downloads</h1>\nReport animal movements online using our services. If you chose to report your animal movements by paper you can download and print blank forms below.','Downloads','','inherit','closed','closed','','143-revision-v1','','','2026-03-10 08:30:58','2026-03-10 08:30:58','',143,'http://localhost:8081/?p=144',0,'revision','',0),(145,3,'2026-03-10 08:32:46','2026-03-10 08:32:46','<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"66.66%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\"><!-- wp:freeform -->\n<p>Downloads</p>\n<p>Report animal movements online using our services. If you chose to report your animal movements by paper you can download and print blank forms below.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<!-- /wp:freeform --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"33.33%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:33.33%\"><!-- wp:html -->\n<div id=\"related-content-container\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:html --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Downloads','','inherit','closed','closed','','143-revision-v1','','','2026-03-10 08:32:46','2026-03-10 08:32:46','',143,'http://localhost:8081/?p=145',0,'revision','',0),(146,3,'2026-03-10 08:34:05','2026-03-10 08:34:05','<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"66.66%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\"><!-- wp:freeform -->\n<h1>Lawrlwytho</h1>\n<p>Rhowch wybod am symudiadau anifeiliaid ar-lein gan ddefnyddio ein gwasanaethau. Os ydych wedi dewis rhoi gwybod am symudiadau eich anifeiliaid ar bapur, gallwch lawrlwytho ac argraffu ffurflenni gwag isod</p>\n<div id=\"document-download-container\"> </div>\n<h2>Manylion</h2>\n<p>Os hoffech gopïau papur o\'r ffurflenni AML1, cysylltwch ag EIDCymru gyda\'ch enw, cyfeiriad a faint sydd eu hangen arnoch:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>e-mail - contact@eidcymru.org</li>\n<li>phone - 01970 636959</li>\n<li>EIDCymru – Ffurflen Gyswllt</li>\n</ul>\n<p>a byddant yn eu postio allan i chi.</p>\n<p>Fel arall, os ydych chi wedi prynu defaid neu eifr o farchnad, gallwch gadarnhau\'r symudiad ar EIDCymru ar-lein. Bydd y farchnad wedi creu\'r symudiad i chi – y cyfan sydd angen i chi ei wneud yw mewngofnodi i EIDCymru a\'i dderbyn.</p>\n<p>Os na allwch ddefnyddio EIDCymru ar-lein ac os oes angen i chi anfon copi o\'r drwydded at EIDCymru, gwnewch yn siŵr eich bod yn:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>llofnodi a dyddio\'r drwydded</li>\n<li>sicrhau bod y rhestr tagiau ynghlwm</li>\n<li>gwnewch yn siwr bod y rhifau tag yn cyfateb i\'r anifeiliaid sydd gennych.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Gellir gwirio cywirdeb pob cofnod symud defaid a geifr ar eich Cofnodion Symud ar EIDCymru ar-lein.</p>\n<!-- /wp:freeform --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"33.33%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:33.33%\"><!-- wp:html -->\n<div id=\"related-content-container\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:html --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Lawrlwytho','','publish','closed','closed','','lawrlwythiadau','','','2026-04-10 08:15:50','2026-04-10 08:15:50','',95,'http://localhost:8081/?page_id=146',0,'page','',0),(147,3,'2026-03-10 08:33:24','2026-03-10 08:33:24','<!-- wp:page-list /-->','Navigation','','publis