','',0),(184,3,'2026-04-10 07:58:12','2026-04-10 07:58:12','<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"66.66%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\"><!-- wp:freeform -->\n<h1>Gwybodaeth</h1>\n<p>Mae EIDCymru yn cynnig tri gwasanaeth; i reoli eich defaid, defnyddiwch ein gwasanaeth defaid presennol, neu i reoli\'ch gwartheg defnyddiwch ein gwasanaeth aml-rywogaeth newydd Cymru. Os ydych chi\'n filfeddyg neu\'n dechnegydd labordy, yna gallwch gael mynediad i\'n gwasanaeth BVDCymru</p>\n<!-- /wp:freeform --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"33.33%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:33.33%\"><!-- wp:html -->\n<div id=\"related-content-container\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:html --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->','Gwybodaeth','','inherit','closed','closed','','95-revision-v1','','','2026-04-10 07:58:12','2026-04-10 07:58:12','',95,'http://localhost:8081/?p=184',0,'revision','',0),(186,3,'2026-04-10 08:01:07','2026-04-10 08:01:07','<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"66.66%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\"><!-- wp:freeform -->\n<h1>Gwybodaeth</h1>\n<p>Mae EIDCymru yn cynnig tri gwasanaeth; i reoli eich defaid, defnyddiwch ein gwasanaeth defaid presennol, neu i reoli\'ch gwartheg defnyddiwch ein gwasanaeth aml-rywogaeth newydd Cymru. Os ydych chi\'n filfeddyg neu\'n dechnegydd labordy, yna gallwch gael mynediad i\'n gwasanaeth BVDCymru</p>\n<h3>Lawrlwythiadau</h3>\n<p>Rhowch wybod am symudiadau anifeiliaid ar-lein gan ddefnyddio ein gwasanaethau. Os gwnaethoch ddewis rhoi gwybod am symudiadau eich anifeiliaid ar bapur, gallwch lawrlwytho ffurflenni yma</p>\n<h3>Canllawiau a Chwestiynau Cyffredin</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Canllaw cofrestru EIDCymru</li>\n<li>Canllaw Defnyddiwr EIDCymru</li>\n<li>Cwestiynau cyffredin</li>\n<li>Cwestiynau Cyffredin Rhestr Flynyddol</li>\n</ul>\n<p> </p>\n<h3>Cadw, tagio ac adnabod eich anifeiliaid</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Canllawiau Ceidwaid Defaid a Geifr 2021</li>\n<li>Ceidwaid Ceirw: tagio ceirw a rhoi gwybod am eu symudiadau</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Os oes gennych unrhyw gwestiynau cysylltwch ag EIDCymru ar 01970 636 959 neu cymorth@eidcymru.org</p>\n<p> </p>\n<!-- /wp:freeform --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"33.33%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:33.33%\"><!-- wp:html -->\n<div id=\"related-content-container\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:html --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->','Gwybodaeth','','inherit','closed','closed','','95-revision-v1','','','2026-04-10 08:01:07','2026-04-10 08:01:07','',95,'http://localhost:8081/?p=186',0,'revision','',0),(187,3,'2026-04-10 08:02:35','2026-04-10 08:02:35','<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"66.66%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\"><!-- wp:freeform -->\n<h1>Gwybodaeth</h1>\n<p>Mae EIDCymru yn cynnig tri gwasanaeth; i reoli eich defaid, defnyddiwch ein gwasanaeth defaid presennol, neu i reoli\'ch gwartheg defnyddiwch ein gwasanaeth aml-rywogaeth newydd Cymru. Os ydych chi\'n filfeddyg neu\'n dechnegydd labordy, yna gallwch gael mynediad i\'n gwasanaeth BVDCymru</p>\n<h3>Lawrlwytho</h3>\n<p>Rhowch wybod am symudiadau anifeiliaid ar-lein gan ddefnyddio ein gwasanaethau. Os gwnaethoch ddewis rhoi gwybod am symudiadau eich anifeiliaid ar bapur, gallwch lawrlwytho ffurflenni yma</p>\n<h3>Canllawiau a Chwestiynau Cyffredin</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Canllaw cofrestru EIDCymru</li>\n<li>Canllaw Defnyddiwr EIDCymru</li>\n<li>Cwestiynau cyffredin</li>\n<li>Cwestiynau Cyffredin Rhestr Flynyddol</li>\n</ul>\n<p> </p>\n<h3>Cadw, tagio ac adnabod eich anifeiliaid</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Canllawiau Ceidwaid Defaid a Geifr 2021</li>\n<li>Ceidwaid Ceirw: tagio ceirw a rhoi gwybod am eu symudiadau</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Os oes gennych unrhyw gwestiynau cysylltwch ag EIDCymru ar 01970 636 959 neu cymorth@eidcymru.org</p>\n<p> </p>\n<!-- /wp:freeform --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"33.33%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:33.33%\"><!-- wp:html -->\n<div id=\"related-content-container\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:html --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->','Gwybodaeth','','inherit','closed','closed','','95-revision-v1','','','2026-04-10 08:02:35','2026-04-10 08:02:35','',95,'http://localhost:8081/?p=187',0,'revision','',0),(189,3,'2026-04-10 08:05:53','2026-04-10 08:05:53','<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"66.66%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\"><!-- wp:freeform -->\n<h1>Lawrlwytho</h1>\n<p>Rhowch wybod am symudiadau anifeiliaid ar-lein gan ddefnyddio ein gwasanaethau. Os ydych wedi dewis rhoi gwybod am symudiadau eich anifeiliaid ar bapur, gallwch lawrlwytho ac argraffu ffurflenni gwag isod</p>\n<div id=\"document-download-container\"> </div>\n<h2>Manylion</h2>\n<p>Os hoffech gopïau papur o\'r ffurflenni AML1, cysylltwch ag EIDCymru gyda\'ch enw, cyfeiriad a faint sydd eu hangen arnoch:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>e-mail - contact@eidcymru.org</li>\n<li>phone - 01970 636959</li>\n<li>EIDCymru – Ffurflen Gyswllt</li>\n</ul>\n<p>a byddant yn eu postio allan i chi.</p>\n<p>Fel arall, os ydych chi wedi prynu defaid neu eifr o farchnad, gallwch gadarnhau\'r symudiad ar EIDCymru ar-lein. Bydd y farchnad wedi creu\'r symudiad i chi – y cyfan sydd angen i chi ei wneud yw mewngofnodi i EIDCymru a\'i dderbyn.</p>\n<p>Os na allwch ddefnyddio EIDCymru ar-lein ac os oes angen i chi anfon copi o\'r drwydded at EIDCymru, gwnewch yn siŵr eich bod yn:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>llofnodi a dyddio\'r drwydded</li>\n<li>sicrhau bod y rhestr tagiau ynghlwm</li>\n<li>gwnewch yn siwr bod y rhifau tag yn cyfateb i\'r anifeiliaid sydd gennych.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Gellir gwirio cywirdeb pob cofnod symud defaid a geifr ar eich Cofnodion Symud ar EIDCymru ar-lein.</p>\n<!-- /wp:freeform --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"33.33%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:33.33%\"><!-- wp:html -->\n<div id=\"related-content-container\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:html --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Lawrlwytho','','inherit','closed','closed','','146-revision-v1','','','2026-04-10 08:05:53','2026-04-10 08:05:53','',146,'http://localhost:8081/?p=189',0,'revision','',0),(190,3,'2026-04-28 08:55:57','2026-04-28 08:55:57','<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"66.66%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\"><!-- wp:freeform -->\n<h1 id=\"Topics\">EIDCymru User guide</h1>\n<p><strong>Choose a topic from the list below to get easy step-by-step instructions:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Step 1 <a href=\"#Create\"><strong>Register for an account</strong></a></li>\n<li>Step 2 <a href=\"#Login\"><strong>Log in to EIDCymru</strong></a></li>\n<li>Step 3 <a href=\"#Accept\"><strong>Accepting a movement</strong></a></li>\n<li>Step 4 <a href=\"#Report\"><strong>Reporting a movement</strong></a></li>\n<li>Step 5 <a href=\"#Tags\"><strong>Enter tag details</strong></a></li>\n<li>Step 6 <a href=\"#Records\"><strong>Movement records</strong></a></li>\n<li>Step 7 <a href=\"#Returns\"><strong>Return or forward a movement</strong></a></li>\n<li>Step 8 <a href=\"#Account\"><strong>Your account</strong></a></li>\n</ul>\n<p id=\"Create\"><strong>Step 1 - Register for an account</strong></p>\n<p><strong>To register for an account with EIDCymru you will need:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>your contact details - email address, contact address and telephone numbers</li>\n<li>the CPH number of your main holding</li>\n<li>your CRN (Customer Reference Number), this is issued by <a href=\"https://www.gov.wales/rural-payments-wales-rpw-online\">Rural Payments Wales</a> (RPW), Phone: <a href=\"tel:+443000625004\">0300 062 5004</a></li>\n<li>a Flock / Herd number for your main holding, provided by <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/guidance/get-help-with-animal-and-plant-health\">Animal Plant Health Agency (APHA)</a> Phone: <a href=\"tel:+4403003038268\">0300 303 8268</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Go to the EIDCymru website </strong><a href=\"http://www.eidcymru.org/\"><strong>www.eidcymru.org</strong></a><strong> choose your language, click on the Register link on the next page and follow these steps:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Enter your details, choose a unique username (this will be shown on your movement records, and seen by others) and a strong password.</li>\n<li>Tell us the details of your main CPH in the correct format e.g. 11/222/3333. Also tell us the CRN associated with this CPH.</li>\n<li>Select your main species - choose sheep, goats or deer, and tell us your main flock / herd number.</li>\n<li>Check that the details on the summary page are correct before selecting Create your EIDCymru Account.</li>\n<li>Check your email, we will have sent you an email to verify your email address, click on the link provided.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>If you need further help, look at the Help &amp; Information section on the top toolbar of the website, or contact EIDCymru on <a href=\"tel:+4401970636959\">01970 636 959</a> or email <a href=\"mailto:contact@eidcymru.org\">contact@eidcymru.org</a>.</p>\n<p><a href=\"#Topics\"><strong>Return to menu</strong></a></p>\n<p id=\"Login\"><strong>Step 2 - Login to EIDCymru</strong></p>\n<p><strong>The first page you will see is the Dashboard. The Dashboard can be considered the homepage of your EIDCymru account - from here you can navigate to all of its available functions:</strong></p>\n<p>The Dashboard options allow you to:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>create your own movements</li>\n<li>accept movements created on your behalf by other Keepers or by a Livestock Market</li>\n<li>view a record of movements reported electronically</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The Dashboard also lets you Set up a Movement for a future planned movement up to 3 days ahead.</p>\n<p>You can also Report a Movement that has already taken place, for either animals which have left or arrived at your holding. (See Step 4)</p>\n<p>If you start a movement but do not have all the information available at the time, the part-completed movement will remain in your Draft Movements for you to complete at a later stage. Movements saved to Draft will remain for 30 days after which they will be deleted automatically.</p>\n<p>From the Dashboard you can also Accept Movements onto your holding. (See Step 3)</p>\n<p><a href=\"#Topics\"><strong>Return to menu</strong></a></p>\n<p id=\"Accept\"><strong>Step 3 - Accepting a Movement</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Livestock Markets produce a movement licence for Keepers to accompany animals to the destination. The movement is created in EIDCymru waiting to be accepted by you the Keeper. From your online EIDCymru Dashboard use the Accept Movements feature to check and accept the movements.</strong></p>\n<p>If you have movements waiting to be accepted, the number outstanding will show on your Dashboard against Accept Movements. Movement should be accepted within 3 days of the movement. The option will also be coloured Green or Red. The colour Red indicates they are late i.e. over 3 days old but still require to be accepted.</p>\n<p>By selecting Accept Movements you can verify the animals reported onto your holding against the Licence provided by the Livestock Market. You need to accept, reject or query the entire movement, or any individual animals shown that do not match your records.</p>\n<p>When you Accept the movement on your EIDCymru account, you do not need to send the paper licence into EIDCymru. Once accepted, the movement will then appear within the Movement Records of your EIDCymru account.</p>\n<p><a href=\"#Topics\"><strong>Return to menu</strong></a></p>\n<p id=\"Report\"><strong>Step 4 - Reporting a Movement</strong></p>\n<p><strong>There are two ways that you can create a movement in EIDCymru:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>You can set up a Movement for a future planned movement up to 3 days ahead.</li>\n<li>You can Report a Movement that has already taken place, for animals which have either left or arrived at your holding.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>If you have ear tag numbers which have been read electronically, the tag numbers can be inputted into the movement as a file upload. There are other options to enter ear tag numbers as Flock/Slaughter tags and also individually or as groups within a specific range</p>\n<p>Wider industry legislation information such as Transport details and FCI (Food Chain Information) can be inputted when you report a movement electronically.</p>\n<p>Remember, reporting a movement via EIDCymru replaces the need to complete an AML1 Form. Once the move has been created, there are options to view and print the information as a paper licence.</p>\n<p>It is possible to print multiple copies for you own records and to accompany the animals to their Destination. Once reported, the movement will appear within the Movement Records of your EIDCymru account.</p>\n<p><a href=\"#Topics\"><strong>Return to menu</strong></a></p>\n<p id=\"Tags\"><strong>Step 5 - Enter Tag Details</strong></p>\n<p><strong>There are several ways that you can report the tag numbers of the animals that are arriving or departing:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Individual Tags - Tell us the Tag prefix e.g. UK, the 6-digit flock number and the individual ID.</li>\n<li>Tag Range - This can be used for entering a range of tag numbers, where you know the animals have been tagged in order. You just need to provide the start and end number. You are able to exclude certain Tag Numbers.</li>\n<li>Slaughter Tags - For animal which have been slaughter tagged, tell us the Prefix (eg UK) the 6 digit flock number and the quantity of animals moving.</li>\n<li>Upload tags via a file. Tags recorded on an EID reader can be uploaded to the EIDCymru website. By following the instructions which come with your EID reader, you should be able to produce a text or csv file. This can be uploaded to the movement from the Animals page when creating your movement.</li>\n<li>Freestyle tags - this allows you to input a tag number of an animal which is not EID tagged. Given that all recent animal identification regulations have required animals to be tagged with an EID tag, this would typically be reserved for animals which were born and tagged pre-2010.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"#Topics\"><strong>Return to menu</strong></a></p>\n<p id=\"Records\"><strong>Step 6 - Movement Records</strong></p>\n<p><strong>View all of your on / off movements, send us a query on a movement and print out any movements for your records.</strong></p>\n<p>All movements reported against your holding will show in Movement Records. For example, when you send animals to a market, details sent to EIDCymru by them will automatically display in your Movement Records, as will paper licences sent to the EIDCymru office.</p>\n<p>The Movement Records page allows you to filter and sort your movements. You can enter a date range or filter a specific CPH from where animals were moved to or from. You can also filter by Species.</p>\n<p>You can use the EIDCymru Movement Records option to ensure the accuracy and completeness of your holding register. You are able to request a correction to any information that has been recorded via a query by opening the movement and selecting Query.</p>\n<p><a href=\"#Topics\"><strong>Return to menu</strong></a></p>\n<p id=\"Returns\"><strong>Step 7 - Return or Forward a Movement</strong></p>\n<p>Within a movement showing in Movement Records, it is possible to \'Return\' a movement - this can create a copy of a movement going in the opposite direction. For example when animals return from Tack. The tag numbers and quantities have already been captured therefore \'returning\' a movement can save a lot of time.</p>\n<p>Within a movement showing in Movement Records, it is possible to \'Forward\' a movement - this can create a copy of a movement which starts on from the last destination. The tag numbers and quantities have already been captured, so using the Forward movement function can save a lot of time.</p>\n<p><a href=\"#Topics\"><strong>Return to menu</strong></a></p>\n<p id=\"Account\"><strong>Step 8 - Your Account</strong></p>\n<p><strong>This sections contains all the important information that we need, it also lets you do the following:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Change your details</strong><br />If you need to update the information you gave us when you registered, you can do this here. For example, you can change your username, email address, contact details and your CRN number.</li>\n<li><strong>Change your password</strong><br />If you need to change your password you can do this here. Remember to make a strong password - at least 12 characters, lowercase and uppercase, numbers and punctuation.</li>\n<li><strong>Default options</strong><br />Amend your default options, these are the settings the system will remember when you set up a move, e.g. a default vehicle registration number, they can be change when you report the move.</li>\n<li><strong>View and amend your holdings</strong><br />Add, edit and delete your flock numbers and tell us which holding is your primary holding.</li>\n<li><strong>View and complete your Annual Inventory.</strong><br />The Sheep and Goats Annual Inventory is used to record the number of sheep and goats that you keep on individual premises and the reason they are kept e.g. meat, dairy, wool, breeding etc. View past inventories here and complete yours before the deadline.</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- /wp:freeform --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"33.33%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:33.33%\"><!-- wp:html -->\n<div id=\"related-content-container\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:html --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','User guide','','publish','closed','closed','','user-guide','','','2026-04-28 10:20:24','2026-04-28 10:20:24','',93,'http://localhost:8081/?page_id=190',0,'page','',0),(191,3,'2026-04-28 08:55:57','2026-04-28 08:55:57','<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"66.66%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\"><!-- wp:freeform -->\n<p>User guide</p>\n<p> </p>\n<!-- /wp:freeform --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"33.33%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:33.33%\"><!-- wp:html -->\n<div id=\"related-content-container\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:html --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','User guide','','inherit','closed','closed','','190-revision-v1','','','2026-04-28 08:55:57','2026-04-28 08:55:57','',190,'http://localhost:8081/?p=191',0,'revision','',0),(192,3,'2026-04-28 08:57:41','2026-04-28 08:57:41','<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"66.66%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\"><!-- wp:freeform -->\n<h1><strong>EIDCymru User guide</strong></h1>\n<p><strong>Choose a topic from the list below to get easy step-by-step instructions:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Step 1     <a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/userguide#Create\"><strong>Register for an account</strong></a></li>\n<li>Step 2     <a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/userguide#Login\"><strong>Log in to EIDCymru</strong></a></li>\n<li>Step 3     <a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/userguide#Accept\"><strong>Accepting a movement</strong></a></li>\n<li>Step 4     <a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/u