t as a file upload. There are other options to enter ear tag numbers as Flock/Slaughter tags and also individually or as groups within a specific range</p>\n<p>Wider industry legislation information such as Transport details and FCI (Food Chain Information) can be inputted when you report a movement electronically.</p>\n<p>Remember, reporting a movement via EIDCymru replaces the need to complete an AML1 Form. Once the move has been created, there are options to view and print the information as a paper licence.</p>\n<p>It is possible to print multiple copies for you own records and to accompany the animals to their Destination. Once reported, the movement will appear within the Movement Records of your EIDCymru account.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/&amp;/app/sheep-servicesquot;#Topics%22\"><strong>Return to menu</strong></a></p>\n<p><br /><br /></p>\n<p><strong>Step 5 - Enter Tag Details</strong></p>\n<p><strong>There are several ways that you can report the tag numbers of the animals that are arriving or departing:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Individual Tags - Tell us the Tag prefix e.g. UK, the 6-digit flock number and the individual ID.</li>\n<li>Tag Range - This can be used for entering a range of tag numbers, where you know the animals have been tagged in order. You just need to provide the start and end number. You are able to exclude certain Tag Numbers.</li>\n<li>Slaughter Tags - For animal which have been slaughter tagged, tell us the Prefix ( eg UK ) the 6 digit flock number and the quantity of animals moving.</li>\n<li>Upload tags via a file. Tags recorded on an EID reader can be uploaded to the EIDCymru website.  By following the instructions which come with your EID reader, you should be able to produce a text or csv file. This can be uploaded to the movement from the Animals page when creating your movement.</li>\n<li>Freestyle tags – this allows you to input a tag number of an animal which is not EID tagged. Given that all recent animal identification regulations have required animals to be tagged with an EID tag, this would typically be reserved for animals which were born and tagged pre-2010.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/&amp;/app/sheep-servicesquot;#Topics%22\"><strong>Return to menu</strong></a></p>\n<p><br /><br /></p>\n<p><strong>Step 6 - Movement Records</strong></p>\n<p><strong>View all of your on / off movements, send us a query on a movement and print out any movements for your records.</strong></p>\n<p>All movements reported against your holding will show in Movement Records. For example, when you send animals to a market, details sent to EIDCymru by them will automatically display in your Movement Records, as will paper licences sent to the EIDCymru office.</p>\n<p>The Movement Records page allows you to filter and sort your movements. You can enter a date range or filter a specific CPH from where animals were moved to or from. You can also filter by Species.</p>\n<p>You can use the EIDCymru Movement Records option to ensure the accuracy and completeness of your holding register. You are able to request a correction to any information that has been recorded via a query by opening the movement and selecting Query.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/&amp;/app/sheep-servicesquot;#Topics%22\"><strong>Return to menu</strong></a></p>\n<p><br /><br /></p>\n<p><strong>Step 7 - Return or Forward a Movement</strong></p>\n<p>Within a movement showing in Movement Records, it is possible to ‘Return’ a movement - this can create a copy of a movement going in the opposite direction. For example when animals return from Tack. The tag numbers and quantities have already been captured therefore ‘returning’ a movement can save a lot of time.</p>\n<p>Within a movement showing in Movement Records, it is possible to ‘Forward’ a movement - this can create a copy of a movement which starts on from the last destination. The tag numbers and quantities have already been captured, so using the Forward movement function can save a lot of time.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/&amp;/app/sheep-servicesquot;#Topics%22\"><strong>Return to menu</strong></a></p>\n<p><br /><br /></p>\n<p><strong>Step 8 - Your Account</strong></p>\n<p><strong>This sections contains all the important information that we need, it also lets you do the following:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Change your details</strong><br />If you need to update the information you gave us when you registered, you can do this here. For example, you can change your username, email address, contact details and your CRN number.</li>\n<li><strong>Change your password</strong><br />If you need to change your password you can do this here. Remember to make a strong password - at least 12 characters, lowercase and uppercase, numbers and punctuation.</li>\n<li><strong>Default options</strong><br />Amend your default options, these are the settings the system will remember when you set up a move, e.g. a default vehicle registration number, they can be change when you report the move.</li>\n<li><strong>View and amend your holdings</strong><br />Add, edit and delete your flock numbers and tell us which holding is your primary holding.</li>\n<li><strong>View and complete your Annual Inventory.</strong><br />The Sheep and Goats Annual Inventory is used to record the number of sheep and goats that you keep on individual premises and the reason they are kept e.g. meat, dairy, wool, breeding etc. View past inventories here and complete yours before the deadline.</li>\n</ul>\n<p> </p>\n<!-- /wp:freeform --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"33.33%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:33.33%\"><!-- wp:html -->\n<div id=\"related-content-container\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:html --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','User guide','','inherit','closed','closed','','190-revision-v1','','','2026-04-28 08:57:41','2026-04-28 08:57:41','',190,'http://localhost:8081/?p=192',0,'revision','',0),(193,3,'2026-04-28 09:00:32','2026-04-28 09:00:32','<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"66.66%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\"><!-- wp:freeform -->\n<h1 id=\"Topics\"><strong>Canllaw i ddefnyddwyr EIDCymru</strong></h1>\n<p><strong>Dewiswch bwnc o’r rhestr isod i gael cyfarwyddiadau cam wrth gam hawdd:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Cam 1 <a href=\"#Create\"><strong>Cofrestru ar gyfer cyfrif</strong></a></li>\n<li>Cam 2 <a href=\"#Login\"><strong>Mewngofnodi i EIDCymru</strong></a></li>\n<li>Cam 3 <a href=\"#Accept\"><strong>Derbyn symudiad</strong></a></li>\n<li>Cam 4 <a href=\"#Report\"><strong>Rhoi gwybod am symudiad</strong></a></li>\n<li>Cam 5 <a href=\"#Tags\"><strong>Rhoi manylion tag</strong></a></li>\n<li>Cam 6 <a href=\"#Records\"><strong>Cofnodion symudiadau</strong></a></li>\n<li>Cam 7 <a href=\"#Returns\"><strong>Dychwelyd neu anfon symudiad ymlaen</strong></a></li>\n<li>Cam 8 <a href=\"#Account\"><strong>Eich cyfrif</strong></a></li>\n</ul>\n<p id=\"Create\"><strong>Cam 1 - Cofrestru ar gyfer cyfrif</strong></p>\n<p><strong>I gofrestru ar gyfer cyfrif gydag EIDCymru bydd angen y canlynol arnoch:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>eich manylion cyswllt - cyfeiriad e-bost, cyfeiriad a rhifau ffôn</li>\n<li>rhif Daliad (CPH) eich prif ddaliad</li>\n<li>eich Cyfeirnod Cwsmer (CRN). Cyhoeddir hwn gan <a href=\"https://llyw.cymru/taliadau-gwledig-cymru-ar-lein\">Taliadau Gwledig Cymru (RPW)</a>, Ffôn:<a href=\"tel:+443000625004\"> 0300 062 5004</a></li>\n<li>eich rhif Diadell / Buches ar gyfer eich prif ddaliad, a ddarperir gan yr <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/guidance/get-help-with-animal-and-plant-health.cy\">Asiantaeth Anifeiliaid a Phlanhigion (APHA)</a> Ffôn: <a href=\"tel:+4403003038268\">0300 303 8268</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Ewch i wefan EIDCymru </strong><a href=\"http://www.eidcymru.org/\">www.eidcymru.org</a><strong> – dewiswch eich iaith a chliciwch ar y ddolen Cofrestru ar y dudalen ganlynol.</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Rhowch eich manylion - dewiswch enw defnyddiwr unigryw (bydd hyn yn cael ei ddangos ar eich cofnodion symud, a bydd yn cael ei weld gan eraill) a chyfrinair cryf.</li>\n<li>Dywedwch wrthym fanylion eich prif ddaliad yn y fformat cywir e.e. 11/222/3333. Hefyd, dywedwch wrthym y CRN sy’n gysylltiedig â’r CPH hwn.</li>\n<li>Dewiswch eich prif rywogaeth - dewiswch ddefaid, geifr neu geirw, a dywedwch wrthym eich prif rif diadell/buches.</li>\n<li>Gwnewch yn siŵr fod y manylion ar y dudalen grynodeb yn gywir cyn dewis Creu eich Cyfrif EIDCymru.</li>\n<li>Gwiriwch eich e-bost - byddwn wedi anfon e-bost atoch i wneud yn siŵr bod eich cyfeiriad e-bost yn gywir. Cliciwch ar y ddolen a fydd yn yr e-bost.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Os oes angen mwy o gymorth arnoch, edrychwch ar yr adran Cymorth a Gwybodaeth ar y bar offer ar frig y wefan, neu cysylltwch ag EIDCymru ar <a href=\"tel:+4401970636959\">01970 636 959</a> neu e-bostiwch <a href=\"mailto:cymorth@eidcymru.org\">cymorth@eidcymru.org</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"#Topics\"><strong>Dewislen</strong></a></p>\n<p id=\"Login\"><strong>Cam 2 - Mewngofnodi i EIDCymru</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Y dudalen gyntaf a welwch chi yw’r Dangosfwrdd. Gellir ystyried y Dangosfwrdd yn hafan eich cyfrif EIDCymru - o’r fan hon gallwch lywio i’r holl swyddogaethau sydd ar gael:</strong></p>\n<p>Mae’r opsiynau Dangosfwrdd yn eich galluogi i:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>greu eich symudiadau eich hun.</li>\n<li>derbyn symudiadau a grëwyd ar eich rhan gan Geidwaid eraill neu gan Farchnad Da Byw.</li>\n<li>gweld cofnod o’r symudiadau a adroddwyd yn electronig.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Mae’r Dangosfwrdd hefyd yn gadael i chi Greu Symudiad ar gyfer symudiad a gynlluniwyd yn y dyfodol hyd at 3 diwrnod ymlaen llaw.</p>\n<p>Gallwch hefyd Roi Gwybod am Symudiad sydd eisoes wedi digwydd, ar gyfer anifeiliaid sydd wedi gadael neu wedi cyrraedd eich daliad. Gweler Cam 4.</p>\n<p>Os byddwch yn dechrau symudiad ond nad yw’r holl wybodaeth ar gael ar y pryd, bydd y symudiad wedi’i ran-gwblhau yn aros yn eich Symudiadau Drafft i chi eu cwblhau’n ddiweddarach. Bydd symudiadau a arbedir fel Drafft yn parhau am 30 diwrnod ac ar ôl hynny byddant yn cael eu dileu’n awtomatig.</p>\n<p>O’r Dangosfwrdd gallwch hefyd Dderbyn Symudiadau i’ch daliad. Gweler Cam 3 am ragor o wybodaeth.</p>\n<p><a href=\"#Topics\"><strong>Dewislen</strong></a></p>\n<p id=\"Accept\"><strong>Cam 3 - Derbyn Symudiad</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Mae Marchnadoedd Da Byw yn cynhyrchu trwydded symud i Geidwaid fynd gydag anifeiliaid i ben y daith. Mae’r symudiad yn cael ei greu yn EIDCymru ac yn aros i gael eu derbyn gennych chi’r Ceidwad. O’ch Dangosfwrdd EIDCymru ar-lein defnyddiwch Derbyn Symudiadau i wirio a derbyn y symudiadau.</strong></p>\n<p>Os oes gennych symudiadau sy’n aros i gael eu derbyn, bydd y rhif sydd ar ôl yn ymddangos ar eich Dangosfwrdd yn erbyn Derbyn Symudiadau. Dylid derbyn symudiad o fewn 3 diwrnod i’r symudiad. Bydd yr opsiwn hefyd yn cael ei liwio’n Wyrdd neu’n Goch. Mae’r lliw Coch yn dangos eu bod yn hwyr h.y. dros 3 diwrnod oed ond bod angen eu derbyn o hyd.</p>\n<p>Drwy ddewis Derbyn Symudiadau gallwch wirio’r anifeiliaid a adroddwyd ar eich daliad yn erbyn y Drwydded a ddarparwyd gan y Farchnad Da Byw. Mae angen i chi dderbyn, gwrthod neu wneud ymholiad am y symudiad cyfan, neu unrhyw anifeiliaid unigol a ddangosir nad ydynt yn cyfateb i’ch cofnodion chi.</p>\n<p>Pan fyddwch yn Derbyn y symudiad ar eich cyfrif EIDCymru, nid oes angen i chi anfon y drwydded bapur i EIDCymru. Ar ôl ei dderbyn, bydd y symudiad wedyn yn ymddangos o fewn Cofnodion Symud eich cyfrif EIDCymru.</p>\n<p><a href=\"#Topics\"><strong>Dewislen</strong></a></p>\n<p id=\"Report\"><strong>Cam 4 - Rhoi Gwybod am Symudiad</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Mae ddau ffordd y gallwch greu symudiad yn EIDCymru:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Gallwch greu Symudiad ar gyfer symudiad sydd wedi’i gynllunio yn y dyfodol hyd at 3 diwrnod ymlaen llaw.</li>\n<li>Gallwch Roi Gwybod am Symudiad sydd eisoes wedi digwydd, ar gyfer anifeiliaid sydd naill ai wedi gadael neu wedi cyrraedd eich daliad.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Os oes gennych rifau tagiau clust sydd wedi’u darllen yn electronig, gellir mewnbynnu rhifau’r tagiau i’r symudiad drwy uwchlwytho ffeil. Mae opsiynau eraill i nodi rhifau tagiau clust fel tagiau Diadell/Lladd a hefyd yn unigol neu fel grwpiau o fewn cyfres benodol.</p>\n<p>Gellir mewnbynnu gwybodaeth ehangach sydd ynghlwm wrth ddeddfwriaeth y diwydiant megis manylion Cludiant a Gwybodaeth am y Gadwyn Fwyd (FCI) pan fyddwch yn rhoi gwybod am symudiad yn electronig.</p>\n<p>Cofiwch, mae adrodd am symudiad drwy EIDCymru yn disodli’r angen i lenwi Ffurflen AML1. Unwaith y bydd y symudiad wedi’i greu, mae opsiynau i weld ac argraffu’r wybodaeth fel trwydded bapur.</p>\n<p>Mae’n bosibl argraffu nifer o gopïau ar gyfer eich cofnodion eich hun ac i fynd gyda’r anifeiliaid i ben y daith. Ar ôl ei dderbyn, bydd y symudiad yn ymddangos o fewn Cofnodion Symud eich cyfrif EIDCymru.</p>\n<p><a href=\"#Topics\"><strong>Dewislen</strong></a></p>\n<p id=\"Tags\"><strong>Cam 5 - Rhoi Manylion Tagiau</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Mae sawl ffordd y gallwch roi gwybod am rifau tagiau’r anifeiliaid sy’n cyrraedd neu’n gadael:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Tagiau Unigol - Dywedwch wrthym y rhagddodiad Tag ee UK, rhif y ddiadell 6 digid a’r ID unigol.</li>\n<li>Ystod Tagiau - Gellir defnyddio hwn ar gyfer rhoi cyfres o rifau tagiau, lle rydych chi’n gwybod bod yr anifeiliaid wedi’u tagio mewn trefn. Mae angen i chi ddarparu’r rhifau dechrau a gorffen. Gallwch eithrio rhai Rhifau Tagiau.</li>\n<li>Tagiau Lladd - Ar gyfer anifeiliaid sydd wedi’u tagio, dywedwch wrthym y Rhagddodiad ( ee UK ) rhif y ddiadell 6 digid a faint o anifeiliaid sy’n symud.</li>\n<li>Uwchlwytho tagiau mewn ffeil. Gellir uwchlwytho tagiau a recordiwyd ar ddarllenydd EID i wefan EIDCymru. Drwy ddilyn y cyfarwyddiadau sy’n dod gyda’ch darllenydd EID, dylech allu cynhyrchu ffeil destun neu csv. Gellir uwchlwytho hwn i’r symudiad o’r dudalen Anifeiliaid wrth greu eich symudiad.</li>\n<li>Tagiau rhydd – mae hyn yn eich galluogi i fewnbynnu rhif tag anifail nad yw wedi’i dagio gyda thag EID. O ystyried bod yr holl reoliadau adnabod anifeiliaid diweddar wedi ei gwneud yn ofynnol i anifeiliaid gael eu tagio â thag EID, byddai hyn fel arfer yn cael ei gadw ar gyfer anifeiliaid a gafodd eu geni a’u tagio cyn 2010.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"#Topics\"><strong>Dewislen</strong></a></p>\n<p id=\"Records\"><strong>Cam 6 - Cofnodion Symud</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Gweld eich holl symudiadau i mewn / oddi ar ddaliad, anfon ymholiad atom am symudiad ac argraffu unrhyw symudiadau ar gyfer eich cofnodion.</strong></p>\n<p>Bydd yr holl symudiadau a adroddir yn erbyn eich daliad yn ymddangos yn y Cofnodion Symud. Er enghraifft, pan fyddwch yn anfon anifeiliaid i’r farchnad, bydd y manylion y maent yn eu hanfon at EIDCymru yn cael eu harddangos yn awtomatig yn eich Cofnodion Symud, yn ogystal â thrwyddedau papur a anfonir i swyddfa EIDCymru.</p>\n<p>Mae’r dudalen Cofnodion Symud yn caniatáu i chi hidlo a didoli eich symudiadau. Gallwch nodi ystod dyddiad neu hidlo CPH penodol o ble y symudwyd anifeiliaid i mewn iddi neu oddi arno. Gallwch hefyd hidlo yn ôl Rhywogaethau.</p>\n<p>Gallwch ddefnyddio opsiwn Cofnodion Symud EIDCymru i sicrhau cywirdeb a chyflawnrwydd eich cofrestr daliad. Gallwch ofyn am gywiriad i unrhyw wybodaeth sydd wedi’i chofnodi drwy ymholiad drwy agor y symudiad a dewis Ymholiad.</p>\n<p><a href=\"#Topics\"><strong>Dewislen</strong></a></p>\n<p id=\"Returns\"><strong>Cam 7 - Dychwelyd neu Anfon Symudiad Ymlaen</strong></p>\n<p>O fewn symudiad sy’n ymddangos yn eich Cofnodion Symud, mae’n bosibl ’Dychwelyd’ symudiad - gall hyn greu copi o symudiad sy’n mynd i’r cyfeiriad arall. Er enghraifft, pan fydd anifeiliaid yn dychwelyd o Dir pori ar rent. Mae’r rhifau tagiau a’r niferoedd eisoes wedi’u cofnodi felly gall ’dychwelyd’ symudiad arbed llawer o amser.</p>\n<p>O fewn symudiad sy’n ymddangos yn eich Cofnodion Symud, mae’n bosibl anfon symudiad ’Ymlaen’ - gall hyn greu copi o symudiad sy’n dechrau o’r gyrchfan pen y daith ddiwethaf. Mae’r rhifau tagiau a’r niferoedd eisoes wedi’u cofnodi felly gall ’dychwelyd’ symudiad arbed llawer o amser.</p>\n<p id=\"Account\"><strong>Cam 8 - Eich Cyfrif</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Mae’r adrannau hyn yn cynnwys yr holl wybodaeth bwysig sydd ei hangen arnom, mae hefyd yn gadael i chi wneud y canlynol:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Newid eich manylion</strong> - os oes angen i chi ddiweddaru’r wybodaeth a roddoch i ni pan wnaethoch chi gofrestru, gallwch wneud hyn yma. Er enghraifft, gallwch newid eich enw defnyddiwr, cyfeiriad e-bost, manylion cyswllt a’ch rhif CRN.</li>\n<li><strong>Newid eich cyfrinair</strong> - os oes angen i chi newid eich cyfrinair gallwch wneud hyn yma. Cofiwch wneud cyfrinair cryf - o leiaf 12 nod, llythrennau bach a mawr, rhifau ac atalnodi.</li>\n<li><strong>Dewisiadau diofyn</strong> - newid eich opsiynau diofyn, dyma’r gosodiadau y bydd y system yn eu cofio pan fyddwch yn sefydlu symudiad, e.e. rhif cofrestru cerbyd diofyn, gellir eu newid pan fyddwch yn rhoi gwybod am y symudiad.</li>\n<li><strong>Gweld a diwygio eich daliadau</strong> - ychwanegu, golygu a dileu eich rhifau diadell. Dywedwch wrthym ba ddaliad yw eich prif ddaliad yma.</li>\n<li><strong>Gweld a chwblhau eich Rhestr Flynyddol</strong> - defnyddir y Rhestr Flynyddol Defaid a Geifr i gofnodi nifer y defaid a’r geifr yr ydych yn eu cadw ar safleoedd unigol a’r rheswm dros eu cadw e.e. cig, llaeth, gwlân, bridio ac ati. Edrychwch ar restrau’r gorffennol yma a chwblhewch eich Rhestr Flynyddol cyn y dyddiad cau.</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- /wp:freeform --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"33.33%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:33.33%\"><!-- wp:html -->\n<div id=\"related-content-container\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:html --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->','Canllaw i ddefnyddwyr EIDCymru','','publish','closed','closed','','canllaw-i-ddefnyddwyr-eidcymru','','','2026-04-28 10:23:07','2026-04-28 10:23:07','',95,'http://localhost:8081/?page_id=193',0,'page','',0),(194,3,'2026-04-28 09:00:32','2026-04-28 09:00:32','<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"66.66%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\"><!-- wp:freeform -->\n<p><strong>Canllaw i ddefnyddwyr EIDCymru</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Dewiswch bwnc o’r rhestr isod i gael cyfarwyddiadau cam wrth gam hawdd:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Cam 1     <a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/cy/userguide#Create\"><strong>Cofrestru ar gyfer cyfrif</strong></a></li>\n<li>Cam 2     <a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/cy/userguide#Login\"><strong>Mewngofnodi i EIDCymru</strong></a></li>\n<li>Cam 3     <a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/cy/userguide#Accept\"><strong>Derbyn symudiad</strong></a></li>\n<li>Cam 4     <a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/cy/userguide#Report\"><strong>Rhoi gwybod am symudiad</strong></a></li>\n<li>Cam 5     <a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/cy/userguide#Tags\"><strong>Rhoi manylion tag</strong></a></li>\n<li>Cam 6     <a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/cy/userguide#Records\"><strong>Cofnodion symudiadau</strong></a></li>\n<li>Cam 7     <a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/cy/userguide#Returns\"><strong>Dychwelyd neu anfon symudiad ymlaen</strong></a></li>\n<li>Cam 8     <a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/cy/userguide#Account\"><strong>Eich cyfrif</strong></a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Cam 1 - Cofrestru ar gyfer cyfrif</strong></p>\n<p><strong>I gofrestru ar gyfer cyfrif gydag EIDCymru bydd angen y canlynol arnoch:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>eich manylion cyswllt - cyfeiriad e-bost, cyfeiriad a rhifau ffôn</li>\n<li>rhif Daliad (CPH) eich prif ddaliad</li>\n<li>eich Cyfeirnod Cwsmer (CRN). Cyhoeddir hwn gan <a href=\"https://llyw.cymru/taliadau-gwledig-cymru-ar-lein\">Taliadau Gwledig Cymru (RPW)</a>, Ffôn:<a href=\"tel:+443000625004\"> 0300 062 5004</a></li>\n<li>eich rhif Diadell / Buches ar gyfer eich prif ddaliad, a ddarperir gan yr <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/guidance/get-help-with-animal-and-plant-health.cy\">Asiantaeth Anifeiliaid a Phlanhigion (APHA)</a> Ffôn: <a href=\"tel:+4403003038268\">0300 303 8268</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Ewch i wefan EIDCymru </strong><a href=\"http://www.eidcymru.org/\">www.eidcymru.org</a><strong> – dewiswch eich iaith a chliciwch ar y ddolen Cofrestru ar y dudalen ganlynol.</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Rhowch eich manylion - dewiswch enw defnyddiwr unigryw (bydd hyn yn cael ei ddangos ar eich cofnodion symud, a bydd yn cael ei weld gan eraill) a chyfrinair cryf.</li>\n<li>Dywedwch wrthym fanylion eich prif ddaliad yn y fformat cywir e.e. 11/222/3333. Hefyd, dywedwch wrthym y CRN sy’n gysylltiedig â’r CPH hwn.</li>\n<li>Dewiswch eich prif rywogaeth - dewiswch ddefaid, geifr neu geirw, a dywedwch wrthym eich prif rif diadell/buches.</li>\n<li>Gwnewch yn siŵr fod y manylion ar y dudalen grynodeb yn gywir cyn dewis Creu eich Cyfrif EIDCymru.</li>\n<li>Gwiriwch eich e-bost - byddwn wedi anfon e-bost atoch i wneud yn siŵr bod eich cyfeiriad e-bost yn gywir. Cliciwch ar y ddolen a fydd yn yr e-bost.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Os oes angen mwy o gymorth arnoch, edrychwch ar yr adran Cymorth a Gwybodaeth ar y bar offer ar frig y wefan, neu cysylltwch ag EIDCymru ar <a href=\"tel:+4401970636959\">01970 636 959</a> neu e-bostiwch <a href=\"mailto:cymorth@eidcymru.org\">cymorth@eidcymru.org</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/cy/&amp;/app/sheep-servicesquot;#Topics%22\"><strong>Dewislen</strong></a></p>\n<p><strong>Cam 2 - Mewngofnodi i EIDCymru</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Y dudalen gyntaf a welwch chi yw’r Dangosfwrdd. Gellir ystyried y Dangosfwrdd yn hafan eich cyfrif EIDCymru - o’r fan hon gallwch lywio i’r holl swyddogaethau sydd ar gael:</strong></p>\n<p>Mae’r opsiynau Dangosfwrdd yn eich galluogi i:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>greu eich symudiadau eich hun.</li>\n<li>derbyn symudiadau a grëwyd ar eich rhan gan Geidwaid eraill neu gan Farchnad Da Byw.</li>\n<li>gweld cofnod o’r symudiadau a adroddwyd yn electronig.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Mae’r Dangosfwrdd hefyd yn gadael i chi Greu Symudiad ar gyfer symudiad a gynlluniwyd yn y dyfodol hyd at 3 diwrnod ymlaen llaw.</p>\n<p>Gallwch hefyd Roi Gwybod am Symudiad sydd eisoes wedi digwydd, ar gyfer anifeiliaid sydd wedi gadael neu wedi cyrraedd eich daliad. Gweler Cam 4.</p>\n<p>Os byddwch yn dechrau symudiad ond nad yw’r holl wybodaeth ar gael ar y pryd, bydd y symudiad wedi’i ran-gwblhau yn aros yn eich Symudiadau Drafft i chi eu cwblhau’n ddiweddarach. Bydd symudiadau a arbedir fel Drafft yn parhau am 30 diwrnod ac ar ôl hynny byddant yn cael eu dileu’n awtomatig.</p>\n<p>O’r Dangosfwrdd gallwch hefyd Dderbyn Symudiadau i’ch daliad. Gweler Cam 3 am ragor o wybodaeth.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/cy/&amp;/app/sheep-servicesquot;#Topics%22\"><strong>Dewislen</strong></a></p>\n<p><strong>Cam 3 - Derbyn Symudiad</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Mae Marchnadoedd Da Byw yn cynhyrchu trwydded symud i Geidwaid fynd gydag anifeiliaid i ben y daith. Mae’r symudiad yn cael ei greu yn EIDCymru ac yn aros i gael eu derbyn gennych chi’r Ceidwad. O’ch Dangosfwrdd EIDCymru ar-lein defnyddiwch Derbyn Symudiadau i wirio a derbyn y symudiadau.</strong></p>\n<p>Os oes gennych symudiadau sy’n aros i gael eu derbyn, bydd y rhif sydd ar ôl yn ymddangos ar eich Dangosfwrdd yn erbyn Derbyn Symudiadau. Dylid derbyn symudiad o fewn 3 diwrnod i’r symudiad. Bydd yr opsiwn hefyd yn cael ei liwio’n Wyrdd neu’n Goch. Mae’r lliw Coch yn dangos eu bod yn hwyr h.y. dros 3 diwrnod oed ond bod angen eu derbyn o hyd.</p>\n<p>Drwy ddewis Derbyn Symudiadau gallwch wirio’r anifeiliaid a adroddwyd ar eich daliad yn erbyn y Drwydded a ddarparwyd gan y Farchnad Da Byw. Mae angen i chi dderbyn, gwrthod neu wneud ymholiad am y symudiad cyfan, neu unrhyw anifeiliaid unigol a ddangosir nad ydynt yn cyfateb i’ch cofnodion chi.</p>\n<p>Pan fyddwch yn Derbyn y symudiad ar eich cyfrif EIDCymru, nid oes angen i chi anfon y drwydded bapur i EIDCymru. Ar ôl ei dderbyn, bydd y symudiad wedyn yn ymddangos o fewn Cofnodion Symud eich cyfrif EIDCymru.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/cy/&amp;/app/sheep-servicesquot;#Topics%22\"><strong>Dewislen</strong></a></p>\n<p><strong>Cam 4 - Rhoi Gwybod am Symudiad</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Mae ddau ffordd y gallwch greu symudiad yn EIDCymru:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Gallwch greu Symudiad ar gyfer symudiad sydd wedi’i gynllunio yn y dyfodol hyd at 3 diwrnod ymlaen llaw.</li>\n<li>Gallwch Roi Gwybod am Symudiad sydd eisoes wedi digwydd, ar gyfer anifeiliaid sydd naill ai wedi gadael neu wedi cyrraedd eich daliad.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Os oes gennych rifau tagiau clust sydd wedi’u darllen yn electronig, gellir mewnbynnu rhifau’r tagiau i’r symudiad drwy uwchlwytho ffeil. Mae opsiynau eraill i nodi rhifau tagiau clust fel tagiau Diadell/Lladd a hefyd yn unigol neu fel grwpiau o fewn cyfres benodol.</p>\n<p>Gellir mewnbynnu gwybodaeth ehangach sydd ynghlwm wrth ddeddfwriaeth y diwydiant megis manylion Cludiant a Gwybodaeth am y Gadwyn Fwyd (FCI) pan fyddwch yn rhoi gwybod am symudiad yn electronig.</p>\n<p>Cofiwch, mae adrodd am symudiad drwy EIDCymru yn disodli’r angen i lenwi Ffurflen AML1. Unwaith y bydd y symudiad wedi’i greu, mae opsiynau i weld ac argraffu’r wybodaeth fel trwydded bapur.</p>\n<p>Mae’n bosibl argraffu nifer o gopïau ar gyfer eich cofnodion eich hun ac i fynd gyda’r anifeiliaid i ben y daith. Ar ôl ei dderbyn, bydd y symudiad yn ymddangos o fewn Cofnodion Symud eich cyfrif EIDCymru.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/cy/&amp;/app/sheep-servicesquot;#Topics%22\"><strong>Dewislen</strong></a></p>\n<p><strong>Cam 5 - Rhoi Manylion Tagiau</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Mae sawl ffordd y gallwch roi gwybod am rifau tagiau’r anifeiliaid sy’n cyrraedd neu’n gadael:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Tagiau Unigol - Dywedwch wrthym y rhagddodiad Tag ee UK, rhif y ddiadell 6 digid a’r ID unigol.</li>\n<li>Ystod Tagiau - Gellir defnyddio hwn ar gyfer rhoi cyfres o rifau tagiau, lle rydych chi’n gwybod bod yr anifeiliaid wedi’u tagio mewn trefn. Mae angen i chi ddarparu’r rhifau dechrau a gorffen. Gallwch eithrio rhai Rhifau Tagiau.</li>\n<li>Tagiau Lladd - Ar gyfer anifeiliaid sydd wedi’u tagio, dywedwch wrthym y Rhagddodiad ( ee UK ) rhif y ddiadell 6 digid a faint o anifeiliaid sy’n symud.</li>\n<li>Uwchlwytho tagiau mewn ffeil. Gellir uwchlwytho tagiau a recordiwyd ar ddarllenydd EID i wefan EIDCymru. Drwy ddilyn y cyfarwyddiadau sy’n dod gyda’ch darllenydd EID, dylech allu cynhyrchu ffeil destun neu csv. Gellir uwchlwytho hwn i’r symudiad o’r dudalen Anifeiliaid wrth greu eich symudiad.</li>\n<li>Tagiau rhydd – mae hyn yn eich galluogi i fewnbynnu rhif tag anifail nad yw wedi’i dagio gyda thag EID. O ystyried bod yr holl reoliadau adnabod anifeiliaid diweddar wedi ei gwneud yn ofynnol i anifeiliaid gael eu tagio â thag EID, byddai hyn fel arfer yn cael ei gadw ar gyfer anifeiliaid a gafodd eu geni a’u tagio cyn 2010.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/cy/&amp;/app/sheep-servicesquot;#Topics%22\"><strong>Dewislen</strong></a></p>\n<p><strong>Cam 6 - Cofnodion Symud</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Gweld eich holl symudiadau i mewn / oddi ar ddaliad, anfon ymholiad atom am symudiad ac argraffu unrhyw symudiadau ar gyfer eich cofnodion.</strong></p>\n<p>Bydd yr holl symudiadau a adroddir yn erbyn eich daliad yn ymddangos yn y Cofnodion Symud. Er enghraifft, pan fyddwch yn anfon anifeiliaid i’r farchnad, bydd y manylion y maent yn eu hanfon at EIDCymru yn cael eu harddangos yn awtomatig yn eich Cofnodion Symud, yn ogystal â thrwyddedau papur a anfonir i swyddfa EIDCymru.</p>\n<p>Mae’r dudalen Cofnodion Symud yn caniatáu i chi hidlo a didoli eich symudiadau. Gallwch nodi ystod dyddiad neu hidlo CPH penodol o ble y symudwyd anifeiliaid i mewn iddi neu oddi arno. Gallwch hefyd hidlo yn ôl Rhywogaethau.</p>\n<p>Gallwch ddefnyddio opsiwn Cofnodion Symud EIDCymru i sicrhau cywirdeb a chyflawnrwydd eich cofrestr daliad. Gallwch ofyn am gywiriad i unrhyw wybodaeth sydd wedi’i chofnodi drwy ymholiad drwy agor y symudiad a dewis Ymholiad.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/cy/&amp;/app/sheep-servicesquot;#Topics%22\"><strong>Dewislen</strong></a></p>\n<p><strong>Cam 7 - Dychwelyd neu Anfon Symudiad Ymlaen</strong></p>\n<p>O fewn symudiad sy’n ymddangos yn eich Cofnodion Symud, mae’n bosibl ’Dychwelyd’ symudiad - gall hyn greu copi o symudiad sy’n mynd i’r cyfeiriad arall. Er enghraifft, pan fydd anifeiliaid yn dychwelyd o Dir pori ar rent. Mae’r rhifau tagiau a’r niferoedd eisoes wedi’u cofnodi felly gall ’dychwelyd’ symudiad arbed llawer o amser.</p>\n<p>O fewn symudiad sy’n ymddangos yn eich Cofnodion Symud, mae’n bosibl anfon symudiad ’Ymlaen’ - gall hyn greu copi o symudiad sy’n dechrau o’r gyrchfan pen y daith ddiwethaf. Mae’r rhifau tagiau a’r niferoedd eisoes wedi’u cofnodi felly gall ’dychwelyd’ symudiad arbed llawer o amser.</p>\n<p><strong>Cam 8 - Eich Cyfrif</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Mae’r adrannau hyn yn cynnwys yr holl wybodaeth bwysig sydd ei hangen arnom, mae hefyd yn gadael i chi wneud y canlynol:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Newid eich manylion</strong> - os oes angen i chi ddiweddaru’r wybodaeth a roddoch i ni pan wnaethoch chi gofrestru, gallwch wneud hyn yma. Er enghraifft, gallwch newid eich enw defnyddiwr, cyfeiriad e-bost, manylion cyswllt a’ch rhif CRN.</li>\n<li><strong>Newid eich cyfrinair</strong> - os oes angen i chi newid eich cyfrinair gallwch wneud hyn yma. Cofiwch wneud cyfrinair cryf - o leiaf 12 nod, llythrennau bach a mawr, rhifau ac atalnodi.</li>\n<li><strong>Dewisiadau diofyn</strong> - newid eich opsiynau diofyn, dyma’r gosodiadau y bydd y system yn eu cofio pan fyddwch yn sefydlu symudiad, e.e. rhif cofrestru cerbyd diofyn, gellir eu newid pan fyddwch yn rhoi gwybod am y symudiad.</li>\n<li><strong>Gweld a diwygio eich daliadau</strong> - ychwanegu, golygu a dileu eich rhifau diadell. Dywedwch wrthym ba ddaliad yw eich prif ddaliad yma.</li>\n<li><strong>Gweld a chwblhau eich Rhestr Flynyddol</strong> - defnyddir y Rhestr Flynyddol Defaid a Geifr i gofnodi nifer y defaid a’r geifr yr ydych yn eu cadw ar safleoedd unigol a’r rheswm dros eu cadw e.e. cig, llaeth, gwlân, bridio ac ati. Edrychwch ar restrau’r gorffennol yma a chwblhewch eich Rhestr Flynyddol cyn y dyddiad cau.</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- /wp:freeform --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"33.33%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:33.33%\"><!-- wp:html -->\n<div id=\"related-content-container\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:html --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->','Canllaw i ddefnyddwyr EIDCymru','','inherit','closed','closed','','193-revision-v1','','','2026-04-28 09:00:32','2026-04-28 09:00:32','',193,'http://localhost:8081/?p=194',0,'revision','',0),(195,3,'2026-04-28 09:04:03','2026-04-28 09:04:03','<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"66.66%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\"><!-- wp:freeform -->\n<h1><strong>EIDCymru User guide</strong></h1>\n<p><strong>Choose a topic from the list below to get easy step-by-step instructions:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Step 1     <a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/userguide#Create\"><strong>Register for an account</strong></a></li>\n<li>Step 2     <a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/userguide#Login\"><strong>Log in to EIDCymru</strong></a></li>\n<li>Step 3     <a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/userguide#Accept\"><strong>Accepting a movement</strong></a></li>\n<li>Step 4     <a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/userguide#Report\"><strong>Reporting a movement</strong></a></li>\n<li>Step 5     <a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/userguide#Tags\"><strong>Enter tag details</strong></a></li>\n<li>Step 6     <a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/userguide#Records\"><strong>Movement records</strong></a></li>\n<li>Step 7     <a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/userguide#Returns\"><strong>Return or forward a movement</strong></a></li>\n<li>Step 8     <a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/userguide#Account\"><strong>Your account</strong></a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Step 1 - Register for an account</strong></p>\n<p><strong>To register for an account with EIDCymru you will need:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>your contact details - email address, contact address and telephone numbers</li>\n<li>the CPH number of your main holding</li>\n<li>your CRN (Customer Reference Number), this is issued by <a href=\"https://www.gov.wales/rural-payments-wales-rpw-online\">Rural Payments Wales</a> (RPW), <a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/%E2%80%9Ctel:+443000625004%22\">0300 062 5004</a> Phone: <a href=\"tel:+443000625004\">0300 062 5004</a></li>\n<li>a Flock / Herd number for your main holding, provided by <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/guidance/get-help-with-animal-and-plant-health\">Animal Plant Health Agency (APHA)</a> Phone: <a href=\"tel:+4403003038268\">0300 303 8268</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Go to the EIDCymru website </strong><a href=\"http://www.eidcymru.org/\"><strong>www.eidcymru.org</strong></a><strong> choose your language, click on the Register link on the next page and follow these steps:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Enter your details, choose a unique username (this will be shown on your movement records, and seen by others) and a strong password.</li>\n<li>Tell us the details of your main CPH in the correct format e.g. 11/222/3333. Also tell us the CRN associated with this CPH.</li>\n<li>Select your main species - choose sheep, goats or deer, and tell us your main flock / herd number.</li>\n<li>Check that the details on the summary page are correct before selecting Create your EIDCymru Account.</li>\n<li>Check your email, we will have sent you an email to verify your email address, click on the link provided.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>If you need further help, look at the Help &amp; Information section on the top toolbar of the website, or contact EIDCymru on <a href=\"tel:+4401970636959\">01970 636 959</a> or email <a href=\"mailto:contact@eidcymru.org\">contact@eidcymru.org</a>.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/&amp;/app/sheep-servicesquot;#Topics%22\"><strong>Return to menu</strong></a></p>\n<p><strong>Step 2 - Login to EIDCymru</strong></p>\n<p><strong>The first page you will see is the Dashboard. The Dashboard can be considered the homepage of your EIDCymru account - from here you can navigate to all of its available functions:</strong></p>\n<p>The Dashboard options allow you to:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>create your own movements</li>\n<li>accept movements created on your behalf by other Keepers or by a Livestock Market</li>\n<li>view a record of movements reported electronically</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The Dashboard also lets you Set up a Movement for a future planned movement up to 3 days ahead.</p>\n<p>You can also Report a Movement that has already taken place, for either animals which have left or arrived at your holding. (See Step 4)</p>\n<p>If you start a movement but don’t have all the information available at the time, the part-completed movement will remain in your Draft Movements for you to complete at a later stage. Movements saved to Draft will remain for 30 days after which they will be deleted automatically.</p>\n<p>From the Dashboard you can also Accept Movements onto your holding. (See Step 3)</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/&amp;/app/sheep-servicesquot;#Topics%22\"><strong>Return to menu</strong></a></p>\n<p><strong>Step 3 - Accepting a Movement</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Livestock Markets produce a movement licence for Keepers to accompany animals to the destination. The movement is created in EIDCymru waiting to be accepted by you the Keeper. From your online EIDCymru Dashboard use the Accept Movements feature to check and accept the movements.</strong></p>\n<p>If you have movements waiting to be accepted, the number outstanding will show on your Dashboard against Accept Movements. Movement should be accepted within 3 days of the movement. The option will also be coloured Green or Red. The colour Red indicates they are late i.e. over 3 days old but still require to be accepted.</p>\n<p>By selecting Accept Movements you can verify the animals reported onto your holding against the Licence provided by the Livestock Market. You need to accept, reject or query the entire movement, or any individual animals shown that do not match your records.</p>\n<p>When you Accept the movement on your EIDCymru account, you do not need to send the paper licence into EIDCymru. Once accepted, the movement will then appear within the Movement Records of your EIDCymru account.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/&amp;/app/sheep-servicesquot;#Topics%22\"><strong>Return to menu</strong></a></p>\n<p><strong>Step 4 - Reporting a Movement</strong></p>\n<p><strong>There are two ways that you can create a movement in EIDCymru:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>You can set up a Movement for a future planned movement up to 3 days ahead.</li>\n<li>You can Report a Movement that has already taken place, for animals which have either left or arrived at your holding.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>If you have ear tag numbers which have been read electronically, the tag numbers can be inputted into the movement as a file upload. There are other options to enter ear tag numbers as Flock/Slaughter tags and also individually or as groups within a specific range</p>\n<p>Wider industry legislation information such as Transport details and FCI (Food Chain Information) can be inputted when you report a movement electronically.</p>\n<p>Remember, reporting a movement via EIDCymru replaces the need to complete an AML1 Form. Once the move has been created, there are options to view and print the information as a paper licence.</p>\n<p>It is possible to print multiple copies for you own records and to accompany the animals to their Destination. Once reported, the movement will appear within the Movement Records of your EIDCymru account.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/&amp;/app/sheep-servicesquot;#Topics%22\"><strong>Return to menu</strong></a></p>\n<p><strong>Step 5 - Enter Tag Details</strong></p>\n<p><strong>There are several ways that you can report the tag numbers of the animals that are arriving or departing:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Individual Tags - Tell us the Tag prefix e.g. UK, the 6-digit flock number and the individual ID.</li>\n<li>Tag Range - This can be used for entering a range of tag numbers, where you know the animals have been tagged in order. You just need to provide the start and end number. You are able to exclude certain Tag Numbers.</li>\n<li>Slaughter Tags - For animal which have been slaughter tagged, tell us the Prefix ( eg UK ) the 6 digit flock number and the quantity of animals moving.</li>\n<li>Upload tags via a file. Tags recorded on an EID reader can be uploaded to the EIDCymru website.  By following the instructions which come with your EID reader, you should be able to produce a text or csv file. This can be uploaded to the movement from the Animals page when creating your movement.</li>\n<li>Freestyle tags – this allows you to input a tag number of an animal which is not EID tagged. Given that all recent animal identification regulations have required animals to be tagged with an EID tag, this would typically be reserved for animals which were born and tagged pre-2010.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/&amp;/app/sheep-servicesquot;#Topics%22\"><strong>Return to menu</strong></a></p>\n<p><strong>Step 6 - Movement Records</strong></p>\n<p><strong>View all of your on / off movements, send us a query on a movement and print out any movements for your records.</strong></p>\n<p>All movements reported against your holding will show in Movement Records. For example, when you send animals to a market, details sent to EIDCymru by them will automatically display in your Movement Records, as will paper licences sent to the EIDCymru office.</p>\n<p>The Movement Records page allows you to filter and sort your movements. You can enter a date range or filter a specific CPH from where animals were moved to or from. You can also filter by Species.</p>\n<p>You can use the EIDCymru Movement Records option to ensure the accuracy and completeness of your holding register. You are able to request a correction to any information that has been recorded via a query by opening the movement and selecting Query.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/&amp;/app/sheep-servicesquot;#Topics%22\"><strong>Return to menu</strong></a></p>\n<p><strong>Step 7 - Return or Forward a Movement</strong></p>\n<p>Within a movement showing in Movement Records, it is possible to ‘Return’ a movement - this can create a copy of a movement going in the opposite direction. For example when animals return from Tack. The tag numbers and quantities have already been captured therefore ‘returning’ a movement can save a lot of time.</p>\n<p>Within a movement showing in Movement Records, it is possible to ‘Forward’ a movement - this can create a copy of a movement which starts on from the last destination. The tag numbers and quantities have already been captured, so using the Forward movement function can save a lot of time.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/&amp;/app/sheep-servicesquot;#Topics%22\"><strong>Return to menu</strong></a></p>\n<p><strong>Step 8 - Your Account</strong></p>\n<p><strong>This sections contains all the important information that we need, it also lets you do the following:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Change your details</strong><br />If you need to update the information you gave us when you registered, you can do this here. For example, you can change your username, email address, contact details and your CRN number.</li>\n<li><strong>Change your password</strong><br />If you need to change your password you can do this here. Remember to make a strong password - at least 12 characters, lowercase and uppercase, numbers and punctuation.</li>\n<li><strong>Default options</strong><br />Amend your default options, these are the settings the system will remember when you set up a move, e.g. a default vehicle registration number, they can be change when you report the move.</li>\n<li><strong>View and amend your holdings</strong><br />Add, edit and delete your flock numbers and tell us which holding is your primary holding.</li>\n<li><strong>View and complete your Annual Inventory.</strong><br />The Sheep and Goats Annual Inventory is used to record the number of sheep and goats that you keep on individual premises and the reason they are kept e.g. meat, dairy, wool, breeding etc. View past inventories here and complete yours before the deadline.</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- /wp:freeform --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"33.33%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:33.33%\"><!-- wp:html -->\n<div id=\"related-content-container\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:html --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','User guide','','inherit','closed','closed','','190-revision-v1','','','2026-04-28 09:04:03','2026-04-28 09:04:03','',190,'http://localhost:8081/?p=195',0,'revision','',0),(196,3,'2026-04-28 09:04:11','2026-04-28 09:04:11','<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"66.66%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\"><!-- wp:freeform -->\n<h1><strong>Canllaw i ddefnyddwyr EIDCymru</strong></h1>\n<p><strong>Dewiswch bwnc o’r rhestr isod i gael cyfarwyddiadau cam wrth gam hawdd:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Cam 1     <a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/cy/userguide#Create\"><strong>Cofrestru ar gyfer cyfrif</strong></a></li>\n<li>Cam 2     <a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/cy/userguide#Login\"><strong>Mewngofnodi i EIDCymru</strong></a></li>\n<li>Cam 3     <a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/cy/userguide#Accept\"><strong>Derbyn symudiad</strong></a></li>\n<li>Cam 4     <a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/cy/userguide#Report\"><strong>Rhoi gwybod am symudiad</strong></a></li>\n<li>Cam 5     <a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/cy/userguide#Tags\"><strong>Rhoi manylion tag</strong></a></li>\n<li>Cam 6     <a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/cy/userguide#Records\"><strong>Cofnodion symudiadau</strong></a></li>\n<li>Cam 7     <a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/cy/userguide#Returns\"><strong>Dychwelyd neu anfon symudiad ymlaen</strong></a></li>\n<li>Cam 8     <a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/cy/userguide#Account\"><strong>Eich cyfrif</strong></a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Cam 1 - Cofrestru ar gyfer cyfrif</strong></p>\n<p><strong>I gofrestru ar gyfer cyfrif gydag EIDCymru bydd angen y canlynol arnoch:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>eich manylion cyswllt - cyfeiriad e-bost, cyfeiriad a rhifau ffôn</li>\n<li>rhif Daliad (CPH) eich prif ddaliad</li>\n<li>eich Cyfeirnod Cwsmer (CRN). Cyhoeddir hwn gan <a href=\"https://llyw.cymru/taliadau-gwledig-cymru-ar-lein\">Taliadau Gwledig Cymru (RPW)</a>, Ffôn:<a href=\"tel:+443000625004\"> 0300 062 5004</a></li>\n<li>eich rhif Diadell / Buches ar gyfer eich prif ddaliad, a ddarperir gan yr <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/guidance/get-help-with-animal-and-plant-health.cy\">Asiantaeth Anifeiliaid a Phlanhigion (APHA)</a> Ffôn: <a href=\"tel:+4403003038268\">0300 303 8268</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Ewch i wefan EIDCymru </strong><a href=\"http://www.eidcymru.org/\">www.eidcymru.org</a><strong> – dewiswch eich iaith a chliciwch ar y ddolen Cofrestru ar y dudalen ganlynol.</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Rhowch eich manylion - dewiswch enw defnyddiwr unigryw (bydd hyn yn cael ei ddangos ar eich cofnodion symud, a bydd yn cael ei weld gan eraill) a chyfrinair cryf.</li>\n<li>Dywedwch wrthym fanylion eich prif ddaliad yn y fformat cywir e.e. 11/222/3333. Hefyd, dywedwch wrthym y CRN sy’n gysylltiedig â’r CPH hwn.</li>\n<li>Dewiswch eich prif rywogaeth - dewiswch ddefaid, geifr neu geirw, a dywedwch wrthym eich prif rif diadell/buches.</li>\n<li>Gwnewch yn siŵr fod y manylion ar y dudalen grynodeb yn gywir cyn dewis Creu eich Cyfrif EIDCymru.</li>\n<li>Gwiriwch eich e-bost - byddwn wedi anfon e-bost atoch i wneud yn siŵr bod eich cyfeiriad e-bost yn gywir. Cliciwch ar y ddolen a fydd yn yr e-bost.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Os oes angen mwy o gymorth arnoch, edrychwch ar yr adran Cymorth a Gwybodaeth ar y bar offer ar frig y wefan, neu cysylltwch ag EIDCymru ar <a href=\"tel:+4401970636959\">01970 636 959</a> neu e-bostiwch <a href=\"mailto:cymorth@eidcymru.org\">cymorth@eidcymru.org</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/cy/&amp;/app/sheep-servicesquot;#Topics%22\"><strong>Dewislen</strong></a></p>\n<p><strong>Cam 2 - Mewngofnodi i EIDCymru</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Y dudalen gyntaf a welwch chi yw’r Dangosfwrdd. Gellir ystyried y Dangosfwrdd yn hafan eich cyfrif EIDCymru - o’r fan hon gallwch lywio i’r holl swyddogaethau sydd ar gael:</strong></p>\n<p>Mae’r opsiynau Dangosfwrdd yn eich galluogi i:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>greu eich symudiadau eich hun.</li>\n<li>derbyn symudiadau a grëwyd ar eich rhan gan Geidwaid eraill neu gan Farchnad Da Byw.</li>\n<li>gweld cofnod o’r symudiadau a adroddwyd yn electronig.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Mae’r Dangosfwrdd hefyd yn gadael i chi Greu Symudiad ar gyfer symudiad a gynlluniwyd yn y dyfodol hyd at 3 diwrnod ymlaen llaw.</p>\n<p>Gallwch hefyd Roi Gwybod am Symudiad sydd eisoes wedi digwydd, ar gyfer anifeiliaid sydd wedi gadael neu wedi cyrraedd eich daliad. Gweler Cam 4.</p>\n<p>Os byddwch yn dechrau symudiad ond nad yw’r holl wybodaeth ar gael ar y pryd, bydd y symudiad wedi’i ran-gwblhau yn aros yn eich Symudiadau Drafft i chi eu cwblhau’n ddiweddarach. Bydd symudiadau a arbedir fel Drafft yn parhau am 30 diwrnod ac ar ôl hynny byddant yn cael eu dileu’n awtomatig.</p>\n<p>O’r Dangosfwrdd gallwch hefyd Dderbyn Symudiadau i’ch daliad. Gweler Cam 3 am ragor o wybodaeth.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/cy/&amp;/app/sheep-servicesquot;#Topics%22\"><strong>Dewislen</strong></a></p>\n<p><strong>Cam 3 - Derbyn Symudiad</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Mae Marchnadoedd Da Byw yn cynhyrchu trwydded symud i Geidwaid fynd gydag anifeiliaid i ben y daith. Mae’r symudiad yn cael ei greu yn EIDCymru ac yn aros i gael eu derbyn gennych chi’r Ceidwad. O’ch Dangosfwrdd EIDCymru ar-lein defnyddiwch Derbyn Symudiadau i wirio a derbyn y symudiadau.</strong></p>\n<p>Os oes gennych symudiadau sy’n aros i gael eu derbyn, bydd y rhif sydd ar ôl yn ymddangos ar eich Dangosfwrdd yn erbyn Derbyn Symudiadau. Dylid derbyn symudiad o fewn 3 diwrnod i’r symudiad. Bydd yr opsiwn hefyd yn cael ei liwio’n Wyrdd neu’n Goch. Mae’r lliw Coch yn dangos eu bod yn hwyr h.y. dros 3 diwrnod oed ond bod angen eu derbyn o hyd.</p>\n<p>Drwy ddewis Derbyn Symudiadau gallwch wirio’r anifeiliaid a adroddwyd ar eich daliad yn erbyn y Drwydded a ddarparwyd gan y Farchnad Da Byw. Mae angen i chi dderbyn, gwrthod neu wneud ymholiad am y symudiad cyfan, neu unrhyw anifeiliaid unigol a ddangosir nad ydynt yn cyfateb i’ch cofnodion chi.</p>\n<p>Pan fyddwch yn Derbyn y symudiad ar eich cyfrif EIDCymru, nid oes angen i chi anfon y drwydded bapur i EIDCymru. Ar ôl ei dderbyn, bydd y symudiad wedyn yn ymddangos o fewn Cofnodion Symud eich cyfrif EIDCymru.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/cy/&amp;/app/sheep-servicesquot;#Topics%22\"><strong>Dewislen</strong></a></p>\n<p><strong>Cam 4 - Rhoi Gwybod am Symudiad</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Mae ddau ffordd y gallwch greu symudiad yn EIDCymru:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Gallwch greu Symudiad ar gyfer symudiad sydd wedi’i gynllunio yn y dyfodol hyd at 3 diwrnod ymlaen llaw.</li>\n<li>Gallwch Roi Gwybod am Symudiad sydd eisoes wedi digwydd, ar gyfer anifeiliaid sydd naill ai wedi gadael neu wedi cyrraedd eich daliad.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Os oes gennych rifau tagiau clust sydd wedi’u darllen yn electronig, gellir mewnbynnu rhifau’r tagiau i’r symudiad drwy uwchlwytho ffeil. Mae opsiynau eraill i nodi rhifau tagiau clust fel tagiau Diadell/Lladd a hefyd yn unigol neu fel grwpiau o fewn cyfres benodol.</p>\n<p>Gellir mewnbynnu gwybodaeth ehangach sydd ynghlwm wrth ddeddfwriaeth y diwydiant megis manylion Cludiant a Gwybodaeth am y Gadwyn Fwyd (FCI) pan fyddwch yn rhoi gwybod am symudiad yn electronig.</p>\n<p>Cofiwch, mae adrodd am symudiad drwy EIDCymru yn disodli’r angen i lenwi Ffurflen AML1. Unwaith y bydd y symudiad wedi’i greu, mae opsiynau i weld ac argraffu’r wybodaeth fel trwydded bapur.</p>\n<p>Mae’n bosibl argraffu nifer o gopïau ar gyfer eich cofnodion eich hun ac i fynd gyda’r anifeiliaid i ben y daith. Ar ôl ei dderbyn, bydd y symudiad yn ymddangos o fewn Cofnodion Symud eich cyfrif EIDCymru.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/cy/&amp;/app/sheep-servicesquot;#Topics%22\"><strong>Dewislen</strong></a></p>\n<p><strong>Cam 5 - Rhoi Manylion Tagiau</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Mae sawl ffordd y gallwch roi gwybod am rifau tagiau’r anifeiliaid sy’n cyrraedd neu’n gadael:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Tagiau Unigol - Dywedwch wrthym y rhagddodiad Tag ee UK, rhif y ddiadell 6 digid a’r ID unigol.</li>\n<li>Ystod Tagiau - Gellir defnyddio hwn ar gyfer rhoi cyfres o rifau tagiau, lle rydych chi’n gwybod bod yr anifeiliaid wedi’u tagio mewn trefn. Mae angen i chi ddarparu’r rhifau dechrau a gorffen. Gallwch eithrio rhai Rhifau Tagiau.</li>\n<li>Tagiau Lladd - Ar gyfer anifeiliaid sydd wedi’u tagio, dywedwch wrthym y Rhagddodiad ( ee UK ) rhif y ddiadell 6 digid a faint o anifeiliaid sy’n symud.</li>\n<li>Uwchlwytho tagiau mewn ffeil. Gellir uwchlwytho tagiau a recordiwyd ar ddarllenydd EID i wefan EIDCymru. Drwy ddilyn y cyfarwyddiadau sy’n dod gyda’ch darllenydd EID, dylech allu cynhyrchu ffeil destun neu csv. Gellir uwchlwytho hwn i’r symudiad o’r dudalen Anifeiliaid wrth greu eich symudiad.</li>\n<li>Tagiau rhydd – mae hyn yn eich galluogi i fewnbynnu rhif tag anifail nad yw wedi’i dagio gyda thag EID. O ystyried bod yr holl reoliadau adnabod anifeiliaid diweddar wedi ei gwneud yn ofynnol i anifeiliaid gael eu tagio â thag EID, byddai hyn fel arfer yn cael ei gadw ar gyfer anifeiliaid a gafodd eu geni a’u tagio cyn 2010.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/cy/&amp;/app/sheep-servicesquot;#Topics%22\"><strong>Dewislen</strong></a></p>\n<p><strong>Cam 6 - Cofnodion Symud</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Gweld eich holl symudiadau i mewn / oddi ar ddaliad, anfon ymholiad atom am symudiad ac argraffu unrhyw symudiadau ar gyfer eich cofnodion.</strong></p>\n<p>Bydd yr holl symudiadau a adroddir yn erbyn eich daliad yn ymddangos yn y Cofnodion Symud. Er enghraifft, pan fyddwch yn anfon anifeiliaid i’r farchnad, bydd y manylion y maent yn eu hanfon at EIDCymru yn cael eu harddangos yn awtomatig yn eich Cofnodion Symud, yn ogystal â thrwyddedau papur a anfonir i swyddfa EIDCymru.</p>\n<p>Mae’r dudalen Cofnodion Symud yn caniatáu i chi hidlo a didoli eich symudiadau. Gallwch nodi ystod dyddiad neu hidlo CPH penodol o ble y symudwyd anifeiliaid i mewn iddi neu oddi arno. Gallwch hefyd hidlo yn ôl Rhywogaethau.</p>\n<p>Gallwch ddefnyddio opsiwn Cofnodion Symud EIDCymru i sicrhau cywirdeb a chyflawnrwydd eich cofrestr daliad. Gallwch ofyn am gywiriad i unrhyw wybodaeth sydd wedi’i chofnodi drwy ymholiad drwy agor y symudiad a dewis Ymholiad.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/cy/&amp;/app/sheep-servicesquot;#Topics%22\"><strong>Dewislen</strong></a></p>\n<p><strong>Cam 7 - Dychwelyd neu Anfon Symudiad Ymlaen</strong></p>\n<p>O fewn symudiad sy’n ymddangos yn eich Cofnodion Symud, mae’n bosibl ’Dychwelyd’ symudiad - gall hyn greu copi o symudiad sy’n mynd i’r cyfeiriad arall. Er enghraifft, pan fydd anifeiliaid yn dychwelyd o Dir pori ar rent. Mae’r rhifau tagiau a’r niferoedd eisoes wedi’u cofnodi felly gall ’dychwelyd’ symudiad arbed llawer o amser.</p>\n<p>O fewn symudiad sy’n ymddangos yn eich Cofnodion Symud, mae’n bosibl anfon symudiad ’Ymlaen’ - gall hyn greu copi o symudiad sy’n dechrau o’r gyrchfan pen y daith ddiwethaf. Mae’r rhifau tagiau a’r niferoedd eisoes wedi’u cofnodi felly gall ’dychwelyd’ symudiad arbed llawer o amser.</p>\n<p><strong>Cam 8 - Eich Cyfrif</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Mae’r adrannau hyn yn cynnwys yr holl wybodaeth bwysig sydd ei hangen arnom, mae hefyd yn gadael i chi wneud y canlynol:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Newid eich manylion</strong> - os oes angen i chi ddiweddaru’r wybodaeth a roddoch i ni pan wnaethoch chi gofrestru, gallwch wneud hyn yma. Er enghraifft, gallwch newid eich enw defnyddiwr, cyfeiriad e-bost, manylion cyswllt a’ch rhif CRN.</li>\n<li><strong>Newid eich cyfrinair</strong> - os oes angen i chi newid eich cyfrinair gallwch wneud hyn yma. Cofiwch wneud cyfrinair cryf - o leiaf 12 nod, llythrennau bach a mawr, rhifau ac atalnodi.</li>\n<li><strong>Dewisiadau diofyn</strong> - newid eich opsiynau diofyn, dyma’r gosodiadau y bydd y system yn eu cofio pan fyddwch yn sefydlu symudiad, e.e. rhif cofrestru cerbyd diofyn, gellir eu newid pan fyddwch yn rhoi gwybod am y symudiad.</li>\n<li><strong>Gweld a diwygio eich daliadau</strong> - ychwanegu, golygu a dileu eich rhifau diadell. Dywedwch wrthym ba ddaliad yw eich prif ddaliad yma.</li>\n<li><strong>Gweld a chwblhau eich Rhestr Flynyddol</strong> - defnyddir y Rhestr Flynyddol Defaid a Geifr i gofnodi nifer y defaid a’r geifr yr ydych yn eu cadw ar safleoedd unigol a’r rheswm dros eu cadw e.e. cig, llaeth, gwlân, bridio ac ati. Edrychwch ar restrau’r gorffennol yma a chwblhewch eich Rhestr Flynyddol cyn y dyddiad cau.</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- /wp:freeform --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"33.33%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:33.33%\"><!-- wp:html -->\n<div id=\"related-content-container\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:html --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->','Canllaw i ddefnyddwyr EIDCymru','','inherit','closed','closed','','193-revision-v1','','','2026-04-28 09:04:11','2026-04-28 09:04:11','',193,'http://localhost:8081/?p=196',0,'revision','',0),(197,3,'2026-04-28 09:10:42','2026-04-28 09:10:42','<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"66.66%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\"><!-- wp:freeform -->\n<h1>Frequently Asked Questions</h1>\n<p><strong>Contents</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"#getting-started\">Getting started</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#report-movements\">How do I use EIDCymru to report movements?</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#other-movements\">Can I report other types of movements? (e.g. cross-border, market, tack, shows, exports)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#readers\">What equipment do I need? Do I need a stick reader?</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#cphs\">CPHs, tCPHs and TLAs</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#qus\">Can I report moves to/from Quarantine Units (QUs)?</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#queries\">Other Queries</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#stray-sheep\">I have found a sheep, what shall I do?</a></li>\n</ol>\n<p id=\"getting-started\"><strong>Getting started</strong></p>\n<p><strong>What is Eidcymru?</strong></p>\n<p>EIDCymru is the electronic sheep and goat movement recording system for Wales. It provides Wales with a modern robust movement reporting and traceability system that is able to respond quickly and effectively in a disease outbreak.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>As a keeper, you can report and record your sheep movements electronically preventing the need for you to post the paper movement licence.</li>\n<li>It enables sheep/goat and deer movements to be traced between a keepers\' holding, markets, abattoirs and collection centres</li>\n<li>It also allows you to submit your Annual Inventory online</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>How Do I Register?</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"/en/information/registration-guide\">Click here</a> for our guide to getting registered.</p>\n<p><strong>I am trying to register on EIDCymru but it says my e-mail might be in use. Why?</strong></p>\n<p>If this message appears, it is likely you have already attempted to register for EIDCymru using this email address. To rectify this, either attempt to reset your password or contact EIDCymru on <a href=\"tel:+441970636959\">01970 636 959</a> or email <a href=\"mailto:contact@eidcymru.org\">contact@eidcymru.org</a>.</p>\n<p id=\"report-movements\"><strong>How do I use EIDCymru to report movements?</strong></p>\n<p><strong>How do I report movements (including tack and cross border) electronically?</strong></p>\n<p>Full details of how to create movements on the website are contained in the <a href=\"/en/information/user-guide\">User Guide</a> – including tack moves and cross-border moves.</p>\n<p><strong>Who is required to report electronically to EIDCymru?</strong></p>\n<p>All livestock markets, abattoirs, collection centres and assembly centres in Wales are mandated to report moves electronically.</p>\n<p><strong>Who is responsible for reporting a movement?</strong></p>\n<p>It is the responsibility of the receiving keeper to report a movement.</p>\n<p><strong>How long do I have to report a movement?</strong></p>\n<p>Movements must be reported within 3 days of the move.</p>\n<p><strong>If I create a movement electronically on EIDCymru, do I still need to use a paper movement form?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes. Once you create the movement electronically, the EIDCymru system will allow you to print a movement form which contains the details you have entered. The paper license will need to accompany the animals in-transit due to the Welfare of Animals (Transport) Order (WATO) legislation. The receiving keeper will need to retain the paper copy of the movement for 3 years.</p>\n<p id=\"other-movements\"><strong>Can I report other types of movements? (e.g. cross-border, market, tack, shows, exports)</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Cross-border</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Can I create a movement from one English holding to the other on EIDCymru?</strong></p>\n<p>No. Movements within England are managed by <a href=\"https://livestockinformation.org.uk/\">LI Ltd</a></p>\n<p><strong>Can I register an English CPH on my EIDCymru account?</strong></p>\n<p>No, English CPHs cannot be registered on EIDCymru but you can create an account on <a href=\"https://livestockinformation.org.uk/\">LI Ltd</a> for your English holdings.</p>\n<p><strong>Do records to/from England show on my account?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes, all records created by <a href=\"https://livestockinformation.org.uk/\">LI Ltd</a> from Welsh holdings will show on your account.</p>\n<p><strong>Can I accept records for animals purchased from an English market?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes, the records will show on your \'accept moves\' exactly the same as purchases from a Welsh market.</p>\n<p><strong>How can I change the details or a movement?</strong></p>\n<p>To change the details of a movement you will need to contact EIDCymru on <a href=\"tel:+441970636959\">01970 636 959</a> or email <a href=\"mailto:contact@eidcymru.org\">contact@eidcymru.org</a></p>\n<p><strong>I regularly send animals to an English abattoir but these records are not showing on my account. Who should I contact?</strong></p>\n<p>If you can\'t see the records, contact the abattoir, they are responsible for uploading the movements to <a href=\"https://livestockinformation.org.uk/\">LI Ltd</a> which in turn should show on your account.</p>\n<p><strong>Tack</strong></p>\n<p><strong>I\'m moving animals to tack, do I need to record all individual tag numbers on the licence?... as I still have ownership of these animals.</strong></p>\n<p>Yes. All individual tag numbers are needed on the licence (AML1) when animals move between two different (Welsh) CPHs even if you own both and it is a movement within ownership. <a href=\"https://www.gov.wales/sheep-and-goat-identification-guidance-keepers\">Click here for more information</a>.</p>\n<p><strong>Can I use EIDCymru to create a movement from tack to tack when both the holdings are not registered on my account?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes. This is possible, and the details will be viewable in the Tack tab under Movement Records. For details of how to create this, <a href=\"/en/information/user-guide#Records\">Click here for the User Guide</a>.</p>\n<p><strong>Vet</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Do I need to report movements to a vet?</strong></p>\n<p>No, you should record the move in the holding register but you do not have to fill in a movement document or report electronically.</p>\n<p><strong>Imports and exports:</strong></p>\n<p><strong>What are the rules for Imports &amp; Exports?</strong></p>\n<p>Current requirements for exports and imports can be found in the <a href=\"https://www.gov.wales/sites/default/files/publications/2025-07/sheep-and-goat-identification-guidance-keepers.pdf\">Sheep and Goat Keepers Guidance 2021</a> (Please refer to Section Four: Movements and Movement Reporting)</p>\n<p><strong>Shows</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Do I need to report movements to Showground electronically?</strong></p>\n<p>All movements to shows and exhibitions must be reported and can be done electronically. However, some shows cannot report moves electronically. Therefore, keepers can continue with paper movement licences, and these must then be sent to EIDCymru.</p>\n<p id=\"readers\"><strong>Do I need a stick reader?</strong></p>\n<p><strong>What equipment do I need to use EIDCymru?</strong></p>\n<p>EIDCymru is a web-based service that you can access using any standard internet web browser and internet connection. The quickest and most accurate way to record the individual animal number is by using an EID reader to record EID tags electronically with the ability to download the numbers onto a device such as your computer or mobile phone/tablet:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>An EID reader is a portable device such as a stick reader or a static panel reader which fits into a sheep race.</li>\n<li>There are several makes and models available, and a supplier of EID equipment would be able to provide advice on which EID reader would best suit your farm business needs.</li>\n</ul>\n<p id=\"cphs\"><strong>CPHs, tCPHs and TLAs</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Why is my CPH number not recognised?</strong></p>\n<p>Check you are using the correct format – it should look like this 12/345/6789 (with the forward slashes included). If it\'s a new CPH it may be that our system doesn\'t recognise it yet so either try again a couple of days or contact us and we can check with RPW on your behalf. If the CPH has been inputted correctly the address should be automatically displayed. If the CPH still isn\'t recognised – contact the Bureau on <a href=\"tel:+441970636959\">01970 636 959</a>.</p>\n<p><strong>I\'ve purchased land and have been issued a new CPH. Do I need to complete a licence for the sheep which occupy the land?</strong></p>\n<p>No movement licence is needed, because the sheep are not physically moving from leaving the land. The sheep tags will need to be individually recorded in your new flock book for the new CPH.</p>\n<p><strong>I rent land under a Temporary CPH (tCPH). Do I need to report movements from my home holding to the tCPH?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes, you must report all movements to/from the tCPH and record in the flock/herd register.</p>\n<p><strong>I rent land under a Temporary Land Association (TLA). Do I need to report movements from my home holding to a Temporary Land Association (TLA)?</strong></p>\n<p>For the duration of the TLA, the land will be treated as part of the tenant\'s permanent CPH for livestock movement reporting purposes.</p>\n<p id=\"qus\"><strong>Can I report moves to/from Quarantine Units (QUs)?</strong></p>\n<p><strong>How do I register for a Quarantine Unit (QU)?</strong></p>\n<p>Contact the <a href=\"https://www.qwfc.co.uk/\">QWFC</a> office on <a href=\"tel:+441970636688\">01970 636 688</a>.</p>\n<p><strong>How do I report movements in/out of a QU?</strong></p>\n<p>Movements <strong>into</strong> a QU need to be reported within 24hrs electronically. Movements <strong>out</strong> of a QU need to be reported electronically or by paper within 3 days.</p>\n<p id=\"queries\"><strong>Other Queries &amp; Useful Links</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>CPH queries – contact via your RPW online account or RPW Customer Contact Centre <a href=\"tel:+44300625004\">03000 625 004</a>.</li>\n<li>Livestock Policy queries – <a href=\"tel:+443000255022\">03000 255 022</a>.</li>\n<li>Flock number queries – <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/guidance/get-help-with-animal-and-plant-health\">Animal Plant Health Agency (APHA)</a> <a href=\"tel:+443003038268\">0300 303 8268</a>.</li>\n<li>Movement licence and Annual Inventory queries – EIDCymru office <a href=\"tel:+441970636959\">01970 636 959</a> or <a href=\"mailto:contact@eidcymru.org\">contact@eidcymru.org</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p id=\"stray-sheep\"><strong>If you\'ve found a stray sheep on your land</strong></p>\n<p><strong>I have a stray sheep on my holding, who should I contact?</strong></p>\n<p>You should contact your local Trading Standards office. They will contact the owner of the animal.</p>\n<!-- /wp:freeform --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"33.33%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:33.33%\"><!-- wp:html -->\n<div id=\"related-content-container\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:html --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','FAQs','','publish','closed','closed','','faqs','','','2026-04-28 10:59:19','2026-04-28 10:59:19','',93,'http://localhost:8081/?page_id=197',0,'page','',0),(198,3,'2026-04-28 09:10:42','2026-04-28 09:10:42','<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"66.66%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\"><!-- wp:freeform -->\n<h1>FAQs</h1>\n<!-- /wp:freeform --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"33.33%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:33.33%\"><!-- wp:html -->\n<div id=\"related-content-container\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:html --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','FAQs','','inherit','closed','closed','','197-revision-v1','','','2026-04-28 09:10:42','2026-04-28 09:10:42','',197,'http://localhost:8081/?p=198',0,'revision','',0),(199,3,'2026-04-28 09:11:36','2026-04-28 09:11:36','<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"66.66%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\"><!-- wp:freeform -->\n<h1>Registration guide</h1>\n<p><strong>Getting registered with EIDCymru</strong></p>\n<p><strong>By registering with EIDCymru, you will be able to:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Access your sheep and goat movement history</li>\n<li>Accept movements on to your farm from markets and from other farmers</li>\n<li>Complete your Annual Inventory</li>\n<li>Report your movements electronically</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>To start using EIDCymru, you will need to register for an account.<br />Please have the following information to hand to help you complete the registration process:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Your email</li>\n<li>Primary Farm CPH</li>\n<li>RPW Customer Reference Number (CRN)</li>\n<li>Your six-digit Flock Number</li>\n</ul>\n<p> </p>\n<p><strong>Step 1: Register</strong></p>\n<p>To get registered, open the EIDCymru website, found at <a href=\"https://www.eidcymru.org/\">www.eidcymru.org</a>, choose your preferred language, then scroll down and click on the link <a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/account/register/security\">Register</a>.</p>\n<p><strong><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-214\" src=\"http://localhost:8081/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/reg-guide-1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"237\" height=\"203\" /> </strong></p>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-215\" src=\"http://localhost:8081/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/reg-guide-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"146\" height=\"99\" /></p>\n<p><strong>Step 2: Create your account</strong></p>\n<p>You will need to create a username that is unique to your account. Please choose your username carefully as it will be seen by others. Your chosen username may already be in use by another account, therefore please make sure it is unique enough.</p>\n<p>You will also need a valid email address. This email address can only be used against <strong>one EIDCymru account</strong>.</p>\n<p>You will then need to create a password that contains at least 12 characters, and one each of the following:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>uppercase letter (A–Z)</li>\n<li>lowercase letter (a–z)</li>\n<li>number (0–9)</li>\n<li>special character (!*£$%^&amp;,.?)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Once completed, select the <strong>Save and continue</strong> button.</p>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-216\" src=\"http://localhost:8081/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/reg-guide-3-147x300.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"147\" height=\"300\" /></p>\n<p><strong>Step 3: Enter Primary CPH</strong></p>\n<p>You will then be directed to the page to enter your <strong>Primary CPH</strong> – please make sure it is entered in the format <strong>CC/PPP/HHHH</strong>.</p>\n<p>You can then enter your Farm Address details. Please note that where the Contact Address is different to the Farm Address, you can tick the box and continue to a separate page to enter a different Contact Address.</p>\n<p>Otherwise, once completed, select the <strong>Save and continue</strong> button.</p>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-217\" src=\"http://localhost:8081/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/reg-guide-4-147x300.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"147\" height=\"300\" /></p>\n<p><strong>Step 4: Enter RPW Customer Reference Number (CRN)</strong></p>\n<p>The page will continue so that you can enter a few further details. Here you will need to enter your <strong>RPW Customer Reference Number (CRN)</strong>. Your CRN will start with <strong>A</strong> followed by a <strong>7-digit number</strong>.</p>\n<p>Your Primary Farm CPH and CRN must correspond to the same RPW Account.</p>\n<p>If you do not know your CRN, please log in to your RPW Online Account or contact Rural Payments Wales on <a href=\"tel:+4403000625004\">0300 062 5004</a>. Once completed, select the <strong>Save and continue</strong> button.</p>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-218\" src=\"http://localhost:8081/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/reg-guide-5-124x300.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"124\" height=\"300\" /></p>\n<p><strong>Step 5: Enter six-digit Flock Number</strong></p>\n<p>You will then reach the page that asks for your <strong>six-digit Flock Number</strong>, which is provided by APHA. Your flock number will start with a <strong>7</strong> followed by a <strong>5-digit number</strong> and must be your Primary Flock Number that matches your Primary CPH.</p>\n<p>Again, once completed, select the <strong>Save and continue</strong> button where you will be guided to a Summary Page and, if happy with the information provided, you can select <strong>Create your EIDCymru account</strong>.</p>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-219\" src=\"http://localhost:8081/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/reg-guide-6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"156\" height=\"163\" /></p>\n<p>A message will be sent to your chosen email address, and you will need to click on the link provided in the email to activate your account and complete the registration.</p>\n<p>After activating your account, your setup is complete, and you can start to use EIDCymru.</p>\n<p>If you require assistance, please use the <a href=\"https://www.eidcymru.org/app/sheep/contact\">Contact us</a> button on the EIDCymru website; send an email to <a href=\"mailto:contact@eidcymru.org\">contact@eidcymru.org</a> or phone <a href=\"tel:+441970636959\">01970 636959</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:freeform --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"33.33%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:33.33%\"><!-- wp:html -->\n<div id=\"related-content-container\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:html --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->','Registration guide','','publish','closed','closed','','registration-guide','','','2026-04-28 10:30:51','2026-04-28 10:30:51','',93,'http://localhost:8081/?page_id=199',0,'page','',0),(200,3,'2026-04-28 09:11:36','2026-04-28 09:11:36','<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"66.66%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\"><!-- wp:freeform -->\n<div>\n<h1>Registration guide</h1>\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:freeform --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"33.33%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:33.33%\"><!-- wp:html -->\n<div id=\"related-content-container\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:html --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->','Registration guide','','inherit','closed','closed','','199-revision-v1','','','2026-04-28 09:11:36','2026-04-28 09:11:36','',199,'http://localhost:8081/?p=200',0,'revision','',0),(201,3,'2026-04-28 09:13:18','2026-04-28 09:13:18','<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"66.66%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\"><!-- wp:freeform -->\n<h1>Cofrestru gydag EIDCymru</h1>\n<p><strong>Drwy gofrestru gyda EIDCymru byddwch yn medru:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Cael mynediad i’ch symudiadau defaid a geifr</li>\n<li>Derbyn symudiadau ymlaen o farchnadoedd a gan ffermwyr eraill</li>\n<li>Cwblhau eich Stocrestr Flynyddol</li>\n<li>Adrodd am eich symudiadau’n electroneg</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Cyn defnyddio EIDCymru, bydd angen cofrestru am gyfrif.<br />Bydd angen yr wybodaeth ganlynol arnoch er mwyn eich cynorthwyo i gwblhau’r broses gofrestru:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Eich cyfeiriad e-bost</li>\n<li>Rhif eich Prif Ddaliad (CPH)</li>\n<li>Rhif Cyfeirnod Cwsmer (CRN) RPW</li>\n<li>Rhif diadell chwe digid</li>\n</ul>\n<p> </p>\n<p><strong>Cam 1: Cofrestru</strong></p>\n<p>I gofrestru, agorwch wefan EIDCymru <a href=\"https://www.eidcymru.org/\">www.eidcymru.org</a>, dewiswch eich iaith, yna pwyso’r ddolen <a href=\"https://www.eidcymru.org/app/sheep/cy/account/register/security\">Creu eich cyfrif</a>.</p>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-224\" src=\"http://localhost:8081/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/reg-guide-1-cy-300x257.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"257\" /></p>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-225\" src=\"http://localhost:8081/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/reg-guide-2-cy-300x134.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"134\" /></p>\n<p><strong>Cam 2: Creu eich cyfrif</strong></p>\n<p>Byddwch yn creu enw defnyddiwr unigryw i’r cyfrif. Dewiswch eich enw defnyddiwr yn ofalus gan y caiff ei weld gan ddefnyddwyr eraill. Mae’n bosib y bydd yr enw defnyddiwr o’ch dewis wedi’i gymryd yn barod (e.e. Jones neu Tygwyn) felly gwnewch yn siŵr ei fod yn hollol unigryw.</p>\n<p>Bydd angen cyfeiriad e-bost dilys. Dim ond ar gyfer <strong>un cyfrif EIDCymru</strong> y bydd yr e-bost hwn yn medru cael ei ddefnyddio.</p>\n<p>Yna fydd angen i chi creu cyfrinair, sydd yn cynnwys o leiaf 12 nod, ac un yr un o’r canlynol:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Prif lythyren (A-Z)</li>\n<li>Llythyren fach (a-z)</li>\n<li>Rhif (0-9)</li>\n<li>Nod arbennig (!*£$%^&amp;,.?)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Pwyswch <strong>Cadw a pharhau</strong> i symud ‘mlaen.</p>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-226\" src=\"http://localhost:8081/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/reg-guide-3-cy-147x300.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"147\" height=\"300\" /></p>\n<p><strong>Cam 3: Cofnodi eich Prif Daliad (CPH)</strong></p>\n<p>Byddwch yn cael eich cyfeirio at dudalen i ychwanegu eich <strong>Prif ddaliad (CPH)</strong> – yn y fformat <strong>CC/PPP/HHHH</strong>.</p>\n<p>Ychwanegwch gyfeiriad eich fferm. Nodwch fod modd rhoi cyfeiriad cyswllt arall os yw’n wahanol i gyfeiriad y fferm, drwy roi tic yn y blwch.</p>\n<p>Pwyswch <strong>Cadw a pharhau</strong>.</p>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-227\" src=\"http://localhost:8081/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/reg-guide-4-cy-147x300.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"147\" height=\"300\" /></p>\n<p><strong>Cam 4: Cofnodi eich Rhif Cyfeirnod Cwsmer (CRN)</strong></p>\n<p>Bydd y dudalen nesaf yn gofyn am fwy o fanylion. Yma bydd angen ichi nodi eich <strong>rhif Cyfeirnod Cwsmer (CRN)</strong>. Bydd eich CRN yn cychwyn gydag <strong>A</strong> <strong>yna rhif 7 digid</strong>.</p>\n<p>Bydd angen i CPH eich Prif Ddaliad a’r CRN gyfateb i’r un cyfrif ar RPW.</p>\n<p>Os nad ydych yn gwybod eich CRN, mewn gofnodwch i’ch cyfrif RPW Ar-lein neu cysylltwch gyda RPW ar <a href=\"tel:+4403000625004\">0300 062 5004</a>. Pwyswch <strong>Cadw a pharhau</strong>.</p>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-228\" src=\"http://localhost:8081/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/reg-guide-5-cy-125x300.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"125\" height=\"300\" /></p>\n<p><strong>Cam 5: Cofnodi rif chwe digid eich Diadell</strong></p>\n<p>Bydd y dudalen nesaf yn gofyn am rif <strong>chwe digid eich Diadell</strong>, sydd wedi ei ddarparu gan APHA. Bydd eich rhif diadell yn cychwyn gyda <strong>7</strong> yna <strong>rhif 5 digid</strong> a rhaid iddo fod yn brif rif eich diadell sy’n cyfateb i’ch prif CPH.</p>\n<p>Pwyswch <strong>Cadw a pharhau</strong> yna gwirio fod y manylion i gyd yn gywir cyn pwyso <strong>Creu eich cyfrif EID Cymru</strong> ar y dudalen Grynodeb.</p>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-229\" src=\"http://localhost:8081/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/reg-guide-6-cy.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"155\" height=\"161\" /></p>\n<p>Bydd neges yn cael ei hanfon i’ch cyfeiriad e-bost a bydd angen i chi bwyso ar y ddolen yn yr e-bost i gadarnhau eich cyfrif ac i orffen y broses gofrestru.</p>\n<p>Rydych nawr yn barod i ddefnyddio eich cyfrif EIDCymru.</p>\n<p>Os oes angen unrhyw gymorth arnoch, defnyddiwch y botwm <a href=\"https://www.eidcymru.org/app/sheep/cy/contact\">Cysylltwch â ni</a> ar y wefan, anfonwch e-bost at <a href=\"mailto:cymorth@eidcymru.org\">cymorth@eidcymru.org</a> neu ffoniwch <a href=\"tel:+441970636959\">01970 636959</a>.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<!-- /wp:freeform --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"33.33%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:33.33%\"><!-- wp:html -->\n<div id=\"related-content-container\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:html --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Cofrestru gydag EIDCymru','','publish','closed','closed','','cofrestru-gydag-eidcymru','','','2026-04-28 10:50:53','2026-04-28 10:50:53','',95,'http://localhost:8081/?page_id=201',0,'page','',0),(202,3,'2026-04-28 09:13:18','2026-04-28 09:13:18','<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"66.66%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\"><!-- wp:freeform -->\n<h1>Cofrestru gydag EIDCymru</h1>\n<!-- /wp:freeform --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"33.33%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:33.33%\"><!-- wp:html -->\n<div id=\"related-content-container\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:html --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->','Cofrestru gydag EIDCymru','','inherit','closed','closed','','201-revision-v1','','','2026-04-28 09:13:18','2026-04-28 09:13:18','',201,'http://localhost:8081/?p=202',0,'revision','',0),(203,3,'2026-04-28 09:14:32','2026-04-28 09:14:32','<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"66.66%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\"><!-- wp:freeform -->\n<h1>Cwestiynau cyffredin</h1>\n<p><strong>Cynnwys</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"#dechrau\">Dechrau</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#defnyddio\">Sut ydw i\'n defnyddio EIDCymru i adrodd am symudiadau?</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#adrodd\">Sut ydw i\'n adrodd am symudiadau eraill (e.e Trawsffinion, Tac, Sioeau)?</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#darllenydd\">Pa offer sydd ei angen i ddefnyddio EID?</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#cphs\">Gwybodaeth am CPHs, tCPHs aTLAs</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#qus\">Sut ydw i\'n cofrestru Uned Gwarantin (QU)?</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#ymholiadau\">Ymholiadau eraill...</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#defaid\">Mae dafad ddieithr ar fy naliad, â phwy ddylwn gysylltu?</a></li>\n</ol>\n<p id=\"dechrau\"><strong>Dechrau</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Beth yw EIDCymru?</strong></p>\n<p>EIDCymru yw\'r system electronig ar gyfer cofnodi symudiadau defaid a geifr yng Nghymru. Mae\'n sicrhau bod gan Gymru system fodern, gadarn, ar gyfer olrhain ac adrodd am symudiadau, sy\'n gallu ymateb yn gyflym ac yn effeithiol os oes achosion o glefyd.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Fel ceidwad, gallwch gofnodi ac adrodd am symudiadau eich defaid yn electronig, gan osgoi\'r angen ichi bostio\'r drwydded symud bapur.</li>\n<li>Mae\'n galluogi olrhain symudiadau defaid/geifr/ceirw rhwng daliad ceidwad, marchnadoedd, lladd-dai a chanolfannau casglu.</li>\n<li>Mae hefyd yn eich galluogi i gyflwyno eich Stocrestr Flynyddol ar-lein.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Sut ydw i\'n cofrestru?</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"/cy/information/registration-guide\">Cliciwch yma</a> i weld ein canllawiau ar gofrestru.</p>\n<p><strong>Rwy\'n ceisio cofrestru gydag EIDCymru ond mae\'n dweud ei bod yn bosibl bod fy nghyfeiriad e-bost eisoes yn cael ei ddefnyddio?</strong></p>\n<p>Os ydych yn gweld y neges hon, mae\'n bosibl eich bod chi eisoes wedi ceisio cofrestru gydag EIDCymru gan ddefnyddio\'r cyfeiriad e-bost hwn. I gywiro hyn, naill ai ceisiwch ailosod eich cyfrinair, neu gysylltu â swyddfa EIDCymru: <a href=\"mailto:cymorth@eidcymru.org\">cymorth@eidcymru.org</a> neu <a href=\"tel:+441970636959\">01970 636 959</a>.</p>\n<p id=\"defnyddio\"><strong>Defnyddio EIDCymru i adrodd am symudiadau</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Sut ydw i\'n adrodd am symudiadau (gan gynnwys tac a thrawsffiniol)?</strong></p>\n<p>Mae manylion llawn ynghylch sut i greu symudiadau ar y wefan yn y <a href=\"/cy/information/user-guide\">Canllawiau i Ddefnyddwyr</a> gan gynnwys symudiadau tac a thrawsffiniol.</p>\n<p><strong>I bwy mae\'r gofyniad i adrodd i EIDCymru yn electronig yn berthnasol?</strong></p>\n<p>Mae\'n rhaid i bob marchnad da byw, lladd-dy, canolfan gasglu a chanolfan grynhoi adrodd am symudiadau\'n electronig. Rydych chi fel ceidwaid yn cael eich annog i adrodd am symudiadau\'n electronig a bydd gwneud hynny\'n fuddiol ichi.</p>\n<p><strong>Pwy sy\'n gyfrifol am adrodd am symudiad?</strong></p>\n<p>Y ceidwad sy\'n derbyn y da byw sy\'n gyfrifol am adrodd am symudiad.</p>\n<p><strong>Faint o amser sydd gennyf i adrodd am symudiad?</strong></p>\n<p>Rhaid adrodd am y symudiad o fewn tri diwrnod.</p>\n<p><strong>Os wy\'n cofnodi symudiad yn electronig ar EIDCymru, oes rhaid imi ddefnyddio ffurflen symud bapur hefyd?</strong></p>\n<p>Oes. Pan fyddwch wedi cofnodi\'r symudiad yn electronig, bydd system EIDCymru yn eich galluogi i argraffu\'r ffurflen symud sy\'n cynnwys y manylion rydych wedi eu mewnbynnu. Bydd rhaid i\'r drwydded bapur fynd gyda\'r anifeiliaid wrth iddynt gael eu cludo, yn unol â deddfwriaeth y Gorchymyn Lles Anifeiliaid (Cludo) (WATO). Hefyd bydd angen i\'r ceidwad sy\'n derbyn anifeiliaid, gadw copi papur o\'r ffurflen symud ar gyfer ei gofnodion ei hun.</p>\n<p><strong>Fel y ceidwad sy\'n derbyn da byw, oes rhaid imi gofnodi ffurflen symud bapur rwyf wedi\'i derbyn yn electronig?</strong></p>\n<p>Oes, yn yr achos hwn, gall y ceidwad sy\'n derbyn y da byw (os yw wedi\'i gofrestru gydag EIDCymru) fewngofnodi i\'w gyfrif a chreu\'r symudiad.</p>\n<p id=\"adrodd\"><strong>Adrodd am symudiadau eraill</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Trawsffiniol</strong></p>\n<p><strong>A gaf greu symudiad o un daliad i\'r llall yn Lloegr ar EIDCymru?</strong></p>\n<p>Na chwech. Rheolir symudiadau yn Lloegr gan <a href=\"https://livestockinformation.org.uk/\">LI Ltd</a>.</p>\n<p><strong>A gaf gofrestru CPH yn Lloegr ar fy nghyfrif EIDCymru?</strong></p>\n<p>Na chewch. Ni ellir cofrestru CPHs yn Lloegr ar EIDCymru, ond cewch greu cyfrif ar <a href=\"https://livestockinformation.org.uk/\">LI Ltd</a> ar gyfer eich daliadau yn Lloegr.</p>\n<p><strong>A yw cofnodion i/o Loegr yn dangos ar fy Nghyfrif?</strong></p>\n<p>Ydynt, bydd pob cofnod a grëir ar <a href=\"https://livestockinformation.org.uk/\">LI Ltd</a> yn dangos ar eich cyfrif.</p>\n<p><strong>A gaf dderbyn cofnodion ar gyfer anifeiliaid a brynwyd mewn marchnad yn Lloegr?</strong></p>\n<p>Cewch. Bydd y cofnodion yn dangos yn eich adran \'Derbyn Symudiadau\', yn union yr un ffordd â da byw rydych wedi eu prynu o farchnad yng Nghymru.</p>\n<p><strong>Sut ydw i\'n newid y manylion?</strong></p>\n<p>I newid manylion symudiad bydd rhaid ichi gysylltu â swyddfa EIDCymru neu greu ymholiad yn eich cofnod symudiadau.</p>\n<p><strong>Rwy\'n anfon anifeiliaid i ladd-dy yn Lloegr yn rheolaidd ond nid yw\'r cofnodion hyn yn ymddangos ar fy nghyfrif. Â phwy ddylwn i gysylltu?</strong></p>\n<p>Os nad ydych yn gweld y cofnodion, cysylltwch â\'r lladd-dy. Nhw sy\'n gyfrifol am lanlwytho\'r symudiadau i <a href=\"https://livestockinformation.org.uk/\">LI Ltd</a>, a ddylai yn eu tro ymddangos ar eich cyfrif.</p>\n<p><strong>Tac</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Rwy\'n symud anifeiliaid i dir tac, oes rhaid imi gofnodi rhifau tag unigol ar y drwydded, gan fy mod yn parhau i fod yn berchen ar yr anifeiliaid hyn.</strong></p>\n<p>Oes. Mae angen nodi pob rhif tag ar y drwydded (AML1) pan fydd anifeiliaid yn symud rhwng dau CPH (yng Nghymru), hyd yn oed os mai chi sy\'n berchen ar y ddau CPH ac mae\'r anifeiliaid yn cael eu cludo o fewn eich eiddo. <a href=\"https://llyw.cymru/adnabod-defaid-geifr-canllawiau-i-geidwaid?_ga=2.222631835.149454102.1638258574-1108566482.1629359138\">Adnabod defaid a geifr: canllawiau i geidwaid</a></p>\n<p><strong>A gaf ddefnyddio EIDCymru i gofnodi symudiad rhwng dau ddarn o dir tac, pan nad yw\'r ddau ddaliad wedi eu cofrestru ar fy nghyfrif?</strong></p>\n<p>Cewch. Mae hyn yn bosibl a gallwch weld y manylion o dan y tab \'Tac\' o dan \'Gofnodion Symud\'. Mae gwybodaeth am sut i wneud hyn yma. <a href=\"/cy/information/user-guide\">Canllaw i Ddefnyddwyr</a>.</p>\n<p><strong>Milfeddygon</strong></p>\n<p><strong>A oes rhaid imi adrodd am symudiadau i filfeddyg?</strong></p>\n<p>Nac oes, dylech chi gofnodi\'r symudiad yng nghofrestr y daliad, ond nid oes rhaid ichi gwblhau dogfen symud neu adrodd y symudiad yn electronig.</p>\n<p><strong>Allforion a Mewnforion</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Beth yw\'r rheolau ar gyfer allforion a mewnforion?</strong></p>\n<p>Mae\'r gofynion cyfredol ar gyfer allforion a mewnforion ar gael yn y ddogfen <a href=\"https://llyw.cymru/adnabod-defaid-geifr-canllawiau-i-geidwaid?_ga=2.222631835.149454102.1638258574-1108566482.1629359138\">Adnabod defaid a geifr: canllawiau i geidwaid</a> Gwelwch Adran 4: Symudiadau ac Adrodd am Symudiadau.</p>\n<p><strong>Sioeau</strong></p>\n<p><strong>A oes rhaid imi adrodd yn electronig am symudiadau i feysydd sioeau?</strong></p>\n<p>Rhaid adrodd am symudiadau i sioeau ac arddangosfeydd, ond nid yw\'n orfodol gwneud hynny\'n electronig. Rhaid cyflwyno\'r copi papur gwyn ym maes y sioe, a bydd yn cael ei anfon at y swyddfa. Caiff y ceidwaid naill ai gofnodi symudiad yn electronig ar ei gyfrif EID Cymru neu anfon y drwydded bapur ar gyfer dychwelyd o\'r sioe.</p>\n<p id=\"darllenydd\"><strong>Defnyddio darllenydd EID</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Pa offer sydd ei angen i ddefnyddio EID?</strong></p>\n<p>Mae EIDCymru yn wasanaeth gwe y gellir cael mynediad ato ag unrhyw borwr gwe safonol a chysylltiad â\'r we. Y ffordd gyflymaf a mwyaf cywir o gofnodi rhif unigol anifail yw defnyddio darllenydd EID i gofnodi tagiau EID yn electronig, gyda\'r gallu i lawrlwytho\'r rhifau i ddyfais fel cyfrifiadur neu ffôn symudol/llechen:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Mae darllenydd EID yn ddyfais gludadwy fel darllenydd ffon sy\'n cael ei gosod mewn rhedfa ddefaid.</li>\n<li>Mae nifer o wneuthurwyr yn cynnig nifer o fodelau, a byddai cyflenwr offer EID yn gallu rhoi cyngor ar y darllenydd EID gorau ar gyfer eich busnes fferm.</li>\n</ul>\n<p id=\"cphs\"><strong>CPHs, tCPHs a TLAs</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Pam nad yw fy rhif CPH yn cael ei adnabod?</strong></p>\n<p>Gwiriwch eich bod yn defnyddio\'r fformat cywir – dylai fod ar y ffurf \'12/345/3789\' (gan gynnwys y blaen sleisiau). Os yw\'r CPH yn newydd, mae\'n bosibl nad yw ein system yn ei adnabod eto. Arhoswch am ddiwrnod neu ddau a rhoi cynnig arall arni, neu gysylltu â ni a byddwn ni\'n gwirio gyda RPW ar eich rhan chi. Os yw\'r CPH wedi cael ei fewnbynnu\'n gywir dylai\'r cyfeiriad ymddangos yn awtomatig. Os nad yw\'n CPH yn cael ei adnabod ar ôl hynny, cysylltwch â\'r Swyddfa.</p>\n<p><strong>Rwyf wedi prynu tir ac wedi derbyn rhif CPH newydd. Oes rhaid imi gwblhau trwydded ar gyfer y defaid sy\'n byw ar y tir?</strong></p>\n<p>Nac oes, nid oes angen trwydded symud, oherwydd nad yw\'r defaid yn symud o\'r tir. Bydd angen cofnodi\'r tagiau\'n unigol yn llyfr y ddiadell ar gyfer eich CPH newydd.</p>\n<p><strong>Rwyf wedi llwyddo i roi darn o dir rwy\'n ei rentu o dan CPH dros dro (tCPH). Oes rhaid imi adrodd am symudiadau o fy naliad arferol i\'r tCPH?</strong></p>\n<p>Oes. Mae angen adrodd am symudiadau i/o tCPH.</p>\n<p><strong>Rwy\'n rhentu tir o dan Gysylltiad Tir Dros Dro. A oes angen imi adrodd ar symudiadau o fy mhrif ddaliad i dir o dan Gysylltiad Tir Dros Dro?</strong></p>\n<p>Am gyfnod y Cysylltiad Tir Dros Dro, bydd y tir yn cael ei drin fel rhan o CPH parhaol y tenant at ddibenion symud ac adrodd ar symud da byw.</p>\n<p id=\"qus\"><strong>Unedau Cwarantin (QUs)</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Sut ydw i\'n cofrestru Uned Gwarantin(QU)?</strong></p>\n<p>Cysylltwch â\'r swyddfa <a href=\"https://www.qwfc.co.uk/cy\">QWFC</a>, <a href=\"tel:+441970636688\">01970 636 688</a>.</p>\n<p><strong>Sut ydw i\'n adrodd am symudiadau i mewn i/allan o Uned Gwarantin?</strong></p>\n<p>Mae angen adrodd am symudiadau <strong>i mewn i</strong> Uned Gwarantin yn electronig o fewn 24 awr. Mae angen adrodd am symudiadau <strong>allan o</strong> Uned Gwarantin yn electronig neu ar bapur o fewn tri diwrnod.</p>\n<p id=\"ymholiadau\"><strong>Ymholiadau eraill</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Ymholiadau am CPH – cysylltwch drwy eich cyfrif RPW Ar-lein neu Ganolfan Gyswllt i Gwsmeriaid RPW ar <a href=\"tel:+4403000625004\">03000 625 004</a>.</li>\n<li>Ymholiadau am Bolisïau Da Byw – <a href=\"tel:+443000255022\">03000 255 052</a>.</li>\n<li>Ymholiadau am Rifau Diadell – Yr Asiantaeth Iechyd Anifeiliaid a Phlanhigion <a href=\"tel:+443003038268\">0300 303 8268</a>.</li>\n<li>Ymholiadau am Drwyddedau Symud a\'r Stocrestr Flynyddol – EIDCymru <a href=\"tel:+441970636959\">01970 636 959</a> or <a href=\"mailto:cymorth@eidcymru.org\">cymorth@eidcymru.org</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p id=\"defaid\"><strong>Defaid Dieithr</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Mae dafad ddieithr ar fy naliad, â phwy ddylwn gysylltu?</strong></p>\n<p>Dylech gysylltu â\'ch Swyddfa Safonau Masnach leol. Byddan nhw\'n cysylltu â pherchennog yr anifail.</p>\n<!-- /wp:freeform --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"33.33%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:33.33%\"><!-- wp:html -->\n<div id=\"related-content-container\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:html --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->','Cwestiynau cyffredin','','publish','closed','closed','','cwestiynau-cyffredin','','','2026-04-28 11:02:05','2026-04-28 11:02:05','',95,'http://localhost:8081/?page_id=203',0,'page','',0),(204,3,'2026-04-28 09:14:32','2026-04-28 09:14:32','<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"66.66%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\"><!-- wp:freeform -->\n<h1>Cwestiynau cyffredin</h1>\n<!-- /wp:freeform --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"33.33%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:33.33%\"><!-- wp:html -->\n<div id=\"related-content-container\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:html --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->','Cwestiynau cyffredin','','inherit','closed','closed','','203-revision-v1','','','2026-04-28 09:14:32','2026-04-28 09:14:32','',203,'http://localhost:8081/?p=204',0,'revision','',0),(205,3,'2026-04-28 09:28:30','2026-04-28 09:28:30','<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"66.66%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\"><!-- wp:freeform -->\n<h1>EIDCymru User guide</h1>\n<p><strong>Choose a topic from the list below to get easy step-by-step instructions:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Step 1     <a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/userguide#Create\"><strong>Register for an account</strong></a></li>\n<li>Step 2     <a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/userguide#Login\"><strong>Log in to EIDCymru</strong></a></li>\n<li>Step 3     <a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/userguide#Accept\"><strong>Accepting a movement</strong></a></li>\n<li>Step 4     <a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/userguide#Report\"><strong>Reporting a movement</strong></a></li>\n<li>Step 5     <a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/userguide#Tags\"><strong>Enter tag details</strong></a></li>\n<li>Step 6     <a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/userguide#Records\"><strong>Movement records</strong></a></li>\n<li>Step 7     <a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/userguide#Returns\"><strong>Return or forward a movement</strong></a></li>\n<li>Step 8     <a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/userguide#Account\"><strong>Your account</strong></a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Step 1 - Register for an account</strong></p>\n<p><strong>To register for an account with EIDCymru you will need:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>your contact details - email address, contact address and telephone numbers</li>\n<li>the CPH number of your main holding</li>\n<li>your CRN (Customer Reference Number), this is issued by <a href=\"https://www.gov.wales/rural-payments-wales-rpw-online\">Rural Payments Wales</a> (RPW), <a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/%E2%80%9Ctel:+443000625004%22\">0300 062 5004</a> Phone: <a href=\"tel:+443000625004\">0300 062 5004</a></li>\n<li>a Flock / Herd number for your main holding, provided by <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/guidance/get-help-with-animal-and-plant-health\">Animal Plant Health Agency (APHA)</a> Phone: <a href=\"tel:+4403003038268\">0300 303 8268</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Go to the EIDCymru website </strong><a href=\"http://www.eidcymru.org/\"><strong>www.eidcymru.org</strong></a><strong> choose your language, click on the Register link on the next page and follow these steps:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Enter your details, choose a unique username (this will be shown on your movement records, and seen by others) and a strong password.</li>\n<li>Tell us the details of your main CPH in the correct format e.g. 11/222/3333. Also tell us the CRN associated with this CPH.</li>\n<li>Select your main species - choose sheep, goats or deer, and tell us your main flock / herd number.</li>\n<li>Check that the details on the summary page are correct before selecting Create your EIDCymru Account.</li>\n<li>Check your email, we will have sent you an email to verify your email address, click on the link provided.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>If you need further help, look at the Help &amp; Information section on the top toolbar of the website, or contact EIDCymru on <a href=\"tel:+4401970636959\">01970 636 959</a> or email <a href=\"mailto:contact@eidcymru.org\">contact@eidcymru.org</a>.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/&amp;/app/sheep-servicesquot;#Topics%22\"><strong>Return to menu</strong></a></p>\n<p><strong>Step 2 - Login to EIDCymru</strong></p>\n<p><strong>The first page you will see is the Dashboard. The Dashboard can be considered the homepage of your EIDCymru account - from here you can navigate to all of its available functions:</strong></p>\n<p>The Dashboard options allow you to:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>create your own movements</li>\n<li>accept movements created on your behalf by other Keepers or by a Livestock Market</li>\n<li>view a record of movements reported electronically</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The Dashboard also lets you Set up a Movement for a future planned movement up to 3 days ahead.</p>\n<p>You can also Report a Movement that has already taken place, for either animals which have left or arrived at your holding. (See Step 4)</p>\n<p>If you start a movement but don’t have all the information available at the time, the part-completed movement will remain in your Draft Movements for you to complete at a later stage. Movements saved to Draft will remain for 30 days after which they will be deleted automatically.</p>\n<p>From the Dashboard you can also Accept Movements onto your holding. (See Step 3)</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/&amp;/app/sheep-servicesquot;#Topics%22\"><strong>Return to menu</strong></a></p>\n<p><strong>Step 3 - Accepting a Movement</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Livestock Markets produce a movement licence for Keepers to accompany animals to the destination. The movement is created in EIDCymru waiting to be accepted by you the Keeper. From your online EIDCymru Dashboard use the Accept Movements feature to check and accept the movements.</strong></p>\n<p>If you have movements waiting to be accepted, the number outstanding will show on your Dashboard against Accept Movements. Movement should be accepted within 3 days of the movement. The option will also be coloured Green or Red. The colour Red indicates they are late i.e. over 3 days old but still require to be accepted.</p>\n<p>By selecting Accept Movements you can verify the animals reported onto your holding against the Licence provided by the Livestock Market. You need to accept, reject or query the entire movement, or any individual animals shown that do not match your records.</p>\n<p>When you Accept the movement on your EIDCymru account, you do not need to send the paper licence into EIDCymru. Once accepted, the movement will then appear within the Movement Records of your EIDCymru account.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/&amp;/app/sheep-servicesquot;#Topics%22\"><strong>Return to menu</strong></a></p>\n<p><strong>Step 4 - Reporting a Movement</strong></p>\n<p><strong>There are two ways that you can create a movement in EIDCymru:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>You can set up a Movement for a future planned movement up to 3 days ahead.</li>\n<li>You can Report a Movement that has already taken place, for animals which have either left or arrived at your holding.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>If you have ear tag numbers which have been read electronically, the tag numbers can be inputted into the movement as a file upload. There are other options to enter ear tag numbers as Flock/Slaughter tags and also individually or as groups within a specific range</p>\n<p>Wider industry legislation information such as Transport details and FCI (Food Chain Information) can be inputted when you report a movement electronically.</p>\n<p>Remember, reporting a movement via EIDCymru replaces the need to complete an AML1 Form. Once the move has been created, there are options to view and print the information as a paper licence.</p>\n<p>It is possible to print multiple copies for you own records and to accompany the animals to their Destination. Once reported, the movement will appear within the Movement Records of your EIDCymru account.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/&amp;/app/sheep-servicesquot;#Topics%22\"><strong>Return to menu</strong></a></p>\n<p><strong>Step 5 - Enter Tag Details</strong></p>\n<p><strong>There are several ways that you can report the tag numbers of the animals that are arriving or departing:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Individual Tags - Tell us the Tag prefix e.g. UK, the 6-digit flock number and the individual ID.</li>\n<li>Tag Range - This can be used for entering a range of tag numbers, where you know the animals have been tagged in order. You just need to provide the start and end number. You are able to exclude certain Tag Numbers.</li>\n<li>Slaughter Tags - For animal which have been slaughter tagged, tell us the Prefix ( eg UK ) the 6 digit flock number and the quantity of animals moving.</li>\n<li>Upload tags via a file. Tags recorded on an EID reader can be uploaded to the EIDCymru website.  By following the instructions which come with your EID reader, you should be able to produce a text or csv file. This can be uploaded to the movement from the Animals page when creating your movement.</li>\n<li>Freestyle tags – this allows you to input a tag number of an animal which is not EID tagged. Given that all recent animal identification regulations have required animals to be tagged with an EID tag, this would typically be reserved for animals which were born and tagged pre-2010.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/&amp;/app/sheep-servicesquot;#Topics%22\"><strong>Return to menu</strong></a></p>\n<p><strong>Step 6 - Movement Records</strong></p>\n<p><strong>View all of your on / off movements, send us a query on a movement and print out any movements for your records.</strong></p>\n<p>All movements reported against your holding will show in Movement Records. For example, when you send animals to a market, details sent to EIDCymru by them will automatically display in your Movement Records, as will paper licences sent to the EIDCymru office.</p>\n<p>The Movement Records page allows you to filter and sort your movements. You can enter a date range or filter a specific CPH from where animals were moved to or from. You can also filter by Species.</p>\n<p>You can use the EIDCymru Movement Records option to ensure the accuracy and completeness of your holding register. You are able to request a correction to any information that has been recorded via a query by opening the movement and selecting Query.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/&amp;/app/sheep-servicesquot;#Topics%22\"><strong>Return to menu</strong></a></p>\n<p><strong>Step 7 - Return or Forward a Movement</strong></p>\n<p>Within a movement showing in Movement Records, it is possible to ‘Return’ a movement - this can create a copy of a movement going in the opposite direction. For example when animals return from Tack. The tag numbers and quantities have already been captured therefore ‘returning’ a movement can save a lot of time.</p>\n<p>Within a movement showing in Movement Records, it is possible to ‘Forward’ a movement - this can create a copy of a movement which starts on from the last destination. The tag numbers and quantities have already been captured, so using the Forward movement function can save a lot of time.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/&amp;/app/sheep-servicesquot;#Topics%22\"><strong>Return to menu</strong></a></p>\n<p><strong>Step 8 - Your Account</strong></p>\n<p><strong>This sections contains all the important information that we need, it also lets you do the following:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Change your details</strong><br />If you need to update the information you gave us when you registered, you can do this here. For example, you can change your username, email address, contact details and your CRN number.</li>\n<li><strong>Change your password</strong><br />If you need to change your password you can do this here. Remember to make a strong password - at least 12 characters, lowercase and uppercase, numbers and punctuation.</li>\n<li><strong>Default options</strong><br />Amend your default options, these are the settings the system will remember when you set up a move, e.g. a default vehicle registration number, they can be change when you report the move.</li>\n<li><strong>View and amend your holdings</strong><br />Add, edit and delete your flock numbers and tell us which holding is your primary holding.</li>\n<li><strong>View and complete your Annual Inventory.</strong><br />The Sheep and Goats Annual Inventory is used to record the number of sheep and goats that you keep on individual premises and the reason they are kept e.g. meat, dairy, wool, breeding etc. View past inventories here and complete yours before the deadline.</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- /wp:freeform --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"33.33%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:33.33%\"><!-- wp:html -->\n<div id=\"related-content-container\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:html --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','User guide','','inherit','closed','closed','','190-revision-v1','','','2026-04-28 09:28:30','2026-04-28 09:28:30','',190,'http://localhost:8081/?p=205',0,'revision','',0),(207,3,'2026-04-28 09:33:26','2026-04-28 09:33:26','<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"66.66%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\"><!-- wp:freeform -->\n<h1 id=\"Topics\">EIDCymru User guide</h1>\n<p><strong>Choose a topic from the list below to get easy step-by-step instructions:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Step 1 <a href=\"#Create\"><strong>Register for an account</strong></a></li>\n<li>Step 2 <a href=\"#Login\"><strong>Log in to EIDCymru</strong></a></li>\n<li>Step 3 <a href=\"#Accept\"><strong>Accepting a movement</strong></a></li>\n<li>Step 4 <a href=\"#Report\"><strong>Reporting a movement</strong></a></li>\n<li>Step 5 <a href=\"#Tags\"><strong>Enter tag details</strong></a></li>\n<li>Step 6 <a href=\"#Records\"><strong>Movement records</strong></a></li>\n<li>Step 7 <a href=\"#Returns\"><strong>Return or forward a movement</strong></a></li>\n<li>Step 8 <a href=\"#Account\"><strong>Your account</strong></a></li>\n</ul>\n<p id=\"Create\"><strong>Step 1 - Register for an account</strong></p>\n<p><strong>To register for an account with EIDCymru you will need:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>your contact details - email address, contact address and telephone numbers</li>\n<li>the CPH number of your main holding</li>\n<li>your CRN (Customer Reference Number), this is issued by <a href=\"https://www.gov.wales/rural-payments-wales-rpw-online\">Rural Payments Wales</a> (RPW), Phone: <a href=\"tel:+443000625004\">0300 062 5004</a></li>\n<li>a Flock / Herd number for your main holding, provided by <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/guidance/get-help-with-animal-and-plant-health\">Animal Plant Health Agency (APHA)</a> Phone: <a href=\"tel:+4403003038268\">0300 303 8268</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Go to the EIDCymru website </strong><a href=\"http://www.eidcymru.org/\"><strong>www.eidcymru.org</strong></a><strong> choose your language, click on the Register link on the next page and follow these steps:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Enter your details, choose a unique username (this will be shown on your movement records, and seen by others) and a strong password.</li>\n<li>Tell us the details of your main CPH in the correct format e.g. 11/222/3333. Also tell us the CRN associated with this CPH.</li>\n<li>Select your main species - choose sheep, goats or deer, and tell us your main flock / herd number.</li>\n<li>Check that the details on the summary page are correct before selecting Create your EIDCymru Account.</li>\n<li>Check your email, we will have sent you an email to verify your email address, click on the link provided.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>If you need further help, look at the Help &amp; Information section on the top toolbar of the website, or contact EIDCymru on <a href=\"tel:+4401970636959\">01970 636 959</a> or email <a href=\"mailto:contact@eidcymru.org\">contact@eidcymru.org</a>.</p>\n<p><a href=\"#Topics\"><strong>Return to menu</strong></a></p>\n<p id=\"Login\"><strong>Step 2 - Login to EIDCymru</strong></p>\n<p><strong>The first page you will see is the Dashboard. The Dashboard can be considered the homepage of your EIDCymru account - from here you can navigate to all of its available functions:</strong></p>\n<p>The Dashboard options allow you to:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>create your own movements</li>\n<li>accept movements created on your behalf by other Keepers or by a Livestock Market</li>\n<li>view a record of movements reported electronically</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The Dashboard also lets you Set up a Movement for a future planned movement up to 3 days ahead.</p>\n<p>You can also Report a Movement that has already taken place, for either animals which have left or arrived at your holding. (See Step 4)</p>\n<p>If you start a movement but do not have all the information available at the time, the part-completed movement will remain in your Draft Movements for you to complete at a later stage. Movements saved to Draft will remain for 30 days after which they will be deleted automatically.</p>\n<p>From the Dashboard you can also Accept Movements onto your holding. (See Step 3)</p>\n<p><a href=\"#Topics\"><strong>Return to menu</strong></a></p>\n<p id=\"Accept\"><strong>Step 3 - Accepting a Movement</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Livestock Markets produce a movement licence for Keepers to accompany animals to the destination. The movement is created in EIDCymru waiting to be accepted by you the Keeper. From your online EIDCymru Dashboard use the Accept Movements feature to check and accept the movements.</strong></p>\n<p>If you have movements waiting to be accepted, the number outstanding will show on your Dashboard against Accept Movements. Movement should be accepted within 3 days of the movement. The option will also be coloured Green or Red. The colour Red indicates they are late i.e. over 3 days old but still require to be accepted.</p>\n<p>By selecting Accept Movements you can verify the animals reported onto your holding against the Licence provided by the Livestock Market. You need to accept, reject or query the entire movement, or any individual animals shown that do not match your records.</p>\n<p>When you Accept the movement on your EIDCymru account, you do not need to send the paper licence into EIDCymru. Once accepted, the movement will then appear within the Movement Records of your EIDCymru account.</p>\n<p><a href=\"#Topics\"><strong>Return to menu</strong></a></p>\n<p id=\"Report\"><strong>Step 4 - Reporting a Movement</strong></p>\n<p><strong>There are two ways that you can create a movement in EIDCymru:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>You can set up a Movement for a future planned movement up to 3 days ahead.</li>\n<li>You can Report a Movement that has already taken place, for animals which have either left or arrived at your holding.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>If you have ear tag numbers which have been read electronically, the tag numbers can be inputted into the movement as a file upload. There are other options to enter ear tag numbers as Flock/Slaughter tags and also individually or as groups within a specific range</p>\n<p>Wider industry legislation information such as Transport details and FCI (Food Chain Information) can be inputted when you report a movement electronically.</p>\n<p>Remember, reporting a movement via EIDCymru replaces the need to complete an AML1 Form. Once the move has been created, there are options to view and print the information as a paper licence.</p>\n<p>It is possible to print multiple copies for you own records and to accompany the animals to their Destination. Once reported, the movement will appear within the Movement Records of your EIDCymru account.</p>\n<p><a href=\"#Topics\"><strong>Return to menu</strong></a></p>\n<p id=\"Tags\"><strong>Step 5 - Enter Tag Details</strong></p>\n<p><strong>There are several ways that you can report the tag numbers of the animals that are arriving or departing:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Individual Tags - Tell us the Tag prefix e.g. UK, the 6-digit flock number and the individual ID.</li>\n<li>Tag Range - This can be used for entering a range of tag numbers, where you know the animals have been tagged in order. You just need to provide the start and end number. You are able to exclude certain Tag Numbers.</li>\n<li>Slaughter Tags - For animal which have been slaughter tagged, tell us the Prefix (eg UK) the 6 digit flock number and the quantity of animals moving.</li>\n<li>Upload tags via a file. Tags recorded on an EID reader can be uploaded to the EIDCymru website. By following the instructions which come with your EID reader, you should be able to produce a text or csv file. This can be uploaded to the movement from the Animals page when creating your movement.</li>\n<li>Freestyle tags - this allows you to input a tag number of an animal which is not EID tagged. Given that all recent animal identification regulations have required animals to be tagged with an EID tag, this would typically be reserved for animals which were born and tagged pre-2010.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"#Topics\"><strong>Return to menu</strong></a></p>\n<p id=\"Records\"><strong>Step 6 - Movement Records</strong></p>\n<p><strong>View all of your on / off movements, send us a query on a movement and print out any movements for your records.</strong></p>\n<p>All movements reported against your holding will show in Movement Records. For example, when you send animals to a market, details sent to EIDCymru by them will automatically display in your Movement Records, as will paper licences sent to the EIDCymru office.</p>\n<p>The Movement Records page allows you to filter and sort your movements. You can enter a date range or filter a specific CPH from where animals were moved to or from. You can also filter by Species.</p>\n<p>You can use the EIDCymru Movement Records option to ensure the accuracy and completeness of your holding register. You are able to request a correction to any information that has been recorded via a query by opening the movement and selecting Query.</p>\n<p><a href=\"#Topics\"><strong>Return to menu</strong></a></p>\n<p id=\"Returns\"><strong>Step 7 - Return or Forward a Movement</strong></p>\n<p>Within a movement showing in Movement Records, it is possible to \'Return\' a movement - this can create a copy of a movement going in the opposite direction. For example when animals return from Tack. The tag numbers and quantities have already been captured therefore \'returning\' a movement can save a lot of time.</p>\n<p>Within a movement showing in Movement Records, it is possible to \'Forward\' a movement - this can create a copy of a movement which starts on from the last destination. The tag numbers and quantities have already been captured, so using the Forward movement function can save a lot of time.</p>\n<p><a href=\"#Topics\"><strong>Return to menu</strong></a></p>\n<p id=\"Account\"><strong>Step 8 - Your Account</strong></p>\n<p><strong>This sections contains all the important information that we need, it also lets you do the following:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Change your details</strong><br />If you need to update the information you gave us when you registered, you can do this here. For example, you can change your username, email address, contact details and your CRN number.</li>\n<li><strong>Change your password</strong><br />If you need to change your password you can do this here. Remember to make a strong password - at least 12 characters, lowercase and uppercase, numbers and punctuation.</li>\n<li><strong>Default options</strong><br />Amend your default options, these are the settings the system will remember when you set up a move, e.g. a default vehicle registration number, they can be change when you report the move.</li>\n<li><strong>View and amend your holdings</strong><br />Add, edit and delete your flock numbers and tell us which holding is your primary holding.</li>\n<li><strong>View and complete your Annual Inventory.</strong><br />The Sheep and Goats Annual Inventory is used to record the number of sheep and goats that you keep on individual premises and the reason they are kept e.g. meat, dairy, wool, breeding etc. View past inventories here and complete yours before the deadline.</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- /wp:freeform --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"33.33%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:33.33%\"><!-- wp:html -->\n<div id=\"related-content-container\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:html --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','User guide','','inherit','closed','closed','','190-revision-v1','','','2026-04-28 09:33:26','2026-04-28 09:33:26','',190,'http://localhost:8081/?p=207',0,'revision','',0),(209,3,'2026-04-28 10:23:07','2026-04-28 10:23:07','<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"66.66%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\"><!-- wp:freeform -->\n<h1 id=\"Topics\"><strong>Canllaw i ddefnyddwyr EIDCymru</strong></h1>\n<p><strong>Dewiswch bwnc o’r rhestr isod i gael cyfarwyddiadau cam wrth gam hawdd:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Cam 1 <a href=\"#Create\"><strong>Cofrestru ar gyfer cyfrif</strong></a></li>\n<li>Cam 2 <a href=\"#Login\"><strong>Mewngofnodi i EIDCymru</strong></a></li>\n<li>Cam 3 <a href=\"#Accept\"><strong>Derbyn symudiad</strong></a></li>\n<li>Cam 4 <a href=\"#Report\"><strong>Rhoi gwybod am symudiad</strong></a></li>\n<li>Cam 5 <a href=\"#Tags\"><strong>Rhoi manylion tag</strong></a></li>\n<li>Cam 6 <a href=\"#Records\"><strong>Cofnodion symudiadau</strong></a></li>\n<li>Cam 7 <a href=\"#Returns\"><strong>Dychwelyd neu anfon symudiad ymlaen</strong></a></li>\n<li>Cam 8 <a href=\"#Account\"><strong>Eich cyfrif</strong></a></li>\n</ul>\n<p id=\"Create\"><strong>Cam 1 - Cofrestru ar gyfer cyfrif</strong></p>\n<p><strong>I gofrestru ar gyfer cyfrif gydag EIDCymru bydd angen y canlynol arnoch:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>eich manylion cyswllt - cyfeiriad e-bost, cyfeiriad a rhifau ffôn</li>\n<li>rhif Daliad (CPH) eich prif ddaliad</li>\n<li>eich Cyfeirnod Cwsmer (CRN). Cyhoeddir hwn gan <a href=\"https://llyw.cymru/taliadau-gwledig-cymru-ar-lein\">Taliadau Gwledig Cymru (RPW)</a>, Ffôn:<a href=\"tel:+443000625004\"> 0300 062 5004</a></li>\n<li>eich rhif Diadell / Buches ar gyfer eich prif ddaliad, a ddarperir gan yr <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/guidance/get-help-with-animal-and-plant-health.cy\">Asiantaeth Anifeiliaid a Phlanhigion (APHA)</a> Ffôn: <a href=\"tel:+4403003038268\">0300 303 8268</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Ewch i wefan EIDCymru </strong><a href=\"http://www.eidcymru.org/\">www.eidcymru.org</a><strong> – dewiswch eich iaith a chliciwch ar y ddolen Cofrestru ar y dudalen ganlynol.</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Rhowch eich manylion - dewiswch enw defnyddiwr unigryw (bydd hyn yn cael ei ddangos ar eich cofnodion symud, a bydd yn cael ei weld gan eraill) a chyfrinair cryf.</li>\n<li>Dywedwch wrthym fanylion eich prif ddaliad yn y fformat cywir e.e. 11/222/3333. Hefyd, dywedwch wrthym y CRN sy’n gysylltiedig â’r CPH hwn.</li>\n<li>Dewiswch eich prif rywogaeth - dewiswch ddefaid, geifr neu geirw, a dywedwch wrthym eich prif rif diadell/buches.</li>\n<li>Gwnewch yn siŵr fod y manylion ar y dudalen grynodeb yn gywir cyn dewis Creu eich Cyfrif EIDCymru.</li>\n<li>Gwiriwch eich e-bost - byddwn wedi anfon e-bost atoch i wneud yn siŵr bod eich cyfeiriad e-bost yn gywir. Cliciwch ar y ddolen a fydd yn yr e-bost.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Os oes angen mwy o gymorth arnoch, edrychwch ar yr adran Cymorth a Gwybodaeth ar y bar offer ar frig y wefan, neu cysylltwch ag EIDCymru ar <a href=\"tel:+4401970636959\">01970 636 959</a> neu e-bostiwch <a href=\"mailto:cymorth@eidcymru.org\">cymorth@eidcymru.org</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"#Topics\"><strong>Dewislen</strong></a></p>\n<p id=\"Login\"><strong>Cam 2 - Mewngofnodi i EIDCymru</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Y dudalen gyntaf a welwch chi yw’r Dangosfwrdd. Gellir ystyried y Dangosfwrdd yn hafan eich cyfrif EIDCymru - o’r fan hon gallwch lywio i’r holl swyddogaethau sydd ar gael:</strong></p>\n<p>Mae’r opsiynau Dangosfwrdd yn eich galluogi i:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>greu eich symudiadau eich hun.</li>\n<li>derbyn symudiadau a grëwyd ar eich rhan gan Geidwaid eraill neu gan Farchnad Da Byw.</li>\n<li>gweld cofnod o’r symudiadau a adroddwyd yn electronig.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Mae’r Dangosfwrdd hefyd yn gadael i chi Greu Symudiad ar gyfer symudiad a gynlluniwyd yn y dyfodol hyd at 3 diwrnod ymlaen llaw.</p>\n<p>Gallwch hefyd Roi Gwybod am Symudiad sydd eisoes wedi digwydd, ar gyfer anifeiliaid sydd wedi gadael neu wedi cyrraedd eich daliad. Gweler Cam 4.</p>\n<p>Os byddwch yn dechrau symudiad ond nad yw’r holl wybodaeth ar gael ar y pryd, bydd y symudiad wedi’i ran-gwblhau yn aros yn eich Symudiadau Drafft i chi eu cwblhau’n ddiweddarach. Bydd symudiadau a arbedir fel Drafft yn parhau am 30 diwrnod ac ar ôl hynny byddant yn cael eu dileu’n awtomatig.</p>\n<p>O’r Dangosfwrdd gallwch hefyd Dderbyn Symudiadau i’ch daliad. Gweler Cam 3 am ragor o wybodaeth.</p>\n<p><a href=\"#Topics\"><strong>Dewislen</strong></a></p>\n<p id=\"Accept\"><strong>Cam 3 - Derbyn Symudiad</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Mae Marchnadoedd Da Byw yn cynhyrchu trwydded symud i Geidwaid fynd gydag anifeiliaid i ben y daith. Mae’r symudiad yn cael ei greu yn EIDCymru ac yn aros i gael eu derbyn gennych chi’r Ceidwad. O’ch Dangosfwrdd EIDCymru ar-lein defnyddiwch Derbyn Symudiadau i wirio a derbyn y symudiadau.</strong></p>\n<p>Os oes gennych symudiadau sy’n aros i gael eu derbyn, bydd y rhif sydd ar ôl yn ymddangos ar eich Dangosfwrdd yn erbyn Derbyn Symudiadau. Dylid derbyn symudiad o fewn 3 diwrnod i’r symudiad. Bydd yr opsiwn hefyd yn cael ei liwio’n Wyrdd neu’n Goch. Mae’r lliw Coch yn dangos eu bod yn hwyr h.y. dros 3 diwrnod oed ond bod angen eu derbyn o hyd.</p>\n<p>Drwy ddewis Derbyn Symudiadau gallwch wirio’r anifeiliaid a adroddwyd ar eich daliad yn erbyn y Drwydded a ddarparwyd gan y Farchnad Da Byw. Mae angen i chi dderbyn, gwrthod neu wneud ymholiad am y symudiad cyfan, neu unrhyw anifeiliaid unigol a ddangosir nad ydynt yn cyfateb i’ch cofnodion chi.</p>\n<p>Pan fyddwch yn Derbyn y symudiad ar eich cyfrif EIDCymru, nid oes angen i chi anfon y drwydded bapur i EIDCymru. Ar ôl ei dderbyn, bydd y symudiad wedyn yn ymddangos o fewn Cofnodion Symud eich cyfrif EIDCymru.</p>\n<p><a href=\"#Topics\"><strong>Dewislen</strong></a></p>\n<p id=\"Report\"><strong>Cam 4 - Rhoi Gwybod am Symudiad</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Mae ddau ffordd y gallwch greu symudiad yn EIDCymru:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Gallwch greu Symudiad ar gyfer symudiad sydd wedi’i gynllunio yn y dyfodol hyd at 3 diwrnod ymlaen llaw.</li>\n<li>Gallwch Roi Gwybod am Symudiad sydd eisoes wedi digwydd, ar gyfer anifeiliaid sydd naill ai wedi gadael neu wedi cyrraedd eich daliad.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Os oes gennych rifau tagiau clust sydd wedi’u darllen yn electronig, gellir mewnbynnu rhifau’r tagiau i’r symudiad drwy uwchlwytho ffeil. Mae opsiynau eraill i nodi rhifau tagiau clust fel tagiau Diadell/Lladd a hefyd yn unigol neu fel grwpiau o fewn cyfres benodol.</p>\n<p>Gellir mewnbynnu gwybodaeth ehangach sydd ynghlwm wrth ddeddfwriaeth y diwydiant megis manylion Cludiant a Gwybodaeth am y Gadwyn Fwyd (FCI) pan fyddwch yn rhoi gwybod am symudiad yn electronig.</p>\n<p>Cofiwch, mae adrodd am symudiad drwy EIDCymru yn disodli’r angen i lenwi Ffurflen AML1. Unwaith y bydd y symudiad wedi’i greu, mae opsiynau i weld ac argraffu’r wybodaeth fel trwydded bapur.</p>\n<p>Mae’n bosibl argraffu nifer o gopïau ar gyfer eich cofnodion eich hun ac i fynd gyda’r anifeiliaid i ben y daith. Ar ôl ei dderbyn, bydd y symudiad yn ymddangos o fewn Cofnodion Symud eich cyfrif EIDCymru.</p>\n<p><a href=\"#Topics\"><strong>Dewislen</strong></a></p>\n<p id=\"Tags\"><strong>Cam 5 - Rhoi Manylion Tagiau</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Mae sawl ffordd y gallwch roi gwybod am rifau tagiau’r anifeiliaid sy’n cyrraedd neu’n gadael:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Tagiau Unigol - Dywedwch wrthym y rhagddodiad Tag ee UK, rhif y ddiadell 6 digid a’r ID unigol.</li>\n<li>Ystod Tagiau - Gellir defnyddio hwn ar gyfer rhoi cyfres o rifau tagiau, lle rydych chi’n gwybod bod yr anifeiliaid wedi’u tagio mewn trefn. Mae angen i chi ddarparu’r rhifau dechrau a gorffen. Gallwch eithrio rhai Rhifau Tagiau.</li>\n<li>Tagiau Lladd - Ar gyfer anifeiliaid sydd wedi’u tagio, dywedwch wrthym y Rhagddodiad ( ee UK ) rhif y ddiadell 6 digid a faint o anifeiliaid sy’n symud.</li>\n<li>Uwchlwytho tagiau mewn ffeil. Gellir uwchlwytho tagiau a recordiwyd ar ddarllenydd EID i wefan EIDCymru. Drwy ddilyn y cyfarwyddiadau sy’n dod gyda’ch darllenydd EID, dylech allu cynhyrchu ffeil destun neu csv. Gellir uwchlwytho hwn i’r symudiad o’r dudalen Anifeiliaid wrth greu eich symudiad.</li>\n<li>Tagiau rhydd – mae hyn yn eich galluogi i fewnbynnu rhif tag anifail nad yw wedi’i dagio gyda thag EID. O ystyried bod yr holl reoliadau adnabod anifeiliaid diweddar wedi ei gwneud yn ofynnol i anifeiliaid gael eu tagio â thag EID, byddai hyn fel arfer yn cael ei gadw ar gyfer anifeiliaid a gafodd eu geni a’u tagio cyn 2010.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"#Topics\"><strong>Dewislen</strong></a></p>\n<p id=\"Records\"><strong>Cam 6 - Cofnodion Symud</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Gweld eich holl symudiadau i mewn / oddi ar ddaliad, anfon ymholiad atom am symudiad ac argraffu unrhyw symudiadau ar gyfer eich cofnodion.</strong></p>\n<p>Bydd yr holl symudiadau a adroddir yn erbyn eich daliad yn ymddangos yn y Cofnodion Symud. Er enghraifft, pan fyddwch yn anfon anifeiliaid i’r farchnad, bydd y manylion y maent yn eu hanfon at EIDCymru yn cael eu harddangos yn awtomatig yn eich Cofnodion Symud, yn ogystal â thrwyddedau papur a anfonir i swyddfa EIDCymru.</p>\n<p>Mae’r dudalen Cofnodion Symud yn caniatáu i chi hidlo a didoli eich symudiadau. Gallwch nodi ystod dyddiad neu hidlo CPH penodol o ble y symudwyd anifeiliaid i mewn iddi neu oddi arno. Gallwch hefyd hidlo yn ôl Rhywogaethau.</p>\n<p>Gallwch ddefnyddio opsiwn Cofnodion Symud EIDCymru i sicrhau cywirdeb a chyflawnrwydd eich cofrestr daliad. Gallwch ofyn am gywiriad i unrhyw wybodaeth sydd wedi’i chofnodi drwy ymholiad drwy agor y symudiad a dewis Ymholiad.</p>\n<p><a href=\"#Topics\"><strong>Dewislen</strong></a></p>\n<p id=\"Returns\"><strong>Cam 7 - Dychwelyd neu Anfon Symudiad Ymlaen</strong></p>\n<p>O fewn symudiad sy’n ymddangos yn eich Cofnodion Symud, mae’n bosibl ’Dychwelyd’ symudiad - gall hyn greu copi o symudiad sy’n mynd i’r cyfeiriad arall. Er enghraifft, pan fydd anifeiliaid yn dychwelyd o Dir pori ar rent. Mae’r rhifau tagiau a’r niferoedd eisoes wedi’u cofnodi felly gall ’dychwelyd’ symudiad arbed llawer o amser.</p>\n<p>O fewn symudiad sy’n ymddangos yn eich Cofnodion Symud, mae’n bosibl anfon symudiad ’Ymlaen’ - gall hyn greu copi o symudiad sy’n dechrau o’r gyrchfan pen y daith ddiwethaf. Mae’r rhifau tagiau a’r niferoedd eisoes wedi’u cofnodi felly gall ’dychwelyd’ symudiad arbed llawer o amser.</p>\n<p id=\"Account\"><strong>Cam 8 - Eich Cyfrif</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Mae’r adrannau hyn yn cynnwys yr holl wybodaeth bwysig sydd ei hangen arnom, mae hefyd yn gadael i chi wneud y canlynol:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Newid eich manylion</strong> - os oes angen i chi ddiweddaru’r wybodaeth a roddoch i ni pan wnaethoch chi gofrestru, gallwch wneud hyn yma. Er enghraifft, gallwch newid eich enw defnyddiwr, cyfeiriad e-bost, manylion cyswllt a’ch rhif CRN.</li>\n<li><strong>Newid eich cyfrinair</strong> - os oes angen i chi newid eich cyfrinair gallwch wneud hyn yma. Cofiwch wneud cyfrinair cryf - o leiaf 12 nod, llythrennau bach a mawr, rhifau ac atalnodi.</li>\n<li><strong>Dewisiadau diofyn</strong> - newid eich opsiynau diofyn, dyma’r gosodiadau y bydd y system yn eu cofio pan fyddwch yn sefydlu symudiad, e.e. rhif cofrestru cerbyd diofyn, gellir eu newid pan fyddwch yn rhoi gwybod am y symudiad.</li>\n<li><strong>Gweld a diwygio eich daliadau</strong> - ychwanegu, golygu a dileu eich rhifau diadell. Dywedwch wrthym ba ddaliad yw eich prif ddaliad yma.</li>\n<li><strong>Gweld a chwblhau eich Rhestr Flynyddol</strong> - defnyddir y Rhestr Flynyddol Defaid a Geifr i gofnodi nifer y defaid a’r geifr yr ydych yn eu cadw ar safleoedd unigol a’r rheswm dros eu cadw e.e. cig, llaeth, gwlân, bridio ac ati. Edrychwch ar restrau’r gorffennol yma a chwblhewch eich Rhestr Flynyddol cyn y dyddiad cau.</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- /wp:freeform --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"33.33%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:33.33%\"><!-- wp:html -->\n<div id=\"related-content-container\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:html --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->','Canllaw i ddefnyddwyr EIDCymru','','inherit','closed','closed','','193-revision-v1','','','2026-04-28 10:23:07','2026-04-28 10:23:07','',193,'http://localhost:8081/?p=209',0,'revision','',0),(210,3,'2026-04-28 10:25:07','2026-04-28 10:25:07','<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"66.66%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\"><!-- wp:freeform -->\n<div>\n<h1>Registration guide</h1>\n<p><strong>Getting registered with EIDCymru</strong></p>\n<p><strong>By registering with EIDCymru, you will be able to:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Access your sheep and goat movement history</li>\n<li>Accept movements on to your farm from markets and from other farmers</li>\n<li>Complete your Annual Inventory</li>\n<li>Report your movements electronically</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>To start using EIDCymru, you will need to register for an account.<br />Please have the following information to hand to help you complete the registration process:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Your email</li>\n<li>Primary Farm CPH</li>\n<li>RPW Customer Reference Number (CRN)</li>\n<li>Your six-digit Flock Number</li>\n</ul>\n<p> </p>\n<p><strong>Step 1: Register</strong></p>\n<p>To get registered, open the EIDCymru website, found at <a href=\"https://www.eidcymru.org/\">www.eidcymru.org</a>, choose your preferred language, then scroll down and click on the link <a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/account/register/security\">Register</a>.</p>\n<p><strong> </strong></p>\n<p><strong> </strong></p>\n<p><strong> </strong></p>\n<p><strong> </strong></p>\n<p><strong> </strong></p>\n<p><strong> </strong></p>\n<p><strong> </strong></p>\n<p><strong> </strong></p>\n<p><strong> </strong></p>\n<p><strong>Step 2: Create your account</strong></p>\n<p>You will need to create a username that is unique to your account. Please choose your username carefully as it will be seen by others. Your chosen username may already be in use by another account, therefore please make sure it is unique enough.</p>\n<p>You will also need a valid email address. This email address can only be used against <strong>one EIDCymru account</strong>.</p>\n<p>You will then need to create a password that contains at least 12 characters, and one each of the following:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>uppercase letter (A–Z)</li>\n<li>lowercase letter (a–z)</li>\n<li>number (0–9)</li>\n<li>special character (!*£$%^&amp;,.?)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Once completed, select the <strong>Save and continue</strong> button.</p>\n<p><strong>Step 3: Enter Primary CPH</strong></p>\n<p>You will then be directed to the page to enter your <strong>Primary CPH</strong> – please make sure it is entered in the format <strong>CC/PPP/HHHH</strong>.</p>\n<p>You can then enter your Farm Address details. Please note that where the Contact Address is different to the Farm Address, you can tick the box and continue to a separate page to enter a different Contact Address.</p>\n<p>Otherwise, once completed, select the <strong>Save and continue</strong> button.</p>\n<p><strong>Step 4: Enter RPW Customer Reference Number (CRN)</strong></p>\n<p>The page will continue so that you can enter a few further details. Here you will need to enter your <strong>RPW Customer Reference Number (CRN)</strong>. Your CRN will start with <strong>A</strong> followed by a <strong>7-digit number</strong>.</p>\n<p>Your Primary Farm CPH and CRN must correspond to the same RPW Account.</p>\n<p>If you do not know your CRN, please log in to your RPW Online Account or contact Rural Payments Wales on <a href=\"tel:+4403000625004\">0300 062 5004</a>. Once completed, select the <strong>Save and continue</strong> button.</p>\n<p><strong>Step 5: Enter six-digit Flock Number</strong></p>\n<p>You will then reach the page that asks for your <strong>six-digit Flock Number</strong>, which is provided by APHA. Your flock number will start with a <strong>7</strong> followed by a <strong>5-digit number</strong> and must be your Primary Flock Number that matches your Primary CPH.</p>\n<p>Again, once completed, select the <strong>Save and continue</strong> button where you will be guided to a Summary Page and, if happy with the information provided, you can select <strong>Create your EIDCymru account</strong>.</p>\n<p>A message will be sent to your chosen email address, and you will need to click on the link provided in the email to activate your account and complete the registration.</p>\n<p>After activating your account, your setup is complete, and you can start to use EIDCymru.</p>\n<p>If you require assistance, please use the <a href=\"https://www.eidcymru.org/app/sheep/contact\">Contact us</a> button on the EIDCymru website; send an email to <a href=\"mailto:contact@eidcymru.org\">contact@eidcymru.org</a> or phone <a href=\"tel:+441970636959\">01970 636959</a>.</p>\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:freeform --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"33.33%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:33.33%\"><!-- wp:html -->\n<div id=\"related-content-container\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:html --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->','Registration guide','','inherit','closed','closed','','199-revision-v1','','','2026-04-28 10:25:07','2026-04-28 10:25:07','',199,'http://localhost:8081/?p=210',0,'revision','',0),(211,3,'2026-04-28 10:26:00','2026-04-28 10:26:00','<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"66.66%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\"><!-- wp:freeform -->\n<p><strong>Getting registered with EIDCymru</strong></p>\n<p><strong>By registering with EIDCymru, you will be able to:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Access your sheep and goat movement history</li>\n<li>Accept movements on to your farm from markets and from other farmers</li>\n<li>Complete your Annual Inventory</li>\n<li>Report your movements electronically</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>To start using EIDCymru, you will need to register for an account.<br />Please have the following information to hand to help you complete the registration process:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Your email</li>\n<li>Primary Farm CPH</li>\n<li>RPW Customer Reference Number (CRN)</li>\n<li>Your six-digit Flock Number</li>\n</ul>\n<p> </p>\n<p><strong>Step 1: Register</strong></p>\n<p>To get registered, open the EIDCymru website, found at <a href=\"https://www.eidcymru.org/\">www.eidcymru.org</a>, choose your preferred language, then scroll down and click on the link <a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/account/register/security\">Register</a>.</p>\n<p><strong> </strong></p>\n<p><strong> </strong></p>\n<p><strong> </strong></p>\n<p><strong> </strong></p>\n<p><strong> </strong></p>\n<p><strong> </strong></p>\n<p><strong> </strong></p>\n<p><strong> </strong></p>\n<p><strong> </strong></p>\n<p><strong>Step 2: Create your account</strong></p>\n<p>You will need to create a username that is unique to your account. Please choose your username carefully as it will be seen by others. Your chosen username may already be in use by another account, therefore please make sure it is unique enough.</p>\n<p>You will also need a valid email address. This email address can only be used against <strong>one EIDCymru account</strong>.</p>\n<p>You will then need to create a password that contains at least 12 characters, and one each of the following:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>uppercase letter (A–Z)</li>\n<li>lowercase letter (a–z)</li>\n<li>number (0–9)</li>\n<li>special character (!*£$%^&amp;,.?)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Once completed, select the <strong>Save and continue</strong> button.</p>\n<p><strong>Step 3: Enter Primary CPH</strong></p>\n<p>You will then be directed to the page to enter your <strong>Primary CPH</strong> – please make sure it is entered in the format <strong>CC/PPP/HHHH</strong>.</p>\n<p>You can then enter your Farm Address details. Please note that where the Contact Address is different to the Farm Address, you can tick the box and continue to a separate page to enter a different Contact Address.</p>\n<p>Otherwise, once completed, select the <strong>Save and continue</strong> button.</p>\n<p><strong>Step 4: Enter RPW Customer Reference Number (CRN)</strong></p>\n<p>The page will continue so that you can enter a few further details. Here you will need to enter your <strong>RPW Customer Reference Number (CRN)</strong>. Your CRN will start with <strong>A</strong> followed by a <strong>7-digit number</strong>.</p>\n<p>Your Primary Farm CPH and CRN must correspond to the same RPW Account.</p>\n<p>If you do not know your CRN, please log in to your RPW Online Account or contact Rural Payments Wales on <a href=\"tel:+4403000625004\">0300 062 5004</a>. Once completed, select the <strong>Save and continue</strong> button.</p>\n<p><strong>Step 5: Enter six-digit Flock Number</strong></p>\n<p>You will then reach the page that asks for your <strong>six-digit Flock Number</strong>, which is provided by APHA. Your flock number will start with a <strong>7</strong> followed by a <strong>5-digit number</strong> and must be your Primary Flock Number that matches your Primary CPH.</p>\n<p>Again, once completed, select the <strong>Save and continue</strong> button where you will be guided to a Summary Page and, if happy with the information provided, you can select <strong>Create your EIDCymru account</strong>.</p>\n<p>A message will be sent to your chosen email address, and you will need to click on the link provided in the email to activate your account and complete the registration.</p>\n<p>After activating your account, your setup is complete, and you can start to use EIDCymru.</p>\n<p>If you require assistance, please use the <a href=\"https://www.eidcymru.org/app/sheep/contact\">Contact us</a> button on the EIDCymru website; send an email to <a href=\"mailto:contact@eidcymru.org\">contact@eidcymru.org</a> or phone <a href=\"tel:+441970636959\">01970 636959</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:freeform --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"33.33%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:33.33%\"><!-- wp:html -->\n<div id=\"related-content-container\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:html --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->','Registration guide','','inherit','closed','closed','','199-revision-v1','','','2026-04-28 10:26:00','2026-04-28 10:26:00','',199,'http://localhost:8081/?p=211',0,'revision','',0),(212,3,'2026-04-28 10:26:22','2026-04-28 10:26:22','<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"66.66%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\"><!-- wp:freeform -->\n<h1>Registration guide</h1>\n<p><strong>Getting registered with EIDCymru</strong></p>\n<p><strong>By registering with EIDCymru, you will be able to:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Access your sheep and goat movement history</li>\n<li>Accept movements on to your farm from markets and from other farmers</li>\n<li>Complete your Annual Inventory</li>\n<li>Report your movements electronically</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>To start using EIDCymru, you will need to register for an account.<br />Please have the following information to hand to help you complete the registration process:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Your email</li>\n<li>Primary Farm CPH</li>\n<li>RPW Customer Reference Number (CRN)</li>\n<li>Your six-digit Flock Number</li>\n</ul>\n<p> </p>\n<p><strong>Step 1: Register</strong></p>\n<p>To get registered, open the EIDCymru website, found at <a href=\"https://www.eidcymru.org/\">www.eidcymru.org</a>, choose your preferred language, then scroll down and click on the link <a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/account/register/security\">Register</a>.</p>\n<p><strong> </strong></p>\n<p><strong> </strong></p>\n<p><strong> </strong></p>\n<p><strong> </strong></p>\n<p><strong> </strong></p>\n<p><strong> </strong></p>\n<p><strong> </strong></p>\n<p><strong> </strong></p>\n<p><strong> </strong></p>\n<p><strong>Step 2: Create your account</strong></p>\n<p>You will need to create a username that is unique to your account. Please choose your username carefully as it will be seen by others. Your chosen username may already be in use by another account, therefore please make sure it is unique enough.</p>\n<p>You will also need a valid email address. This email address can only be used against <strong>one EIDCymru account</strong>.</p>\n<p>You will then need to create a password that contains at least 12 characters, and one each of the following:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>uppercase letter (A–Z)</li>\n<li>lowercase letter (a–z)</li>\n<li>number (0–9)</li>\n<li>special character (!*£$%^&amp;,.?)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Once completed, select the <strong>Save and continue</strong> button.</p>\n<p><strong>Step 3: Enter Primary CPH</strong></p>\n<p>You will then be directed to the page to enter your <strong>Primary CPH</strong> – please make sure it is entered in the format <strong>CC/PPP/HHHH</strong>.</p>\n<p>You can then enter your Farm Address details. Please note that where the Contact Address is different to the Farm Address, you can tick the box and continue to a separate page to enter a different Contact Address.</p>\n<p>Otherwise, once completed, select the <strong>Save and continue</strong> button.</p>\n<p><strong>Step 4: Enter RPW Customer Reference Number (CRN)</strong></p>\n<p>The page will continue so that you can enter a few further details. Here you will need to enter your <strong>RPW Customer Reference Number (CRN)</strong>. Your CRN will start with <strong>A</strong> followed by a <strong>7-digit number</strong>.</p>\n<p>Your Primary Farm CPH and CRN must correspond to the same RPW Account.</p>\n<p>If you do not know your CRN, please log in to your RPW Online Account or contact Rural Payments Wales on <a href=\"tel:+4403000625004\">0300 062 5004</a>. Once completed, select the <strong>Save and continue</strong> button.</p>\n<p><strong>Step 5: Enter six-digit Flock Number</strong></p>\n<p>You will then reach the page that asks for your <strong>six-digit Flock Number</strong>, which is provided by APHA. Your flock number will start with a <strong>7</strong> followed by a <strong>5-digit number</strong> and must be your Primary Flock Number that matches your Primary CPH.</p>\n<p>Again, once completed, select the <strong>Save and continue</strong> button where you will be guided to a Summary Page and, if happy with the information provided, you can select <strong>Create your EIDCymru account</strong>.</p>\n<p>A message will be sent to your chosen email address, and you will need to click on the link provided in the email to activate your account and complete the registration.</p>\n<p>After activating your account, your setup is complete, and you can start to use EIDCymru.</p>\n<p>If you require assistance, please use the <a href=\"https://www.eidcymru.org/app/sheep/contact\">Contact us</a> button on the EIDCymru website; send an email to <a href=\"mailto:contact@eidcymru.org\">contact@eidcymru.org</a> or phone <a href=\"tel:+441970636959\">01970 636959</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:freeform --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"33.33%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:33.33%\"><!-- wp:html -->\n<div id=\"related-content-container\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:html --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->','Registration guide','','inherit','closed','closed','','199-revision-v1','','','2026-04-28 10:26:22','2026-04-28 10:26:22','',199,'http://localhost:8081/?p=212',0,'revision','',0),(214,3,'2026-04-28 10:28:14','2026-04-28 10:28:14','','reg-guide-1','','inherit','closed','closed','','reg-guide-1','','','2026-04-28 10:28:14','2026-04-28 10:28:14','',199,'http://localhost:8081/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/reg-guide-1.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(215,3,'2026-04-28 10:28:14','2026-04-28 10:28:14','','reg-guide-2','','inherit','closed','closed','','reg-guide-2','','','2026-04-28 10:28:14','2026-04-28 10:28:14','',199,'http://localhost:8081/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/reg-guide-2.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(216,3,'2026-04-28 10:28:14','2026-04-28 10:28:14','','reg-guide-3','','inherit','closed','closed','','reg-guide-3','','','2026-04-28 10:28:14','2026-04-28 10:28:14','',199,'http://localhost:8081/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/reg-guide-3.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(217,3,'2026-04-28 10:28:14','2026-04-28 10:28:14','','reg-guide-4','','inherit','closed','closed','','reg-guide-4','','','2026-04-28 10:28:14','2026-04-28 10:28:14','',199,'http://localhost:8081/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/reg-guide-4.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(218,3,'2026-04-28 10:28:14','2026-04-28 10:28:14','','reg-guide-5','','inherit','closed','closed','','reg-guide-5','','','2026-04-28 10:28:14','2026-04-28 10:28:14','',199,'http://localhost:8081/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/reg-guide-5.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(219,3,'2026-04-28 10:28:1