count, therefore please make sure it is unique enough.</p>\n<p>You will also need a valid email address. This email address can only be used against <strong>one EIDCymru account</strong>.</p>\n<p>You will then need to create a password that contains at least 12 characters, and one each of the following:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>uppercase letter (A–Z)</li>\n<li>lowercase letter (a–z)</li>\n<li>number (0–9)</li>\n<li>special character (!*£$%^&amp;,.?)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Once completed, select the <strong>Save and continue</strong> button.</p>\n<p><strong>Step 3: Enter Primary CPH</strong></p>\n<p>You will then be directed to the page to enter your <strong>Primary CPH</strong> – please make sure it is entered in the format <strong>CC/PPP/HHHH</strong>.</p>\n<p>You can then enter your Farm Address details. Please note that where the Contact Address is different to the Farm Address, you can tick the box and continue to a separate page to enter a different Contact Address.</p>\n<p>Otherwise, once completed, select the <strong>Save and continue</strong> button.</p>\n<p><strong>Step 4: Enter RPW Customer Reference Number (CRN)</strong></p>\n<p>The page will continue so that you can enter a few further details. Here you will need to enter your <strong>RPW Customer Reference Number (CRN)</strong>. Your CRN will start with <strong>A</strong> followed by a <strong>7-digit number</strong>.</p>\n<p>Your Primary Farm CPH and CRN must correspond to the same RPW Account.</p>\n<p>If you do not know your CRN, please log in to your RPW Online Account or contact Rural Payments Wales on <a href=\"tel:+4403000625004\">0300 062 5004</a>. Once completed, select the <strong>Save and continue</strong> button.</p>\n<p><strong>Step 5: Enter six-digit Flock Number</strong></p>\n<p>You will then reach the page that asks for your <strong>six-digit Flock Number</strong>, which is provided by APHA. Your flock number will start with a <strong>7</strong> followed by a <strong>5-digit number</strong> and must be your Primary Flock Number that matches your Primary CPH.</p>\n<p>Again, once completed, select the <strong>Save and continue</strong> button where you will be guided to a Summary Page and, if happy with the information provided, you can select <strong>Create your EIDCymru account</strong>.</p>\n<p>A message will be sent to your chosen email address, and you will need to click on the link provided in the email to activate your account and complete the registration.</p>\n<p>After activating your account, your setup is complete, and you can start to use EIDCymru.</p>\n<p>If you require assistance, please use the <a href=\"https://www.eidcymru.org/app/sheep/contact\">Contact us</a> button on the EIDCymru website; send an email to <a href=\"mailto:contact@eidcymru.org\">contact@eidcymru.org</a> or phone <a href=\"tel:+441970636959\">01970 636959</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:freeform --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"33.33%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:33.33%\"><!-- wp:html -->\n<div id=\"related-content-container\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:html --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->','Registration guide','','inherit','closed','closed','','199-revision-v1','','','2026-04-28 10:28:55','2026-04-28 10:28:55','',199,'http://localhost:8081/?p=220',0,'revision','',0),(222,3,'2026-04-28 10:30:37','2026-04-28 10:30:37','<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"66.66%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\"><!-- wp:freeform -->\n<h1>Registration guide</h1>\n<p><strong>Getting registered with EIDCymru</strong></p>\n<p><strong>By registering with EIDCymru, you will be able to:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Access your sheep and goat movement history</li>\n<li>Accept movements on to your farm from markets and from other farmers</li>\n<li>Complete your Annual Inventory</li>\n<li>Report your movements electronically</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>To start using EIDCymru, you will need to register for an account.<br />Please have the following information to hand to help you complete the registration process:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Your email</li>\n<li>Primary Farm CPH</li>\n<li>RPW Customer Reference Number (CRN)</li>\n<li>Your six-digit Flock Number</li>\n</ul>\n<p> </p>\n<p><strong>Step 1: Register</strong></p>\n<p>To get registered, open the EIDCymru website, found at <a href=\"https://www.eidcymru.org/\">www.eidcymru.org</a>, choose your preferred language, then scroll down and click on the link <a href=\"https://wgmswdevep-ang8dsg3cwaxg6dd.a02.azurefd.net/app/sheep/account/register/security\">Register</a>.</p>\n<p><strong><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-214\" src=\"http://localhost:8081/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/reg-guide-1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"237\" height=\"203\" /> </strong></p>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-215\" src=\"http://localhost:8081/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/reg-guide-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"146\" height=\"99\" /></p>\n<p><strong>Step 2: Create your account</strong></p>\n<p>You will need to create a username that is unique to your account. Please choose your username carefully as it will be seen by others. Your chosen username may already be in use by another account, therefore please make sure it is unique enough.</p>\n<p>You will also need a valid email address. This email address can only be used against <strong>one EIDCymru account</strong>.</p>\n<p>You will then need to create a password that contains at least 12 characters, and one each of the following:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>uppercase letter (A–Z)</li>\n<li>lowercase letter (a–z)</li>\n<li>number (0–9)</li>\n<li>special character (!*£$%^&amp;,.?)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Once completed, select the <strong>Save and continue</strong> button.</p>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-216\" src=\"http://localhost:8081/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/reg-guide-3-147x300.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"147\" height=\"300\" /></p>\n<p><strong>Step 3: Enter Primary CPH</strong></p>\n<p>You will then be directed to the page to enter your <strong>Primary CPH</strong> – please make sure it is entered in the format <strong>CC/PPP/HHHH</strong>.</p>\n<p>You can then enter your Farm Address details. Please note that where the Contact Address is different to the Farm Address, you can tick the box and continue to a separate page to enter a different Contact Address.</p>\n<p>Otherwise, once completed, select the <strong>Save and continue</strong> button.</p>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-217\" src=\"http://localhost:8081/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/reg-guide-4-147x300.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"147\" height=\"300\" /></p>\n<p><strong>Step 4: Enter RPW Customer Reference Number (CRN)</strong></p>\n<p>The page will continue so that you can enter a few further details. Here you will need to enter your <strong>RPW Customer Reference Number (CRN)</strong>. Your CRN will start with <strong>A</strong> followed by a <strong>7-digit number</strong>.</p>\n<p>Your Primary Farm CPH and CRN must correspond to the same RPW Account.</p>\n<p>If you do not know your CRN, please log in to your RPW Online Account or contact Rural Payments Wales on <a href=\"tel:+4403000625004\">0300 062 5004</a>. Once completed, select the <strong>Save and continue</strong> button.</p>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-218\" src=\"http://localhost:8081/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/reg-guide-5-124x300.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"124\" height=\"300\" /></p>\n<p><strong>Step 5: Enter six-digit Flock Number</strong></p>\n<p>You will then reach the page that asks for your <strong>six-digit Flock Number</strong>, which is provided by APHA. Your flock number will start with a <strong>7</strong> followed by a <strong>5-digit number</strong> and must be your Primary Flock Number that matches your Primary CPH.</p>\n<p>Again, once completed, select the <strong>Save and continue</strong> button where you will be guided to a Summary Page and, if happy with the information provided, you can select <strong>Create your EIDCymru account</strong>.</p>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-219\" src=\"http://localhost:8081/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/reg-guide-6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"156\" height=\"163\" /></p>\n<p>A message will be sent to your chosen email address, and you will need to click on the link provided in the email to activate your account and complete the registration.</p>\n<p>After activating your account, your setup is complete, and you can start to use EIDCymru.</p>\n<p>If you require assistance, please use the <a href=\"https://www.eidcymru.org/app/sheep/contact\">Contact us</a> button on the EIDCymru website; send an email to <a href=\"mailto:contact@eidcymru.org\">contact@eidcymru.org</a> or phone <a href=\"tel:+441970636959\">01970 636959</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:freeform --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"33.33%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:33.33%\"><!-- wp:html -->\n<div id=\"related-content-container\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:html --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->','Registration guide','','inherit','closed','closed','','199-revision-v1','','','2026-04-28 10:30:37','2026-04-28 10:30:37','',199,'http://localhost:8081/?p=222',0,'revision','',0),(224,3,'2026-04-28 10:49:04','2026-04-28 10:49:04','','reg-guide-1-cy','','inherit','closed','closed','','reg-guide-1-cy','','','2026-04-28 10:49:04','2026-04-28 10:49:04','',201,'http://localhost:8081/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/reg-guide-1-cy.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(225,3,'2026-04-28 10:49:04','2026-04-28 10:49:04','','reg-guide-2-cy','','inherit','closed','closed','','reg-guide-2-cy','','','2026-04-28 10:49:04','2026-04-28 10:49:04','',201,'http://localhost:8081/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/reg-guide-2-cy.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(226,3,'2026-04-28 10:49:04','2026-04-28 10:49:04','','reg-guide-3-cy','','inherit','closed','closed','','reg-guide-3-cy','','','2026-04-28 10:49:04','2026-04-28 10:49:04','',201,'http://localhost:8081/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/reg-guide-3-cy.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(227,3,'2026-04-28 10:49:04','2026-04-28 10:49:04','','reg-guide-4-cy','','inherit','closed','closed','','reg-guide-4-cy','','','2026-04-28 10:49:04','2026-04-28 10:49:04','',201,'http://localhost:8081/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/reg-guide-4-cy.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(228,3,'2026-04-28 10:49:04','2026-04-28 10:49:04','','reg-guide-5-cy','','inherit','closed','closed','','reg-guide-5-cy','','','2026-04-28 10:49:04','2026-04-28 10:49:04','',201,'http://localhost:8081/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/reg-guide-5-cy.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(229,3,'2026-04-28 10:49:04','2026-04-28 10:49:04','','reg-guide-6-cy','','inherit','closed','closed','','reg-guide-6-cy','','','2026-04-28 10:49:04','2026-04-28 10:49:04','',201,'http://localhost:8081/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/reg-guide-6-cy.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(230,3,'2026-04-28 10:50:53','2026-04-28 10:50:53','<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"66.66%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\"><!-- wp:freeform -->\n<h1>Cofrestru gydag EIDCymru</h1>\n<p><strong>Drwy gofrestru gyda EIDCymru byddwch yn medru:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Cael mynediad i’ch symudiadau defaid a geifr</li>\n<li>Derbyn symudiadau ymlaen o farchnadoedd a gan ffermwyr eraill</li>\n<li>Cwblhau eich Stocrestr Flynyddol</li>\n<li>Adrodd am eich symudiadau’n electroneg</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Cyn defnyddio EIDCymru, bydd angen cofrestru am gyfrif.<br />Bydd angen yr wybodaeth ganlynol arnoch er mwyn eich cynorthwyo i gwblhau’r broses gofrestru:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Eich cyfeiriad e-bost</li>\n<li>Rhif eich Prif Ddaliad (CPH)</li>\n<li>Rhif Cyfeirnod Cwsmer (CRN) RPW</li>\n<li>Rhif diadell chwe digid</li>\n</ul>\n<p> </p>\n<p><strong>Cam 1: Cofrestru</strong></p>\n<p>I gofrestru, agorwch wefan EIDCymru <a href=\"https://www.eidcymru.org/\">www.eidcymru.org</a>, dewiswch eich iaith, yna pwyso’r ddolen <a href=\"https://www.eidcymru.org/app/sheep/cy/account/register/security\">Creu eich cyfrif</a>.</p>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-224\" src=\"http://localhost:8081/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/reg-guide-1-cy-300x257.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"257\" /></p>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-225\" src=\"http://localhost:8081/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/reg-guide-2-cy-300x134.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"134\" /></p>\n<p><strong>Cam 2: Creu eich cyfrif</strong></p>\n<p>Byddwch yn creu enw defnyddiwr unigryw i’r cyfrif. Dewiswch eich enw defnyddiwr yn ofalus gan y caiff ei weld gan ddefnyddwyr eraill. Mae’n bosib y bydd yr enw defnyddiwr o’ch dewis wedi’i gymryd yn barod (e.e. Jones neu Tygwyn) felly gwnewch yn siŵr ei fod yn hollol unigryw.</p>\n<p>Bydd angen cyfeiriad e-bost dilys. Dim ond ar gyfer <strong>un cyfrif EIDCymru</strong> y bydd yr e-bost hwn yn medru cael ei ddefnyddio.</p>\n<p>Yna fydd angen i chi creu cyfrinair, sydd yn cynnwys o leiaf 12 nod, ac un yr un o’r canlynol:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Prif lythyren (A-Z)</li>\n<li>Llythyren fach (a-z)</li>\n<li>Rhif (0-9)</li>\n<li>Nod arbennig (!*£$%^&amp;,.?)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Pwyswch <strong>Cadw a pharhau</strong> i symud ‘mlaen.</p>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-226\" src=\"http://localhost:8081/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/reg-guide-3-cy-147x300.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"147\" height=\"300\" /></p>\n<p><strong>Cam 3: Cofnodi eich Prif Daliad (CPH)</strong></p>\n<p>Byddwch yn cael eich cyfeirio at dudalen i ychwanegu eich <strong>Prif ddaliad (CPH)</strong> – yn y fformat <strong>CC/PPP/HHHH</strong>.</p>\n<p>Ychwanegwch gyfeiriad eich fferm. Nodwch fod modd rhoi cyfeiriad cyswllt arall os yw’n wahanol i gyfeiriad y fferm, drwy roi tic yn y blwch.</p>\n<p>Pwyswch <strong>Cadw a pharhau</strong>.</p>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-227\" src=\"http://localhost:8081/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/reg-guide-4-cy-147x300.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"147\" height=\"300\" /></p>\n<p><strong>Cam 4: Cofnodi eich Rhif Cyfeirnod Cwsmer (CRN)</strong></p>\n<p>Bydd y dudalen nesaf yn gofyn am fwy o fanylion. Yma bydd angen ichi nodi eich <strong>rhif Cyfeirnod Cwsmer (CRN)</strong>. Bydd eich CRN yn cychwyn gydag <strong>A</strong> <strong>yna rhif 7 digid</strong>.</p>\n<p>Bydd angen i CPH eich Prif Ddaliad a’r CRN gyfateb i’r un cyfrif ar RPW.</p>\n<p>Os nad ydych yn gwybod eich CRN, mewn gofnodwch i’ch cyfrif RPW Ar-lein neu cysylltwch gyda RPW ar <a href=\"tel:+4403000625004\">0300 062 5004</a>. Pwyswch <strong>Cadw a pharhau</strong>.</p>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-228\" src=\"http://localhost:8081/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/reg-guide-5-cy-125x300.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"125\" height=\"300\" /></p>\n<p><strong>Cam 5: Cofnodi rif chwe digid eich Diadell</strong></p>\n<p>Bydd y dudalen nesaf yn gofyn am rif <strong>chwe digid eich Diadell</strong>, sydd wedi ei ddarparu gan APHA. Bydd eich rhif diadell yn cychwyn gyda <strong>7</strong> yna <strong>rhif 5 digid</strong> a rhaid iddo fod yn brif rif eich diadell sy’n cyfateb i’ch prif CPH.</p>\n<p>Pwyswch <strong>Cadw a pharhau</strong> yna gwirio fod y manylion i gyd yn gywir cyn pwyso <strong>Creu eich cyfrif EID Cymru</strong> ar y dudalen Grynodeb.</p>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-229\" src=\"http://localhost:8081/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/reg-guide-6-cy.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"155\" height=\"161\" /></p>\n<p>Bydd neges yn cael ei hanfon i’ch cyfeiriad e-bost a bydd angen i chi bwyso ar y ddolen yn yr e-bost i gadarnhau eich cyfrif ac i orffen y broses gofrestru.</p>\n<p>Rydych nawr yn barod i ddefnyddio eich cyfrif EIDCymru.</p>\n<p>Os oes angen unrhyw gymorth arnoch, defnyddiwch y botwm <a href=\"https://www.eidcymru.org/app/sheep/cy/contact\">Cysylltwch â ni</a> ar y wefan, anfonwch e-bost at <a href=\"mailto:cymorth@eidcymru.org\">cymorth@eidcymru.org</a> neu ffoniwch <a href=\"tel:+441970636959\">01970 636959</a>.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<!-- /wp:freeform --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"33.33%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:33.33%\"><!-- wp:html -->\n<div id=\"related-content-container\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:html --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Cofrestru gydag EIDCymru','','inherit','closed','closed','','201-revision-v1','','','2026-04-28 10:50:53','2026-04-28 10:50:53','',201,'http://localhost:8081/?p=230',0,'revision','',0),(232,3,'2026-04-28 10:59:04','2026-04-28 10:59:04','<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"66.66%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\"><!-- wp:freeform -->\n<h1>Frequently Asked Questions</h1>\n<p><strong>Contents</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"#getting-started\">Getting started</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#report-movements\">How do I use EIDCymru to report movements?</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#other-movements\">Can I report other types of movements? (e.g. cross-border, market, tack, shows, exports)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#readers\">What equipment do I need? Do I need a stick reader?</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#cphs\">CPHs, tCPHs and TLAs</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#qus\">Can I report moves to/from Quarantine Units (QUs)?</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#queries\">Other Queries</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#stray-sheep\">I have found a sheep, what shall I do?</a></li>\n</ol>\n<p id=\"getting-started\"><strong>Getting started</strong></p>\n<p><strong>What is Eidcymru?</strong></p>\n<p>EIDCymru is the electronic sheep and goat movement recording system for Wales. It provides Wales with a modern robust movement reporting and traceability system that is able to respond quickly and effectively in a disease outbreak.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>As a keeper, you can report and record your sheep movements electronically preventing the need for you to post the paper movement licence.</li>\n<li>It enables sheep/goat and deer movements to be traced between a keepers\' holding, markets, abattoirs and collection centres</li>\n<li>It also allows you to submit your Annual Inventory online</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>How Do I Register?</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"/en/information/registration-guide\">Click here</a> for our guide to getting registered.</p>\n<p><strong>I am trying to register on EIDCymru but it says my e-mail might be in use. Why?</strong></p>\n<p>If this message appears, it is likely you have already attempted to register for EIDCymru using this email address. To rectify this, either attempt to reset your password or contact EIDCymru on <a href=\"tel:+441970636959\">01970 636 959</a> or email <a href=\"mailto:contact@eidcymru.org\">contact@eidcymru.org</a>.</p>\n<p id=\"report-movements\"><strong>How do I use EIDCymru to report movements?</strong></p>\n<p><strong>How do I report movements (including tack and cross border) electronically?</strong></p>\n<p>Full details of how to create movements on the website are contained in the <a href=\"/en/information/user-guide\">User Guide</a> – including tack moves and cross-border moves.</p>\n<p><strong>Who is required to report electronically to EIDCymru?</strong></p>\n<p>All livestock markets, abattoirs, collection centres and assembly centres in Wales are mandated to report moves electronically.</p>\n<p><strong>Who is responsible for reporting a movement?</strong></p>\n<p>It is the responsibility of the receiving keeper to report a movement.</p>\n<p><strong>How long do I have to report a movement?</strong></p>\n<p>Movements must be reported within 3 days of the move.</p>\n<p><strong>If I create a movement electronically on EIDCymru, do I still need to use a paper movement form?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes. Once you create the movement electronically, the EIDCymru system will allow you to print a movement form which contains the details you have entered. The paper license will need to accompany the animals in-transit due to the Welfare of Animals (Transport) Order (WATO) legislation. The receiving keeper will need to retain the paper copy of the movement for 3 years.</p>\n<p id=\"other-movements\"><strong>Can I report other types of movements? (e.g. cross-border, market, tack, shows, exports)</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Cross-border</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Can I create a movement from one English holding to the other on EIDCymru?</strong></p>\n<p>No. Movements within England are managed by <a href=\"https://livestockinformation.org.uk/\">LI Ltd</a></p>\n<p><strong>Can I register an English CPH on my EIDCymru account?</strong></p>\n<p>No, English CPHs cannot be registered on EIDCymru but you can create an account on <a href=\"https://livestockinformation.org.uk/\">LI Ltd</a> for your English holdings.</p>\n<p><strong>Do records to/from England show on my account?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes, all records created by <a href=\"https://livestockinformation.org.uk/\">LI Ltd</a> from Welsh holdings will show on your account.</p>\n<p><strong>Can I accept records for animals purchased from an English market?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes, the records will show on your \'accept moves\' exactly the same as purchases from a Welsh market.</p>\n<p><strong>How can I change the details or a movement?</strong></p>\n<p>To change the details of a movement you will need to contact EIDCymru on <a href=\"tel:+441970636959\">01970 636 959</a> or email <a href=\"mailto:contact@eidcymru.org\">contact@eidcymru.org</a></p>\n<p><strong>I regularly send animals to an English abattoir but these records are not showing on my account. Who should I contact?</strong></p>\n<p>If you can\'t see the records, contact the abattoir, they are responsible for uploading the movements to <a href=\"https://livestockinformation.org.uk/\">LI Ltd</a> which in turn should show on your account.</p>\n<p><strong>Tack</strong></p>\n<p><strong>I\'m moving animals to tack, do I need to record all individual tag numbers on the licence?... as I still have ownership of these animals.</strong></p>\n<p>Yes. All individual tag numbers are needed on the licence (AML1) when animals move between two different (Welsh) CPHs even if you own both and it is a movement within ownership. <a href=\"https://www.gov.wales/sheep-and-goat-identification-guidance-keepers\">Click here for more information</a>.</p>\n<p><strong>Can I use EIDCymru to create a movement from tack to tack when both the holdings are not registered on my account?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes. This is possible, and the details will be viewable in the Tack tab under Movement Records. For details of how to create this, <a href=\"/en/information/user-guide#Records\">Click here for the User Guide</a>.</p>\n<p><strong>Vet</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Do I need to report movements to a vet?</strong></p>\n<p>No, you should record the move in the holding register but you do not have to fill in a movement document or report electronically.</p>\n<p><strong>Imports and exports:</strong></p>\n<p><strong>What are the rules for Imports &amp; Exports?</strong></p>\n<p>Current requirements for exports and imports can be found in the <a href=\"https://www.gov.wales/sites/default/files/publications/2025-07/sheep-and-goat-identification-guidance-keepers.pdf\">Sheep and Goat Keepers Guidance 2021</a> (Please refer to Section Four: Movements and Movement Reporting)</p>\n<p><strong>Shows</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Do I need to report movements to Showground electronically?</strong></p>\n<p>All movements to shows and exhibitions must be reported and can be done electronically. However, some shows cannot report moves electronically. Therefore, keepers can continue with paper movement licences, and these must then be sent to EIDCymru.</p>\n<p id=\"readers\"><strong>Do I need a stick reader?</strong></p>\n<p><strong>What equipment do I need to use EIDCymru?</strong></p>\n<p>EIDCymru is a web-based service that you can access using any standard internet web browser and internet connection. The quickest and most accurate way to record the individual animal number is by using an EID reader to record EID tags electronically with the ability to download the numbers onto a device such as your computer or mobile phone/tablet:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>An EID reader is a portable device such as a stick reader or a static panel reader which fits into a sheep race.</li>\n<li>There are several makes and models available, and a supplier of EID equipment would be able to provide advice on which EID reader would best suit your farm business needs.</li>\n</ul>\n<p id=\"cphs\"><strong>CPHs, tCPHs and TLAs</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Why is my CPH number not recognised?</strong></p>\n<p>Check you are using the correct format – it should look like this 12/345/6789 (with the forward slashes included). If it\'s a new CPH it may be that our system doesn\'t recognise it yet so either try again a couple of days or contact us and we can check with RPW on your behalf. If the CPH has been inputted correctly the address should be automatically displayed. If the CPH still isn\'t recognised – contact the Bureau on <a href=\"tel:+441970636959\">01970 636 959</a>.</p>\n<p><strong>I\'ve purchased land and have been issued a new CPH. Do I need to complete a licence for the sheep which occupy the land?</strong></p>\n<p>No movement licence is needed, because the sheep are not physically moving from leaving the land. The sheep tags will need to be individually recorded in your new flock book for the new CPH.</p>\n<p><strong>I rent land under a Temporary CPH (tCPH). Do I need to report movements from my home holding to the tCPH?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes, you must report all movements to/from the tCPH and record in the flock/herd register.</p>\n<p><strong>I rent land under a Temporary Land Association (TLA). Do I need to report movements from my home holding to a Temporary Land Association (TLA)?</strong></p>\n<p>For the duration of the TLA, the land will be treated as part of the tenant\'s permanent CPH for livestock movement reporting purposes.</p>\n<p id=\"qus\"><strong>Can I report moves to/from Quarantine Units (QUs)?</strong></p>\n<p><strong>How do I register for a Quarantine Unit (QU)?</strong></p>\n<p>Contact the <a href=\"https://www.qwfc.co.uk/\">QWFC</a> office on <a href=\"tel:+441970636688\">01970 636 688</a>.</p>\n<p><strong>How do I report movements in/out of a QU?</strong></p>\n<p>Movements <strong>into</strong> a QU need to be reported within 24hrs electronically. Movements <strong>out</strong> of a QU need to be reported electronically or by paper within 3 days.</p>\n<p id=\"queries\"><strong>Other Queries &amp; Useful Links</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>CPH queries – contact via your RPW online account or RPW Customer Contact Centre <a href=\"tel:+44300625004\">03000 625 004</a>.</li>\n<li>Livestock Policy queries – <a href=\"tel:+443000255022\">03000 255 022</a>.</li>\n<li>Flock number queries – <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/guidance/get-help-with-animal-and-plant-health\">Animal Plant Health Agency (APHA)</a> <a href=\"tel:+443003038268\">0300 303 8268</a>.</li>\n<li>Movement licence and Annual Inventory queries – EIDCymru office <a href=\"tel:+441970636959\">01970 636 959</a> or <a href=\"mailto:contact@eidcymru.org\">contact@eidcymru.org</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p id=\"stray-sheep\"><strong>If you\'ve found a stray sheep on your land</strong></p>\n<p><strong>I have a stray sheep on my holding, who should I contact?</strong></p>\n<p>You should contact your local Trading Standards office. They will contact the owner of the animal.</p>\n<!-- /wp:freeform --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"33.33%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:33.33%\"><!-- wp:html -->\n<div id=\"related-content-container\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:html --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','FAQs','','inherit','closed','closed','','197-revision-v1','','','2026-04-28 10:59:04','2026-04-28 10:59:04','',197,'http://localhost:8081/?p=232',0,'revision','',0),(234,3,'2026-04-28 11:02:05','2026-04-28 11:02:05','<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"66.66%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\"><!-- wp:freeform -->\n<h1>Cwestiynau cyffredin</h1>\n<p><strong>Cynnwys</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"#dechrau\">Dechrau</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#defnyddio\">Sut ydw i\'n defnyddio EIDCymru i adrodd am symudiadau?</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#adrodd\">Sut ydw i\'n adrodd am symudiadau eraill (e.e Trawsffinion, Tac, Sioeau)?</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#darllenydd\">Pa offer sydd ei angen i ddefnyddio EID?</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#cphs\">Gwybodaeth am CPHs, tCPHs aTLAs</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#qus\">Sut ydw i\'n cofrestru Uned Gwarantin (QU)?</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#ymholiadau\">Ymholiadau eraill...</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#defaid\">Mae dafad ddieithr ar fy naliad, â phwy ddylwn gysylltu?</a></li>\n</ol>\n<p id=\"dechrau\"><strong>Dechrau</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Beth yw EIDCymru?</strong></p>\n<p>EIDCymru yw\'r system electronig ar gyfer cofnodi symudiadau defaid a geifr yng Nghymru. Mae\'n sicrhau bod gan Gymru system fodern, gadarn, ar gyfer olrhain ac adrodd am symudiadau, sy\'n gallu ymateb yn gyflym ac yn effeithiol os oes achosion o glefyd.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Fel ceidwad, gallwch gofnodi ac adrodd am symudiadau eich defaid yn electronig, gan osgoi\'r angen ichi bostio\'r drwydded symud bapur.</li>\n<li>Mae\'n galluogi olrhain symudiadau defaid/geifr/ceirw rhwng daliad ceidwad, marchnadoedd, lladd-dai a chanolfannau casglu.</li>\n<li>Mae hefyd yn eich galluogi i gyflwyno eich Stocrestr Flynyddol ar-lein.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Sut ydw i\'n cofrestru?</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"/cy/information/registration-guide\">Cliciwch yma</a> i weld ein canllawiau ar gofrestru.</p>\n<p><strong>Rwy\'n ceisio cofrestru gydag EIDCymru ond mae\'n dweud ei bod yn bosibl bod fy nghyfeiriad e-bost eisoes yn cael ei ddefnyddio?</strong></p>\n<p>Os ydych yn gweld y neges hon, mae\'n bosibl eich bod chi eisoes wedi ceisio cofrestru gydag EIDCymru gan ddefnyddio\'r cyfeiriad e-bost hwn. I gywiro hyn, naill ai ceisiwch ailosod eich cyfrinair, neu gysylltu â swyddfa EIDCymru: <a href=\"mailto:cymorth@eidcymru.org\">cymorth@eidcymru.org</a> neu <a href=\"tel:+441970636959\">01970 636 959</a>.</p>\n<p id=\"defnyddio\"><strong>Defnyddio EIDCymru i adrodd am symudiadau</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Sut ydw i\'n adrodd am symudiadau (gan gynnwys tac a thrawsffiniol)?</strong></p>\n<p>Mae manylion llawn ynghylch sut i greu symudiadau ar y wefan yn y <a href=\"/cy/information/user-guide\">Canllawiau i Ddefnyddwyr</a> gan gynnwys symudiadau tac a thrawsffiniol.</p>\n<p><strong>I bwy mae\'r gofyniad i adrodd i EIDCymru yn electronig yn berthnasol?</strong></p>\n<p>Mae\'n rhaid i bob marchnad da byw, lladd-dy, canolfan gasglu a chanolfan grynhoi adrodd am symudiadau\'n electronig. Rydych chi fel ceidwaid yn cael eich annog i adrodd am symudiadau\'n electronig a bydd gwneud hynny\'n fuddiol ichi.</p>\n<p><strong>Pwy sy\'n gyfrifol am adrodd am symudiad?</strong></p>\n<p>Y ceidwad sy\'n derbyn y da byw sy\'n gyfrifol am adrodd am symudiad.</p>\n<p><strong>Faint o amser sydd gennyf i adrodd am symudiad?</strong></p>\n<p>Rhaid adrodd am y symudiad o fewn tri diwrnod.</p>\n<p><strong>Os wy\'n cofnodi symudiad yn electronig ar EIDCymru, oes rhaid imi ddefnyddio ffurflen symud bapur hefyd?</strong></p>\n<p>Oes. Pan fyddwch wedi cofnodi\'r symudiad yn electronig, bydd system EIDCymru yn eich galluogi i argraffu\'r ffurflen symud sy\'n cynnwys y manylion rydych wedi eu mewnbynnu. Bydd rhaid i\'r drwydded bapur fynd gyda\'r anifeiliaid wrth iddynt gael eu cludo, yn unol â deddfwriaeth y Gorchymyn Lles Anifeiliaid (Cludo) (WATO). Hefyd bydd angen i\'r ceidwad sy\'n derbyn anifeiliaid, gadw copi papur o\'r ffurflen symud ar gyfer ei gofnodion ei hun.</p>\n<p><strong>Fel y ceidwad sy\'n derbyn da byw, oes rhaid imi gofnodi ffurflen symud bapur rwyf wedi\'i derbyn yn electronig?</strong></p>\n<p>Oes, yn yr achos hwn, gall y ceidwad sy\'n derbyn y da byw (os yw wedi\'i gofrestru gydag EIDCymru) fewngofnodi i\'w gyfrif a chreu\'r symudiad.</p>\n<p id=\"adrodd\"><strong>Adrodd am symudiadau eraill</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Trawsffiniol</strong></p>\n<p><strong>A gaf greu symudiad o un daliad i\'r llall yn Lloegr ar EIDCymru?</strong></p>\n<p>Na chwech. Rheolir symudiadau yn Lloegr gan <a href=\"https://livestockinformation.org.uk/\">LI Ltd</a>.</p>\n<p><strong>A gaf gofrestru CPH yn Lloegr ar fy nghyfrif EIDCymru?</strong></p>\n<p>Na chewch. Ni ellir cofrestru CPHs yn Lloegr ar EIDCymru, ond cewch greu cyfrif ar <a href=\"https://livestockinformation.org.uk/\">LI Ltd</a> ar gyfer eich daliadau yn Lloegr.</p>\n<p><strong>A yw cofnodion i/o Loegr yn dangos ar fy Nghyfrif?</strong></p>\n<p>Ydynt, bydd pob cofnod a grëir ar <a href=\"https://livestockinformation.org.uk/\">LI Ltd</a> yn dangos ar eich cyfrif.</p>\n<p><strong>A gaf dderbyn cofnodion ar gyfer anifeiliaid a brynwyd mewn marchnad yn Lloegr?</strong></p>\n<p>Cewch. Bydd y cofnodion yn dangos yn eich adran \'Derbyn Symudiadau\', yn union yr un ffordd â da byw rydych wedi eu prynu o farchnad yng Nghymru.</p>\n<p><strong>Sut ydw i\'n newid y manylion?</strong></p>\n<p>I newid manylion symudiad bydd rhaid ichi gysylltu â swyddfa EIDCymru neu greu ymholiad yn eich cofnod symudiadau.</p>\n<p><strong>Rwy\'n anfon anifeiliaid i ladd-dy yn Lloegr yn rheolaidd ond nid yw\'r cofnodion hyn yn ymddangos ar fy nghyfrif. Â phwy ddylwn i gysylltu?</strong></p>\n<p>Os nad ydych yn gweld y cofnodion, cysylltwch â\'r lladd-dy. Nhw sy\'n gyfrifol am lanlwytho\'r symudiadau i <a href=\"https://livestockinformation.org.uk/\">LI Ltd</a>, a ddylai yn eu tro ymddangos ar eich cyfrif.</p>\n<p><strong>Tac</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Rwy\'n symud anifeiliaid i dir tac, oes rhaid imi gofnodi rhifau tag unigol ar y drwydded, gan fy mod yn parhau i fod yn berchen ar yr anifeiliaid hyn.</strong></p>\n<p>Oes. Mae angen nodi pob rhif tag ar y drwydded (AML1) pan fydd anifeiliaid yn symud rhwng dau CPH (yng Nghymru), hyd yn oed os mai chi sy\'n berchen ar y ddau CPH ac mae\'r anifeiliaid yn cael eu cludo o fewn eich eiddo. <a href=\"https://llyw.cymru/adnabod-defaid-geifr-canllawiau-i-geidwaid?_ga=2.222631835.149454102.1638258574-1108566482.1629359138\">Adnabod defaid a geifr: canllawiau i geidwaid</a></p>\n<p><strong>A gaf ddefnyddio EIDCymru i gofnodi symudiad rhwng dau ddarn o dir tac, pan nad yw\'r ddau ddaliad wedi eu cofrestru ar fy nghyfrif?</strong></p>\n<p>Cewch. Mae hyn yn bosibl a gallwch weld y manylion o dan y tab \'Tac\' o dan \'Gofnodion Symud\'. Mae gwybodaeth am sut i wneud hyn yma. <a href=\"/cy/information/user-guide\">Canllaw i Ddefnyddwyr</a>.</p>\n<p><strong>Milfeddygon</strong></p>\n<p><strong>A oes rhaid imi adrodd am symudiadau i filfeddyg?</strong></p>\n<p>Nac oes, dylech chi gofnodi\'r symudiad yng nghofrestr y daliad, ond nid oes rhaid ichi gwblhau dogfen symud neu adrodd y symudiad yn electronig.</p>\n<p><strong>Allforion a Mewnforion</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Beth yw\'r rheolau ar gyfer allforion a mewnforion?</strong></p>\n<p>Mae\'r gofynion cyfredol ar gyfer allforion a mewnforion ar gael yn y ddogfen <a href=\"https://llyw.cymru/adnabod-defaid-geifr-canllawiau-i-geidwaid?_ga=2.222631835.149454102.1638258574-1108566482.1629359138\">Adnabod defaid a geifr: canllawiau i geidwaid</a> Gwelwch Adran 4: Symudiadau ac Adrodd am Symudiadau.</p>\n<p><strong>Sioeau</strong></p>\n<p><strong>A oes rhaid imi adrodd yn electronig am symudiadau i feysydd sioeau?</strong></p>\n<p>Rhaid adrodd am symudiadau i sioeau ac arddangosfeydd, ond nid yw\'n orfodol gwneud hynny\'n electronig. Rhaid cyflwyno\'r copi papur gwyn ym maes y sioe, a bydd yn cael ei anfon at y swyddfa. Caiff y ceidwaid naill ai gofnodi symudiad yn electronig ar ei gyfrif EID Cymru neu anfon y drwydded bapur ar gyfer dychwelyd o\'r sioe.</p>\n<p id=\"darllenydd\"><strong>Defnyddio darllenydd EID</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Pa offer sydd ei angen i ddefnyddio EID?</strong></p>\n<p>Mae EIDCymru yn wasanaeth gwe y gellir cael mynediad ato ag unrhyw borwr gwe safonol a chysylltiad â\'r we. Y ffordd gyflymaf a mwyaf cywir o gofnodi rhif unigol anifail yw defnyddio darllenydd EID i gofnodi tagiau EID yn electronig, gyda\'r gallu i lawrlwytho\'r rhifau i ddyfais fel cyfrifiadur neu ffôn symudol/llechen:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Mae darllenydd EID yn ddyfais gludadwy fel darllenydd ffon sy\'n cael ei gosod mewn rhedfa ddefaid.</li>\n<li>Mae nifer o wneuthurwyr yn cynnig nifer o fodelau, a byddai cyflenwr offer EID yn gallu rhoi cyngor ar y darllenydd EID gorau ar gyfer eich busnes fferm.</li>\n</ul>\n<p id=\"cphs\"><strong>CPHs, tCPHs a TLAs</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Pam nad yw fy rhif CPH yn cael ei adnabod?</strong></p>\n<p>Gwiriwch eich bod yn defnyddio\'r fformat cywir – dylai fod ar y ffurf \'12/345/3789\' (gan gynnwys y blaen sleisiau). Os yw\'r CPH yn newydd, mae\'n bosibl nad yw ein system yn ei adnabod eto. Arhoswch am ddiwrnod neu ddau a rhoi cynnig arall arni, neu gysylltu â ni a byddwn ni\'n gwirio gyda RPW ar eich rhan chi. Os yw\'r CPH wedi cael ei fewnbynnu\'n gywir dylai\'r cyfeiriad ymddangos yn awtomatig. Os nad yw\'n CPH yn cael ei adnabod ar ôl hynny, cysylltwch â\'r Swyddfa.</p>\n<p><strong>Rwyf wedi prynu tir ac wedi derbyn rhif CPH newydd. Oes rhaid imi gwblhau trwydded ar gyfer y defaid sy\'n byw ar y tir?</strong></p>\n<p>Nac oes, nid oes angen trwydded symud, oherwydd nad yw\'r defaid yn symud o\'r tir. Bydd angen cofnodi\'r tagiau\'n unigol yn llyfr y ddiadell ar gyfer eich CPH newydd.</p>\n<p><strong>Rwyf wedi llwyddo i roi darn o dir rwy\'n ei rentu o dan CPH dros dro (tCPH). Oes rhaid imi adrodd am symudiadau o fy naliad arferol i\'r tCPH?</strong></p>\n<p>Oes. Mae angen adrodd am symudiadau i/o tCPH.</p>\n<p><strong>Rwy\'n rhentu tir o dan Gysylltiad Tir Dros Dro. A oes angen imi adrodd ar symudiadau o fy mhrif ddaliad i dir o dan Gysylltiad Tir Dros Dro?</strong></p>\n<p>Am gyfnod y Cysylltiad Tir Dros Dro, bydd y tir yn cael ei drin fel rhan o CPH parhaol y tenant at ddibenion symud ac adrodd ar symud da byw.</p>\n<p id=\"qus\"><strong>Unedau Cwarantin (QUs)</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Sut ydw i\'n cofrestru Uned Gwarantin(QU)?</strong></p>\n<p>Cysylltwch â\'r swyddfa <a href=\"https://www.qwfc.co.uk/cy\">QWFC</a>, <a href=\"tel:+441970636688\">01970 636 688</a>.</p>\n<p><strong>Sut ydw i\'n adrodd am symudiadau i mewn i/allan o Uned Gwarantin?</strong></p>\n<p>Mae angen adrodd am symudiadau <strong>i mewn i</strong> Uned Gwarantin yn electronig o fewn 24 awr. Mae angen adrodd am symudiadau <strong>allan o</strong> Uned Gwarantin yn electronig neu ar bapur o fewn tri diwrnod.</p>\n<p id=\"ymholiadau\"><strong>Ymholiadau eraill</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Ymholiadau am CPH – cysylltwch drwy eich cyfrif RPW Ar-lein neu Ganolfan Gyswllt i Gwsmeriaid RPW ar <a href=\"tel:+4403000625004\">03000 625 004</a>.</li>\n<li>Ymholiadau am Bolisïau Da Byw – <a href=\"tel:+443000255022\">03000 255 052</a>.</li>\n<li>Ymholiadau am Rifau Diadell – Yr Asiantaeth Iechyd Anifeiliaid a Phlanhigion <a href=\"tel:+443003038268\">0300 303 8268</a>.</li>\n<li>Ymholiadau am Drwyddedau Symud a\'r Stocrestr Flynyddol – EIDCymru <a href=\"tel:+441970636959\">01970 636 959</a> or <a href=\"mailto:cymorth@eidcymru.org\">cymorth@eidcymru.org</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p id=\"defaid\"><strong>Defaid Dieithr</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Mae dafad ddieithr ar fy naliad, â phwy ddylwn gysylltu?</strong></p>\n<p>Dylech gysylltu â\'ch Swyddfa Safonau Masnach leol. Byddan nhw\'n cysylltu â pherchennog yr anifail.</p>\n<!-- /wp:freeform --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"33.33%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:33.33%\"><!-- wp:html -->\n<div id=\"related-content-container\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:html --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->','Cwestiynau cyffredin','','inherit','closed','closed','','203-revision-v1','','','2026-04-28 11:02:05','2026-04-28 11:02:05','',203,'http://localhost:8081/?p=234',0,'revision','',0),(235,3,'2026-05-14 11:07:17','2026-05-14 11:07:17','<h1>Articles</h1>\n<p> </p>\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<div id=\"eidcymru-articles-container\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Articles','','inherit','closed','closed','','104-revision-v1','','','2026-05-14 11:07:17','2026-05-14 11:07:17','',104,'http://localhost:8081/?p=235',0,'revision','',0),(236,3,'2026-05-14 11:07:28','2026-05-14 11:07:28','<h2>Erthyglau</h2>\n<p> </p>\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<div id=\"eidcymru-articles-container\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Erthyglau','','inherit','closed','closed','','106-revision-v1','','','2026-05-14 11:07:28','2026-05-14 11:07:28','',106,'http://localhost:8081/?p=236',0,'revision','',0),(237,3,'2026-05-14 11:09:32','2026-05-14 11:09:32','\n<h2>Services</h2>\n<p>EIDCymru offers three services; to manage your sheep use out existing sheep service, or to manage your cattle use our new multi-species wales service.<br />If you are a veterinarian or laboratory technician then you can access our BVDCymru service</p>\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<div id=\"services-container\" class=\"services-container\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Services','','inherit','closed','closed','','64-revision-v1','','','2026-05-14 11:09:32','2026-05-14 11:09:32','',64,'http://localhost:8081/?p=237',0,'revision','',0),(238,3,'2026-05-14 11:09:52','2026-05-14 11:09:52','<h2>Gwasanaethau</h2>\n<p>Mae EIDCymru yn cynnig tri gwasanaeth; i reoli eich defaid, defnyddiwch ein gwasanaeth defaid presennol, neu i reoli\'ch gwartheg defnyddiwch ein gwasanaeth aml-rywogaeth newydd Cymru. Os ydych chi\'n filfeddyg neu\'n dechnegydd labordy, yna gallwch gael mynediad i\'n gwasanaeth BVDCymru</p>\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<div id=\"services-container\" class=\"services-container\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Gwasanaethau','','inherit','closed','closed','','66-revision-v1','','','2026-05-14 11:09:52','2026-05-14 11:09:52','',66,'http://localhost:8081/?p=238',0,'revision','',0),(239,3,'2026-05-14 12:33:12','2026-05-14 12:33:12','<div class=\"page_container__LLik5\"><div class=\"page_inner__b9Q2Y\"><div class=\"page_eidWrapper__eFko0\"><svg width=\"392\" height=\"83\" viewBox=\"190 0 392 83\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M289.518 1.79678C330.023 1.79678 363.264 10.1818 389.24 26.9517C361.433 14.9732 328.192 8.98391 289.518 8.98391C250.844 8.98391 217.604 14.9732 189.797 26.9517C215.773 10.1818 249.013 1.79678 289.518 1.79678Z\" fill=\"#B6E62F\" fill-opacity=\"0.2\"></path><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M289.518 16.171C323.532 16.171 352.28 19.7646 375.764 26.9517C351.608 22.482 322.859 20.2471 289.518 20.2471C256.177 20.2471 227.428 22.482 203.273 26.9517C226.756 19.7646 255.505 16.171 289.518 16.171Z\" fill=\"#B6E62F\" fill-opacity=\"0.5\"></path><path d=\"M212.882 70.0745V63.8648H198.091V57.6551H211.329V51.4455H198.091V45.7533H212.106V39.5436H191.364V70.0745H212.882ZM224.913 70.0745V39.5436H218.186V70.0745H224.913ZM242.033 70.0745C244.304 70.0745 246.474 69.7439 248.544 69.0827C250.614 68.4215 252.44 67.4512 254.021 66.1719C255.602 64.8926 256.86 63.3114 257.794 61.4284C258.728 59.5454 259.196 57.3677 259.196 54.8953C259.196 52.1067 258.714 49.7349 257.751 47.78C256.788 45.8251 255.487 44.2368 253.848 43.015C252.21 41.7932 250.291 40.9091 248.092 40.3629C245.892 39.8167 243.571 39.5436 241.127 39.5436H231.036V70.0745H242.033ZM241.257 63.8648H237.764V45.7533H241.731C243.14 45.7533 244.484 45.9329 245.763 46.2923C247.042 46.